<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Luka Asɛmpa No</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luka</para>
  <para style="mt2">Asɛmpa No</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Hann A Ɛwɔ Esum Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1"/>Adamfo pa Teofilo, nnipa pii abɔ mmɔden atwerɛ Yesu ho nsɛm a akɔ so wɔ yɛn mu no. <verse eid="LUK 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2"/>Wɔtwerɛɛ sɛdeɛ nnipa a wɔhunuu saa nneɛma yi firi ahyɛaseɛ no daa no adi kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3"/>Nanso, menyaa adwene bi sɛ, sɛ mehwehwɛ deɛ wɔatwerɛ no nyinaa mu yie na metwerɛ brɛ wo a, ɛyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4"/>Yei bɛboa wo ma woahunu nokorɛ a ɛwɔ deɛ woasua no nyinaa mu.<verse eid="LUK 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Awoɔ Ho Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5"/>Mede mʼasɛm no bɛfiri Yudafoɔ ɔsɔfoɔ Sakaria a ɔtenaa ase Yudeahene Herode berɛ so a na ɔfiri Abia asɔfokuo mu no so. Sakaria yere Elisabet nso, na ɔyɛ Aaron aseni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6"/>Na Sakaria ne ne yere Elisabet som Onyankopɔn nokorɛm a wɔn ho nni asɛm wɔ Onyankopɔn anim. <verse eid="LUK 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7"/>Na wɔnni ba, ɛfiri sɛ, na Elisabet yɛ obonini. Na wɔn baanu nyinaa nso anyinyini.<verse eid="LUK 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8"/>Ɛda bi a ɛduruu Sakaria asɔfokuo so sɛ wɔyɛ asɔredan mu adwuma no, <verse eid="LUK 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9"/>wɔtoo aba yii no sɛ, ɔnkɔhye aduhwam wɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔrebukyia no so. <verse eid="LUK 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi ara nso na asafo no rebɔ mpaeɛ wɔ adihɔ hɔ sɛdeɛ wɔtaa yɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11"/>Sakaria gu so rehye aduhwam no, prɛko pɛ, Awurade ɔbɔfoɔ bɛgyinaa afɔrebukyia no nkyɛn mu wɔ nifa so. <verse eid="LUK 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12"/>Sakaria hunuu no no, ɔbɔɔ birim na ne ho popoeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13"/>Nanso, ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sakaria, nsuro, Awurade Onyankopɔn ate wo mpaeɛbɔ. Wo yere Elisabet bɛwo babarima na ɛsɛ sɛ woto ne din Yohane. <verse eid="LUK 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14"/>Nʼawoɔ bɛma wʼani agye na wo ho asɛpɛ wo. Saa ara na ɛbɛma nnipa bebree nso ani agye. <verse eid="LUK 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15"/>Ɔbɛyɛ kɛse Awurade anim. Ɔrennom nsã biara da, na Honhom Kronkron bɛyɛ no ma afiri ne maame yam. <verse eid="LUK 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16"/>Israelfoɔ pii nam nʼasɛnka so bɛnya adwensakyera asane aba Awurade, wɔn Onyankopɔn, nkyɛn. <verse eid="LUK 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17"/>Ɔbɛnya Odiyifoɔ Elia honhom ahoɔden no bi, na ɔbɛdi Agyenkwa no ba no anim abɛsiesie nnipa ama ne ba a ɔbɛba no. Nʼasɛnka bɛma nteaseɛ aba agyanom ne wɔn mma ntam. Na ɔbɛdane Awurade asɛm no ho asoɔdenfoɔ adwene akɔ Awurade pɛ ho.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18"/>Sakaria buaa ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na yei aba mu? Mabɔ akɔkoraa na me yere nso abɔ aberewa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no kaa sɛ, “Mene Gabriel a megyina Onyankopɔn anim daa no. Ɔno na ɔsomaa me sɛ memmɛka asɛmpa yi nkyerɛ wo. <verse eid="LUK 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20"/>Esiane sɛ woagye akyinnyeɛ enti, wobɛtɔ mumu kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛwo abɔfra no. Na deɛ maka akyerɛ wo yi nyinaa bɛba mu pɛpɛɛpɛ wɔ ne berɛ a ɛsɛ mu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21"/>Saa ɛberɛ yi nyinaa na asafo mma no retwɛn Sakaria sɛ ɔbɛba. Na ɛyɛ wɔn nwanwa sɛ wakyɛ saa. <verse eid="LUK 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔbaeɛ no, wantumi ankasa ankyerɛ asafo mma no. Wɔhunu firii ne nneyɛeɛ mu sɛ wahunu nʼani so adeɛ wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23"/>Ɔwiee nʼasɔfodwuma wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ efie. <verse eid="LUK 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24"/>Nna bi akyi no, ne yere Elisabet nyinsɛnee na ɔde ne ho siee abosome enum. <verse eid="LUK 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25"/>Ɔde anigyeɛ kaa sɛ, “Awurade ayɛ me adɔeɛ. Wayi animguaseɛ a ɛkaa me wɔ nnipa anim no afiri me so.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awoɔ Ho Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26"/>Elisabet nyinsɛnee abosome nsia no, Onyankopɔn somaa ɔbɔfoɔ Gabriel kɔɔ Galilea akuraa bi a wɔfrɛ no Nasaret no ase <verse eid="LUK 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27"/>sɛ, ɔnkɔ ɔbaa kronkron bi a wɔfrɛ no Maria a na wɔde no ama Yosef a ɔfiri Ɔhene Dawid abusua mu no awadeɛ no nkyɛn. <verse eid="LUK 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28"/>Gabriel hunuu no ara pɛ, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Asomdwoeɛ nka wo! Awurade ka wo ho, wo a Awurade adom wo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no asɛm no maa Maria adwenem yɛɛ no nnaa ma ɔbisaa ne ho sɛ, “Na saa nkyea yi, ase ne sɛn?” <verse eid="LUK 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no sane ka kyerɛɛ Maria bio sɛ, “Maria, nsuro, ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade adom wo. <verse eid="LUK 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31"/>Tie! Ɛrenkyɛre biara wobɛnyinsɛn na woawo ɔbabarima na woato ne din Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32"/>Ɔbɛyɛ ɔkɛseɛ, na wɔbɛfrɛ no Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn Ba. Na Awurade de ne nana Dawid ahennwa no bɛma no. <verse eid="LUK 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33"/>Na ɔbɛdi Yakob efie so ɔhene daa; na nʼahennie to rentwa da.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34"/>Maria bisaa ɔbɔfoɔ no sɛ, “Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na mawo wɔ ɛberɛ a ɔbarima nhunuu me da?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35"/>Ɔbɔfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Honhom Kronkron bɛba wo so na Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn tumi abɛkata wo so, yei enti abɔfra a wobɛwo no no bɛyɛ kronkron na wɔbɛfrɛ no Onyankopɔn Ba. <verse eid="LUK 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36"/>Ɛbɛyɛ abosome nsia ni a wo busuani Elisabet mpo a ɔyɛ obonini anyinsɛn ɔbabarima wɔ ne mmerewaberɛ mu. <verse eid="LUK 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn deɛ, biribiara nso no yɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38"/>Maria kaa sɛ, “Me deɛ, meyɛ Awurade afenaa. Deɛ Awurade pɛ na ɛnyɛ.” Ɛno akyi, ɔbɔfoɔ no gyaa no hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maria Kɔsra Elisabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39"/>Nna kakra bi akyi no, Maria kɔɔ Yudea mmepɔ so kuro bi mu. <verse eid="LUK 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40"/>Saa kuro no mu na Sakaria te. Ɔduruu kuro no mu hɔ no, ɔkɔɔ Sakaria efie kɔsraa Elisabet. Ɔkyeaa no. <verse eid="LUK 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41"/>Elisabet tee Maria nkyea no, ɔba a ɔda ne yam no kekaa ne ho; amonom hɔ ara, Honhom Kronkron hyɛɛ Elisabet ma. <verse eid="LUK 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42"/>Elisabet de ahosɛpɛ teaam sɛ, “Maria, wɔahyira wo sene mmaa nyinaa, na wo ba a wobɛwo no no bɛyɛ onipa kɛseɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43"/>Animuonyam bɛn na ɛsene yei. Me sɛɛ ne hwan a anka mʼAwurade na bɛba abɛsra me? <verse eid="LUK 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44"/>Wokyeaa me pɛ, na abɔfra no de anigyeɛ kekaa ne ho. <verse eid="LUK 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45"/>Nhyira nka wo sɛ wogye dii sɛ, deɛ Onyankopɔn aka no, ɔbɛyɛ; ɛno enti na wɔadom wo yi.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Maria Ayɛyie Dwom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46"/>Maria kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Me ɔkra kamfo Awurade.<verse eid="LUK 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47"/>Na me honhom ani gye mʼagyenkwa Onyankopɔn mu;<verse eid="LUK 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48"/>ɛfiri sɛ, wahunu nʼafenawa mmɔborɔni mmɔbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">na ɛfiri ɛnnɛ, awontoatoasoɔ nyinaa bɛfrɛ me deɛ Onyankopɔn ahyira no.<verse eid="LUK 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, Ɔkronkronni Otumfoɔ no ayɛ ade kɛseɛ ama me;<verse eid="LUK 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50"/>nʼahummɔborɔ firi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">ma wɔn a wɔsuro no na wɔdi no ni no nyinaa.<verse eid="LUK 1:50"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51"/>Ɔde ne nsa a tumi wɔ mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">abɔ ahomasofoɔ ne ahantanfoɔ ne wɔn nsusuiɛ apete.<verse eid="LUK 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52"/>Watu aberempɔn adeɛ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">ama ahobrɛasefoɔ so.<verse eid="LUK 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53"/>Wama wɔn a ahia wɔn no nnepa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">na wagya ahonyafoɔ kwan nsapan.<verse eid="LUK 1:53"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54"/>Waboa nʼakoa Israel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">na ne werɛ amfiri ne mmɔborɔhunu ne ne bɔ<verse eid="LUK 1:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55"/>a ɔhyɛɛ yɛn agya Abraham ne nʼasefoɔ no da.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56"/>Maria tenaa Elisabet nkyɛn bɛyɛ abosome mmiɛnsa ansa na ɔresane akɔ ne kurom.<verse eid="LUK 1:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni Awoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57"/>Elisabet awoɔ duruu so no, ɔwoo ɔbabarima. <verse eid="LUK 1:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58"/>Nʼafipamfoɔ ne nʼabusuafoɔ tee adɔeɛ a Awurade ayɛ no no, wɔne no nyinaa de anigyeɛ dii ahurisie.<verse eid="LUK 1:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59"/>Ɛduruu nnawɔtwe no, abusuafoɔ ne adɔfoɔ bɛhyiaa sɛ wɔrebɛtwa abɔfra no twetia na wɔato ne din. Wɔpɛɛ sɛ wɔde abɔfra no to nʼagya Sakaria. <verse eid="LUK 1:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60"/>Nanso, ne maame kaa sɛ, “Dabi! Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔfrɛ no Yohane.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Obiara nni abusua yi mu a wɔfrɛ no saa.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62"/>Yei maa wɔde wɔn nsa yɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bisaa nʼagya din a wɔmfa nto abɔfra no. <verse eid="LUK 1:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63"/>Sakaria maa wɔde krataa brɛɛ no na ɔtwerɛɛ so sɛ, “Ne din de Yohane.” Yei yɛɛ wɔn nyinaa nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64"/>Amonom hɔ ara, Sakaria tumi kasaa bio, na ɔhyɛɛ aseɛ yii Onyankopɔn ayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65"/>Wɔn a wɔteeɛ nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn, na saa asɛm yi trɛ faa Yudea mmepɔ so hɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="LUK 1:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66"/>Obiara a ɔtee saa nsɛm yi bisaa ne ho sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na abɔfra yi bɛnyini ayɛ daakye? Ɛda adi pefee sɛ Awurade nsa wɔ ne so.”<verse eid="LUK 1:66"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sakaria Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67"/>Honhom hyɛɛ nʼagya Sakaria ma ma ɔhyɛɛ nkɔm sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:67"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68"/>“Nhyira nka Awurade, Israel Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">sɛ waba abɛgye ne manfoɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:68"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69"/>Ɔde Agyenkwa Otumfoɔ a ɔyɛ ne ɔsomfoɔ Dawid aseni rebrɛ yɛn,<verse eid="LUK 1:69"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70"/>sɛdeɛ ɔnam nʼadiyifoɔ kronkron so firi teteete hyɛɛ bɔ<verse eid="LUK 1:70"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71"/>sɛ, ɔbɛma yɛn Agyenkwa a ɔbɛgye yɛn afiri yɛn atamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">ne wɔn a wɔkyiri yɛn no nsam no.<verse eid="LUK 1:71"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72"/>Na wama bɔ a ɔhyɛɛ yɛn agyanom wɔ nʼahummɔborɔ ho no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">aba mu na wakae nʼapam kronkron no,<verse eid="LUK 1:72"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73"/>na wakae nʼapam kronkron a ɔne Abraham pameeɛ no;<verse eid="LUK 1:73"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74"/>sɛ ɔbɛgye yɛn afiri yɛn atamfoɔ nsam no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">na yɛasom no a osuro biara nni mu.<verse eid="LUK 1:74"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75"/>Na yɛn nkwa nna nyinaa mu, yɛayɛ kronkron ne ateneneefoɔ wɔ nʼanim.<verse eid="LUK 1:75"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76"/>“Na wo, akɔkoaa yi, wɔbɛfrɛ wo Ɔsorosoroni no Odiyifoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">ɛfiri sɛ, wo na wobɛsiesie ɛkwan ama Agyenkwa no,<verse eid="LUK 1:76"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77"/>na wobɛkyerɛ ne manfoɔ kwan a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">wɔnam bɔnefakyɛ so nya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ;<verse eid="LUK 1:77"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78"/>na yeinom nyinaa bɛba mu ɛfiri sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">Onyankopɔn mmɔborɔhunu a ɛdɔɔso no,<verse eid="LUK 1:78"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79"/>na ɛbɛma hann a ɛfiri ɔsoro abɛpue yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">ahyerɛn wɔn a wɔte sum ne owuo sum mu no so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">na akyerɛ yɛn ɛkwan akɔ asomdwoeɛ mu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80"/>Abɔfra no nyinii na honhom hyɛɛ no ma; ɔtenaa ɛserɛ so kɔsii ɛberɛ a ɔfirii nʼasɛnka adwuma ase.<verse eid="LUK 1:80"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Awoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ no mu no, Kaesare Augusto a na ɔyɛ Roma ɔhempɔn hyɛɛ mmara bi sɛ wɔnkan ne ɔman no mu nnipa nyinaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2"/>Saa nnipakan yi ne deɛ ɛdi ɛkan a wɔkanee wɔ Kirenio a ɔyɛ amrado wɔ Siria no berɛ so. <verse eid="LUK 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3"/>Obiara kɔɔ ne kurom na wɔtwerɛɛ ne din.<verse eid="LUK 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4"/>Esiane sɛ na Yosef yɛ Ɔhene Dawid busuani no enti, na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔfiri Galilea kuro a wɔfrɛ no Nasaret mu kɔ Betlehem a ɛwɔ Yudea. <verse eid="LUK 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5"/>Ɔne ne yere Maria a saa ɛberɛ no na ɔnyem no na wɔkɔeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6"/>Wɔwɔ Betlehem no, awoɔ kaa Maria, <verse eid="LUK 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7"/>na ɔwoo ɔbarima. Wɔde kuntu kyekyeree abɔfra no ho de no too mmoa adididaka mu, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔannya baabi ansoɛ wɔ ahɔhobea hɔ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8"/>Anadwo no ara, na nnwanhwɛfoɔ bi nso wɔ ɛserɛ no so baabi rewɛn wɔn nnwan. <verse eid="LUK 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9"/>Mpofirim, ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ baa wɔn nkyɛn, na Onyankopɔn animuonyam hyerɛn twaa wɔn ho hyiaeɛ, na ɛmaa wɔn ho dwirii wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10"/>Ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monnsuro, mede anigyesɛm rebrɛ mo ne amansan nyinaa. <verse eid="LUK 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11"/>Ɛnnɛ wɔawo Agyenkwa a ɔne Kristo Awurade no ama mo wɔ Dawid kurom. <verse eid="LUK 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12"/>Yei ne nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a mobɛhunu. Mobɛhunu akɔkoaa a wɔde kuntu akyekyere ne ho a ɔda mmoa adididaka mu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13"/>Amonom hɔ ara, abɔfokuo bɛkaa ɔbɔfoɔ a ɔwɔ hɔ no ho na wɔtoo ayɛyie dwom sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14"/>“Animuonyam nka Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">na asomdwoeɛ mmra wɔn a wɔsɔ nʼani wɔ asase so no so.”<verse eid="LUK 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15"/>Ɛberɛ a abɔfokuo yi sane kɔɔ ɔsoro no, nnwanhwɛfoɔ no keka kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Momma yɛnkɔ Betlehem hɔ na yɛnkɔhwɛ saa anwanwasɛm a asi wɔ hɔ a Awurade ada no adi akyerɛ yɛn yi.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16"/>Wɔde ahoɔherɛ kɔɔ Betlehem kɔhunuu Maria ne Yosef. Na wɔhunuu abɔfra no nso sɛ ɔda mmoa adididaka mu. <verse eid="LUK 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17"/>Nnwanhwɛfoɔ no hunuu abɔfra no no, wɔkaa ne ho asɛm a ɔsoro abɔfoɔ no bɛka kyerɛɛ wɔn no nyinaa kyerɛɛ nnipa a wɔahyia hɔ no. <verse eid="LUK 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18"/>Wɔn a wɔtee nnwanhwɛfoɔ yi asɛm no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19"/>Nanso Maria deɛ, ɔde saa nsɛm a ɔteeɛ no nyinaa siee ne tirim dwenee ho. <verse eid="LUK 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20"/>Nnwanhwɛfoɔ no kɔhunuu deɛ abɔfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ wɔn no, wɔde anigyeɛ sane wɔn akyi kɔɔ deɛ wɔn nnwan no wɔ hɔ. Wɔrekɔ no nyinaa, na wɔreyi Onyankopɔn ayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Dintoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21"/>Abɔfra no dii nnawɔtwe no, wɔtoo ne din Yesu sɛdeɛ ɔsoro ɔbɔfoɔ no kyerɛeɛ ansa na wɔrenyinsɛn no no. Ɛda no ara na wɔtwaa no twetia.<verse eid="LUK 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Yesu Kɔ Asɔrefie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22"/>Ɛberɛ duruu sɛ Yosef ne Maria kɔdwira wɔn ho sɛdeɛ Mose mmara kyerɛ no, wɔde abɔfra no kɔɔ Yerusalem sɛ wɔde no rekɔhyɛ Onyankopɔn nsa. <verse eid="LUK 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23"/>Sɛdeɛ Mose mmara no kyerɛ no, “Sɛ ɔbaa wo nʼabakan na ɔyɛ ɔbarima a, wɔde no ma Awurade.” <verse eid="LUK 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24"/>Wɔkɔɔ asɔredan no mu hɔ nso kɔbɔɔ afɔdeɛ, sɛdeɛ mmara no kyerɛ no: wɔde nturukuku mmienu anaa mmorɔnoma mma mmienu na wɔde bɔ afɔdeɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25"/>Ɛda no na ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Simeon a ɔte Yerusalem no nso wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ bi. Na Simeon yɛ onipa tenenee, ɔhotefoɔ a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma a na daa ɔhwɛ Agyenkwa no kwan. <verse eid="LUK 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26"/>Ɔno na na Honhom Kronkron ayi akyerɛ no sɛ ɔrenwu kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛhunu Agyenkwa a Awurade asra no no. <verse eid="LUK 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27"/>Enti ɛberɛ a Maria ne Yosef duruu asɔredan no mu sɛ wɔde abɔfra no rekɔma Awurade sɛdeɛ mmara no te no, <verse eid="LUK 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28"/>wɔkɔtoo Simeon nso wɔ hɔ, na Simeon gyee abɔfra no hyɛɛ Awurade animuonyam sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29"/>“Awurade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">afei ma wʼakoa nwu asomdwoeɛ mu<verse eid="LUK 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30"/>ɛfiri sɛ, mʼani ahunu Agyenkwa<verse eid="LUK 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31"/>a wohyɛɛ me ne ho bɔ no.<verse eid="LUK 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32"/>Ɔno ne hann a ɛbɛhyerɛn ewiase nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">na wahyɛ wo ɔman Israel animuonyam!”<verse eid="LUK 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33"/>Nsɛm a wɔka faa Yesu ho no yɛɛ nʼagya Yosef ne ne maame Maria nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34"/>Afei, Simeon hyiraa wɔn na ɔka kyerɛɛ ne maame Maria sɛ, “Saa abɔfra yi so na Israelfoɔ mu dodoɔ no ara nkwagyeɛ ne wɔn asehweɛ bɛgyina. <verse eid="LUK 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35"/>Na ɔbɛma dodoɔ no ara tirim ahintasɛm ada adi; na wo Maria deɛ, wobɛsi apinie wɔ wo mu.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, na Fanuel babaa odiyifoɔ Ana a ɔfiri Aser abusua mu no nso wɔ hɔ bi. Na Ana yɛ obi a wanyini. Ɔwaree ne mmabaawaberɛ mu ne ne kunu tenaeɛ mfeɛ nson pɛ na ne kunu no wuiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37"/>Ne kunu no wuo akyi no, ɔyɛɛ kuna kɔsii sɛ ɔdii mfeɛ aduɔwɔtwe ɛnan, na ɛberɛ biara nso na ɔwɔ asɔredan mu de mmuadadie ne mpaeɛbɔ som Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="LUK 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, ɔno nso bɛgyinaa hɔ bi yii Onyankopɔn ayɛ saa ara. Ɔkaa abɔfra no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ wɔn a wɔretwɛn ɔgye a ɔbɛgye Yerusalem no nyinaa.<verse eid="LUK 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39"/>Wɔwiee amanneɛ sɛdeɛ Awurade mmara kyerɛ no, wɔsane kɔɔ wɔn kurom Nasaret a ɛwɔ Galilea, <verse eid="LUK 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40"/>Abɔfra no nyinii, na nyansa hyɛɛ no ma, na na Onyankopɔn adom nso wɔ ne so.<verse eid="LUK 2:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wɔ Asɔrefie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41"/>Afe biara na Yesu awofoɔ kɔ Yerusalem kɔdi Twam Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="LUK 2:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42"/>Sɛdeɛ na wɔn amanneɛ te no, Yesu dii mfeɛ dumienu no,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ mmarimaa di mfirinhyia dumienu a, wɔfiri aseɛ yɛ ahoboa se wɔbɛwura nyamesom mu afe a ɛdi so no mu.</char></note> nʼawofoɔ de no kɔɔ Yerusalem kɔdii Twam Afahyɛ no. <verse eid="LUK 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43"/>Wɔwiee afahyɛ no di a wɔresane akɔ wɔn kurom no, Yesu kaa Yerusalem a nʼawofoɔ no nnim. <verse eid="LUK 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44"/>Wɔtwaa da koro ɛkwan a wɔn ani baa wɔn ho so sɛ Yesu nka wɔn ho no, wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ bisabisaa nʼase firii wɔn abusuafoɔ ne amannifoɔ nkyɛn. <verse eid="LUK 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45"/>Na wɔanhunu no no, wɔsane baa Yerusalem bɛhwehwɛɛ no. <verse eid="LUK 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46"/>Ne nnansa akyi no, wɔkɔhunuu no Yerusalem asɔredan mu sɛ ɔte akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ bi a wɔahyia mu ntam na ɔretie wɔn na ɔrebisabisa wɔn nsɛm. <verse eid="LUK 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47"/>Yesu nyansa ne ne nimdeɛ a ɛdaa adi wɔ ne mmuaeɛ nyinaa mu no, yɛɛ nnipa a na wɔretie no no nyinaa nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48"/>Wɔkɔtoo no sɛ ɔte akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no mfimfini retie wɔn no, ɛyɛɛ wɔn nwanwa. Ne maame frɛɛ no bisaa no sɛ, “Me ba, adɛn na woyɛ yɛn saa? Woama me ne wʼagya ahwehwɛ wo abrɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na mohwehwɛ me? Monnim sɛ ɛyɛ mʼasɛdeɛ sɛ metena mʼagya efie som no anaa?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50"/>Nanso, nʼawofoɔ no ante deɛ ɔkaeɛ no ase.<verse eid="LUK 2:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51"/>Yesu ne nʼawofoɔ kɔɔ Nasaret no, ɔyɛɛ ɔsetie maa wɔn. Ne maame de nsɛm a ɛsisiiɛ no nyinaa siee ne tirim. <verse eid="LUK 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52"/>Yesu nyinii nyansa mu ne honam fam, na ɔnyaa Onyankopɔn ne nnipa anim adom.<verse eid="LUK 2:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Fiti Ne Nnwuma Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1"/>Kaesare Tiberio dii adeɛ ne mfeɛ dunum so na Onyankopɔn asɛm baa Sakaria ba Yohane so wɔ ɛserɛ so. <verse eid="LUK 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Pilato yɛ amrado wɔ Yudea, na Herode di Galilea mansinihene; ne nua Filipo di Iturea ne Trakoniti mansini so; na Lisania di Abilene mansinihene, ɛnna Anas ne Kaiafa nso yɛ Yudafoɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin. <verse eid="LUK 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3"/>Yohane kyinkyinii Asubɔnten Yordan ho nyinaa kyerɛkyerɛɛ nnipa sɛ, wɔmma wɔmmɔ wɔn asu nsakra mfiri wɔn bɔne ho, na wɔde wɔn bɔne akyɛ wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4"/>Sɛdeɛ Odiyifoɔ Yesaia kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Nne bi reteam wɔ ɛserɛ so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Monsiesie ɛkwan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ansa na ɔhene bi bɛtu kwan akɔ akyirikyiri man bi so no, wɔsiesie akwan a ɔbɛfa so no so. Yohane adwumayɛ mu nso ɔyɛɛ ɔbrasu ne honhom fam nsiesieeɛ maa Agyenkwa no. Ɔsii ahonuo ne bɔnefakyɛ a ɛho hia Agyenkwa no so dua.</char></note> mma Awurade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">momma nʼatempɔn ntene.<verse eid="LUK 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5"/>Bɔnhwa biara bɛyɛ ma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">Bepɔ ne nkokoɔ nyinaa bɛkɔ fam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">asase a ɛyɛ monkyi mmɔnka no bɛyɛ tamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">na mmeaɛ a ɛyɛ kɔntɔnkye no ayɛ tata.<verse eid="LUK 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6"/>Na nnipa nyinaa bɛhunu Onyankopɔn nkwagyeɛ.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7"/>Yohane ka kyerɛɛ nkurɔfoɔ a wɔbaa hɔ sɛ ɔmmɔ wɔn asu no sɛ, “Awɔ mma! Hwan na ɔbɔɔ mo kɔkɔ sɛ monnwane mfiri abufuhyeɛ a ɛreba no ho? <verse eid="LUK 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8"/>Monkɔbɔ ɔbra pa mfa nkyerɛ sɛ moasakyera ampa. Na monnhoahoa mo ho sɛ moyɛ Abraham asefoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn bɛtumi ama saa aboɔ yi adane nnipa ma wɔabɛyɛ Abraham asefoɔ. <verse eid="LUK 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9"/>Onyankopɔn de nʼabonnua ato dua biara a ɛnso aba pa nhini ho sɛ ɔde bɛtwa na ɔde agu ogya mu, ahye no.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10"/>Nnipakuo no bisaa no sɛ, “Na ɛnneɛ ɛdeɛn na yɛnyɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11"/>Yohane buaa wɔn sɛ, “Sɛ wowɔ ntoma mmienu a, ma deɛ ɔnni bi no baako. Saa ara nso na sɛ wowɔ aduane a, ma deɛ ɔnni bi no bi.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12"/>Togyefoɔ a wɔbaa hɔ sɛ wɔmmɔ wɔn asu no nso bisaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛnyɛ ɛdeɛn?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, “Monnnye mmoro deɛ wɔatwa ato hɔ sɛ monnye no.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14"/>Asraafoɔ bi nso bisaa sɛ, “Yɛn nso yɛnyɛ ɛdeɛn?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Yohane buaa wɔn sɛ, “Mommmɔ apoo, monntoto obiara ano, momma mo akatua nsɔ mo ani!”<verse eid="LUK 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15"/>Esiane sɛ saa ɛberɛ no na nnipa no nyinaa rehwɛ Agyenkwa no kwan enti, na wɔsusu sɛ Yohane ne Agyenkwa no. <verse eid="LUK 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16"/>Yei maa Yohane ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Me deɛ mede nsuo na ɛrebɔ mo asu. Nanso, obi di mʼakyi a ɔreba a, ɔwɔ tumi sene me na ne mpaboa mpo, mensɛ sɛ mekura. Ɔno deɛ, sɛ ɔba a, ɔde Honhom Kronkron ne ogya na ɛbɛbɔ mo asu. <verse eid="LUK 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17"/>Ɔno na sɛ ɔba a, ɔbɛhuhu mo so sɛ ɛmo, ayiyi mu aba pa no afiri ntɛtɛ no mu na ɔde aba pa no akɔsie na ɔde ogya a ɛnnum da ahye ntɛtɛ no.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18"/>Ɔnam afotuo ahodoɔ so kaa asɛmpa no kyerɛɛ wɔn.<verse eid="LUK 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Afiaseda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19"/>Yohane kaa Herode anim wɔ ne nua yere Herodia a ɔwaree no ne bɔne ahodoɔ a na ɔyɛ no ho. <verse eid="LUK 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20"/>Yei maa Herode de Yohane too afiase.<verse eid="LUK 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asubɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21"/>Ɛberɛ a Yohane bɔɔ nkurɔfoɔ pii asu wieeɛ no, ɔbɔɔ Yesu nso asu. Ɔbɔɔ no asu wieeɛ a ɔrebɔ mpaeɛ no, ɔsoro bueɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22"/>Honhom Kronkron sianee honam mu te sɛ aborɔnoma baa Yesu so na nne bi firi ɔsoro kaa sɛ, “Wone me Dɔ Ba a wosɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Awoɔ Ntoatoasoɔ A Ɛfiri Yesu So Kɔsi Adam So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23"/>Yesu hyɛɛ nʼadwuma ase no, na wadi bɛyɛ mfeɛ aduasa. Nkurɔfoɔ susuu sɛ, Yesu yɛ Yosef ba.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:23"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">Yosef agya ne Eli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24"/>Eli agya ne Mattat;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Mattat agya ne Lewi; Lewi agya ne Melki;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Melki agya ne Yanai; Yanai agya ne Yosef;<verse eid="LUK 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25"/>Yosef agya ne Matatia; Matatia agya ne Amos;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amos agya ne Nahum; Nahum agya ne Hesli;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Hesli agya ne Nagai; <verse eid="LUK 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26"/>Nagai agya ne Mahat;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Mahat agya ne Matatia; Matatia agya ne Semein;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Semein agya ne Yosek; Yosek agya ne Yoda;<verse eid="LUK 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27"/>Yoda agya ne Yohanan; Yohanan agya ne Resa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa agya ne Serubabel; Serubabel agya ne Sealtiel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Sealtiel agya ne Neri; <verse eid="LUK 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28"/>Neri agya ne Melki;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Melki agya ne Adi; Adi agya ne Kosam;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosam agya ne Elmadam; Elmadam agya ne Er;<verse eid="LUK 3:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29"/>Er agya ne Yosua; Yosua agya ne Elieser;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Elieser agya ne Yorim; Yorim agya ne Matat;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Matat agya ne Lewi; <verse eid="LUK 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30"/>Lewi agya ne Simeon;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeon agya ne Yuda; Yuda agya ne Yosef; Yosef agya ne</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yonam; Yonam agya ne Eliakim;<verse eid="LUK 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31"/>Eliakim agya ne Melea; Melea agya ne Mena;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Mena agya ne Matata; Matata agya ne Natan;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Natan agya ne Dawid; <verse eid="LUK 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32"/>Dawid agya ne Yisai;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yisai agya ne Obed; Obed agya ne Boas;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Boas agya ne Sala; Sala agya ne Nahson;<verse eid="LUK 3:32"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33"/>Nahson agya ne Aminadab; Aminadab agya ne Admin;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Admin agya ne Arni; Arni agya ne Hesron; Hesron agya ne Peres;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Peres agya ne Yuda; <verse eid="LUK 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34"/>Yuda agya ne Yakob;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakob agya ne Isak; Isak agya ne Abraham;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Abraham agya ne Tera; Tera agya ne Nahor;<verse eid="LUK 3:34"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35"/>Nahor agya ne Serug; Serug agya ne Reu;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reu agya ne Peleg; Peleg agya ne Eber;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eber agya ne Sala; <verse eid="LUK 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36"/>Sala agya ne Kainan;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kainan agya ne Arfaksad; Arfaksad agya ne Sem;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Sem agya ne Noa; Noa agya ne Lamek;<verse eid="LUK 3:36"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37"/>Lamek agya ne Metusela; Metusela agya ne Henok;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Henok agya ne Yared; Yared agya ne Mahalalel;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalalel agya ne Kenan; <verse eid="LUK 3:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38"/>Kenan agya ne Enos;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enos agya ne Set; Set agya ne Adam;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adam agya ne Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="LUK 3:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbonsam Sɔ Yesu Hwɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1"/>Afei, Yesu a Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma no firii Asubɔnten Yordan ho maa Honhom no de no kɔɔ Yudea ɛserɛ so. <verse eid="LUK 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2"/>Ɛhɔ na ɔbonsam kɔsɔɔ no hwɛɛ adaduanan. Saa nna no mu no, wanni hwee. Na ɛkɔm dee no.<verse eid="LUK 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3"/>Ɔbonsam ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba no a, ka na saa aboɔ yi nnane aduane.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ: ‘Ɛnyɛ aduane nko ara na ɛho hia onipa wɔ nʼasetena mu.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5"/>Ɔbonsam de Yesu kɔɔ bepɔ bi so kyerɛɛ no ewiase ahennie nyinaa ɛberɛ tiawa bi mu. <verse eid="LUK 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7"/>“Sɛ wobɛkoto, asom me a, mede ahennie ahodoɔ yi ne emu tumi ne animuonyam nyinaa a wɔde ahyɛ me nsa yi bɛma wo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ: ‘Som Awurade, wo Onyankopɔn, na ɔno nko ara na som no.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9"/>Afei, ɔbonsam de Yesu kɔɔ Yerusalem de no kɔgyinaa asɔredan a ɛwɔ hɔ no atifi pɛɛ na ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Sɛ wone Onyankopɔn Ba no ampa ara a, gyaa wo ho firi deɛ wogyina hɔ to fam! <verse eid="LUK 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10"/>Ɛfiri sɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">“ ‘Onyankopɔn bɛsoma nʼabɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">abɛbɔ wo ho ban;<verse eid="LUK 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11"/>na wɔabɛsɔ wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">na woammɛhwe abotan no so.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ: ‘Nsɔ Awurade, wo Onyankopɔn, nhwɛ.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13"/>Ɔbonsam wiee sɔhwɛ no nyinaa no, ɔgyaa no hɔ kɔeɛ ansa.<verse eid="LUK 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asɛnka Ahyɛaseɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14"/>Yesu sane baa Galilea a na Honhom Kronkron ahyɛ no ma. Ankyɛre koraa ne din trɛɛ ɔman no mu nyinaa. <verse eid="LUK 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15"/>Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ wɔn hyiadan mu maa obiara kamfoo no.<verse eid="LUK 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔpo Yesu Wɔ Nasaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16"/>Yesu baa Nasaret, kuro a ne mmɔfraase wɔtetee no wɔ mu no mu. Na sɛdeɛ ɔtaa yɛ no, ɔkɔɔ hyiadan mu homeda. Ɔsɔre kɔɔ anim sɛ ɔrekɔkenkan Atwerɛsɛm. <verse eid="LUK 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17"/>Wɔde Odiyifoɔ Yesaia nwoma hyɛɛ ne nsa na ɔbuee baabi a wɔatwerɛ sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Awurade Honhom wɔ me so,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">na wɔayi me sɛ</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">memmɛka asɛmpa nkyerɛ ahiafoɔ.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">Na menka nkyerɛ wɔn a wɔwɔ nnommum mu sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">wɔbɛnya ahofadie,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">
    <char style="wj">na anifirafoɔ ahunu adeɛ ama wɔn a wɔbu wɔn animtiaa nso anya animuonyam.</char><verse eid="LUK 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19"/>
    <char style="wj">Honhom no asoma me sɛ memmɛka sɛ, Awurade adom no aba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20"/>Ɔtoo nwoma no mu de maa ɔhwɛfoɔ no na ɔtenaa ase; na obiara a ɔwɔ hyiadan no mu hɔ no hwɛɛ no dinn. <verse eid="LUK 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnnɛ na Atwerɛsɛm no aba mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22"/>Na kasa pa ne adom nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ no yɛɛ wɔn a wɔteeɛ nyinaa nwanwa ma wɔbisaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ Yosef ba no ni?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Akyinnyeɛ biara nni ho sɛ mode bɛ yi bɛbu me sɛ, ‘Ɔyaresafoɔ, sa wo ho yadeɛ. Deɛ yɛate afa wo ho sɛ woyɛɛ wɔ Kapernaum no, yɛ bi wɔ wo kurom ha.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, mereka ama moate aseɛ sɛ, Odiyifoɔ biara nni animuonyam wɔ ne kurom.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25"/><char style="wj">Nokorɛ mu, Elia ɛberɛ so no, na mmaa akunafoɔ bebree wɔ Israelman mu. Saa ɛberɛ no osuo antɔ mfeɛ mmiɛnsa ne abosome nsia enti ɛmaa ɛkɔm kɛseɛ baa ɔman no nyinaa mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26"/><char style="wj">Nanso, Onyankopɔn ansoma Odiyifoɔ Elia ankɔ obiara nkyɛn sɛ ɔbaa kunafoɔ a na ɔwɔ Sarepta a ɛwɔ Sidon no nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27"/><char style="wj">Bio, saa ɛberɛ no na akwatafoɔ bebree wɔ Israelman mu, nanso Odiyifoɔ Elisa ansa obiara yadeɛ sɛ ɔsahene Naaman a ɔfiri Siriaman mu no nko ara.”</char><verse eid="LUK 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28"/>Nnipa a wɔwɔ hyiadan no mu tee ne nsɛm a ɔkaeɛ no, wɔn bo fuu papaapa. <verse eid="LUK 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29"/>Wɔde abufuo piapiaa no firii kuro no mu de no kɔɔ bepɔ a wɔn kuro da so no ano sɛ wɔrekɔwɔ nʼatikɔ ama wakɔhwe bepɔ no ase. <verse eid="LUK 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30"/>Nanso, ɔfaa wɔn mu kɔɔ ne baabi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tu Honhommɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31"/>Yesu kɔɔ Kapernaum a ɛwɔ Galilea. Ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ nnipa no homeda biara. <verse eid="LUK 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32"/>Ɛha nso ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no yɛɛ nkurɔfoɔ no nwanwa ɛfiri sɛ, ɔkasaa wɔ tumi so.<verse eid="LUK 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33"/>Na ɔbarima bi wɔ hyiadan no mu hɔ a honhommɔne ahyɛ no ma. Ɔhunuu Yesu no, ɔteaam sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34"/>“Yesu Nasareni, mmɛha yɛn. Yɛne wo nni hwee yɛ. Woaba sɛ worebɛsɛe yɛn anaa? Menim onipa ko a woyɛ. Wone Onyankopɔn Ba Kronkronni no.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35"/>Yesu hyɛɛ honhommɔne no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Tu firi ne mu kɔ!”</char> Honhommɔne no de ɔbarima no hwee fam na ɛtu firii ne mu kɔeɛ a hwee anyɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 4:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36"/>Nnipa no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn, na wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Asɛm bɛn ni. Onipa bɛn ni a ɔde tumi ne ahoɔden tea ahonhommɔne ma wɔtie yi?” <verse eid="LUK 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37"/>Deɛ ɔyɛeɛ yi ho asɛm trɛɛ ɔman no mu nyinaa.<verse eid="LUK 4:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Ase Baa Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38"/>Yesu firii hyiadan no mu no, ɔkɔɔ Simon efie kɔtoo sɛ huraeɛnini abɔ Simon ase baa. Nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no srɛɛ no sɛ ɔnsa no yadeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39"/>Ɔkɔɔ deɛ ɔda hɔ kɔgyinaa ne nkyɛn, teaa yadeɛ no ma ɛgyaeɛ amonom hɔ ara ma ɔsɔre maa wɔn aduane diiɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40"/>Onwunu dwoeɛ no, wɔde ayarefoɔ pii baa sɛ, Yesu nsa wɔn yadeɛ. Ɔde ne nsa guu wɔn so saa wɔn yadeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41"/>Ahohommɔne firii nnipa no pii mu firiiɛ a na wɔreteateam sɛ, “Wone Onyankopɔn Ba no.” Nanso, Yesu kaa wɔn anim, hyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔmmua wɔn ano, ɛfiri sɛ, na ahonhommɔne no nim sɛ ɔno ne Kristo no.<verse eid="LUK 4:41"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asɛnka Wɔ Yudea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Yesu tee ne ho kɔɔ ɛserɛ so baabi a ɛhɔ yɛ dinn. Nkurɔfoɔ no kyini hwehwɛɛ no na wɔhunuu no no, wɔsrɛɛ no sɛ ɔntena wɔn nkyɛn wɔ Kapernaum hɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛsɛ sɛ meka Asɛmpa a ɛfa Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho no mekyerɛ afoforɔ nso, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛno enti na wɔsomaa me.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44"/>Yesu kyinkyinii Yudeaman no mu kɔɔ hyiadan ahodoɔ mu kɔkyerɛkyerɛeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Asuafoɔ No Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu reka asɛmpa wɔ Genesaret ɔtadeɛ ho no, nnipakuo bɛkyeree ne so sɛ wɔrebɛtie Onyankopɔn asɛm. <verse eid="LUK 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2"/>Ɔhunuu akodoɔ mmienu a afarefoɔ bi a wɔrehohoro wɔn asau wɔ mu no agya wɔ ɔtadeɛ no ho. <verse eid="LUK 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3"/>Yesu kɔtenaa kodoɔ no baako a na ɛyɛ Simon dea no mu. Ɔka kyerɛɛ Simon sɛ ɔmpia nkɔ nsuo no mu kakra sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔbɛtumi afiri hɔ akasa akyerɛ nnipa no.<verse eid="LUK 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4"/>Yesu wiee nʼasɛnka no, ɔka kyerɛɛ Simon sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hare kɔ baabi a emu dɔ kakra na monkɔgu mo asau no na mobɛyi nam bebree.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5"/>Simon kaa sɛ, “Owura, yɛyɛɛ adwuma anadwo mu no nyinaa yɛannya hwee, nanso wʼasɛm enti, yɛbɛgu yɛn asau no.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6"/>Wɔguu asau no na wɔyii nam bebree maa anka mpo asau no retete. <verse eid="LUK 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7"/>Wɔfrɛɛ wɔn mfɛfoɔ a wɔwɔ kodoɔ baako no mu no ma wɔbɛboaa wɔn twee asau no. Ɛnam no yɛɛ akodoɔ mmienu no nyinaa ma ma a anka ɛreyɛ amemem mpo.<verse eid="LUK 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8"/>Simon Petro hunuu deɛ aba no, ɔbuu Yesu nkotodwe kaa sɛ, “Me wura, mesrɛ wo, firi me nkyɛn kɔ na meyɛ ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ a mensɛ sɛ wobɛn me.” <verse eid="LUK 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9"/>Ɛnam dodoɔ a wɔyiiɛ no yɛɛ Petro ne nʼahokafoɔ no nwanwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10"/>Saa ara nso na ɛyɛɛ Yakobo ne Yohane, Sebedeo mma no nso nwanwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsuro, ɛfiri ɛnnɛ, wobɛyɛ nnipayifoɔ.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11"/>Wɔde akodoɔ no bɛduruu nsuo no ano hɔ no, wɔgyaa wɔn nneɛma nyinaa hɔ bɛdii nʼakyi.<verse eid="LUK 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔkwatani Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu wɔ kuro bi mu no, ɔbarima bi a kwata ayɛ ne honam nyinaa bɛkotoo nʼanim srɛɛ no sɛ, “Owura, mesrɛ wo, sɛ ɛyɛ wo pɛ a, sa me yadeɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13"/>Ɛhɔ ara Yesu tenee ne nsa de kaa no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aane, ɛyɛ me pɛ. Wo ho mfi.”</char> Amonom hɔ ara, ne ho teeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14"/>Yesu hyɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo ne obiara nni wʼayaresa yi ho nkɔmmɔ. Kɔ na fa wo ho kɔkyerɛ ɔsɔfoɔ na bɔ afɔdeɛ a Mose hyɛɛ sɛ akwatafoɔ a wɔn ho ate no mmɔ sɛ adansedie no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15"/>Yesu anwanwadwuma a ɔyɛeɛ yi maa ne ho asɛm trɛɛ mpɔtam hɔ nyinaa maa nnipa bebree bɛtiee no pɛɛ sɛ ɔsa wɔn yadeɛ nso. <verse eid="LUK 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16"/>Nanso na ɔtaa twe ne ho kɔ ɛserɛ so kɔbɔ mpaeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Obubuafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17"/>Ɛberɛ bi a Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ no, na Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ bi a wɔfiri Galilea ne Yudea nkuro ahodoɔ so ne Yerusalem nso wɔ hɔ bi a wɔretie no. Saa ɛberɛ no, na Onyankopɔn ayaresa tumi ahyɛ no ma. <verse eid="LUK 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18"/>Mmarima bi baa hɔ a wɔso obubuafoɔ bi. <verse eid="LUK 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19"/>Esiane sɛ na wɔntumi mfa nnipakuo no mu nkɔ Yesu nkyɛn enti, wɔforoo ɛdan a Yesu wɔ mu no kɔtuu atifi tokuro, de obubuafoɔ a ɔda ne kɛtɛ so no faa mu gyaagyaa no brɛoo, kɔtoo Yesu anim.<verse eid="LUK 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20"/>Yesu hunuu gyidie a wɔwɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔyarefoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onua, wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21"/>Farisifoɔ no ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no tee asɛm a Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔbisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Hwan ne saa onipa yi a ɔreka abususɛm yi? Hwan na ɔtumi sɛ ɔde bɔne kyɛ ka Onyankopɔn ho?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22"/>Esiane sɛ Yesu hunuu deɛ wɔdwennwene enti, ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na modwene sɛ asɛm a mekaeɛ yi yɛ abususɛm?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɛwɔ he na ɛyɛ den, sɛ wɔbɛka akyerɛ obi sɛ, wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo anaasɛ, wɔbɛka sɛ, sɔre na nante?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɛbɛyɛ na mobɛhunu sɛ Onipa Ba no wɔ tumi sɛ ɔde bɔne kyɛ wɔ asase so enti.”</char> Mereka akyerɛ wo sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre yi wo kɛtɛ na kɔ efie!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔsɔreeɛ, yii ne kɛtɛ kɔɔ efie. Ɔrekɔ no nyinaa na ɔreyi Onyankopɔn ayɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26"/>Wɔn a wɔgyina hɔ no ho dwirii wɔn. Ehu kaa wɔn. Wɔyii Onyankopɔn ayɛ kaa sɛ, “Ɛnnɛ deɛ, yɛahunu anwanwadeɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Frɛ Lewi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27"/>Yei akyi no, Yesu firii hɔ kɔhunuu ɔtogyeni Lewi sɛ ɔte atogyeɛ. Ɔhunuu no no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛdi mʼakyi.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28"/>Ɛhɔ ara, Lewi sɔre, gyaa ne nneɛma nyinaa hɔ dii nʼakyi.<verse eid="LUK 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29"/>Akyire yi, Lewi too ɛpono wɔ ne fie maa Yesu. Togyefoɔ ne nnipa ahodoɔ bebree kɔɔ apontoɔ no ase. <verse eid="LUK 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30"/>Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no hunuu sɛ Yesu ne saa nnipa no ato nsa redidi no, wɔnwiinwii bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn enti na wo ne ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ ato nsa redidi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔn a wɔyare no na ɔyaresafoɔ ho hia wɔn na ɛnyɛ wɔn a wɔnyare.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32"/><char style="wj">Mamma sɛ merebɛfrɛ ateneneefoɔ na mmom mebɛfrɛɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ sɛ wɔnsakyera wɔn adwene.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmuadadie Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33"/>Nnipa no kɔɔ so bisaa no bio sɛ, “Adɛn enti na Yohane Osubɔni asuafoɔ ne Farisifoɔ asuafoɔ no deɛ wɔtaa di mmuada, na wʼasuafoɔ deɛ daa wɔdidi na wɔnom?”<verse eid="LUK 5:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34"/>Yesu nso bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛho hia sɛ wɔn a wɔn ani agye, anaasɛ wɔn a wɔahyia wɔn ayeforɔ ase no di mmuada, wɔ ɛberɛ a ayeforɔ kunu no wɔ wɔn nkyɛn anaa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35"/><char style="wj">Nanso, da bi bɛba a wɔbɛfa ayeforɔkunu no afiri wɔn nkyɛn; saa ɛberɛ no na wɔbɛdi mmuada.”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36"/>Yesu buu wɔn bɛ yi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obi mmfa ntoma foforɔ ntare ntoma dada mu. Ɔyɛ saa a foforɔ no bɛma dada no asuane. Afei, ɛbɛma nsonsonoeɛ ada foforɔ no ne dada no ntam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37"/><char style="wj">Obiara nso mmfa nsã foforɔ ngu mmoa nwoma nsã nkotokuo dada mu. Ɔyɛ saa a, nsã no bɛpaapae nkotokuo no na ahwie agu na nkotokuo no nso asɛe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38"/><char style="wj">Yei enti, nsã nkotokuo foforɔ mu nko ara na ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsã foforɔ gugu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39"/><char style="wj">Obi nnnom nsã dada nnwie mmisa nsã foforɔ ase. Deɛ ɔnom no ka sɛ, ‘dada no na ɛyɛ.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 5:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Homeda Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1"/>Homeda bi a Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no nam aburoofuo bi mu no, asuafoɔ no pempan aburoo no bi hwane, weeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2"/>Farisifoɔ bi bisaa no sɛ, “Adɛn na moyɛ adeɛ a ɛtia Homeda ho mmara a wɔahyɛ no?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkenkanee deɛ Ɔhene Dawid yɛɛ ɛberɛ a ɛkɔm dee ɔne wɔn a wɔka ne ho no wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu anaa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4"/><char style="wj">Ɔkɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔfaa burodo a wɔde abɔ afɔdeɛ ama Onyankopɔn a mmara mma ho kwan sɛ obi di, gye asɔfoɔ nko ara no, de bi maa wɔn a wɔka ne ho no nso diiɛ.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onipa Ba no ne Homeda no wura.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6"/>Homeda foforɔ bi nso a Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no, na ɔbarima bi a ne nsa nifa awu nso wɔ hɔ bi. <verse eid="LUK 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7"/>Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ne Farisifoɔ no hwɛɛ Yesu dinn sɛ ɔbɛsa onipa yi yadeɛ Homeda yi nso anaa. Deɛ na wɔrehwehwɛ ara ne sɛ ɔbɛbu mmara no so, asa yadeɛ na wɔn nsa aka no akyere no. <verse eid="LUK 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwene, nanso ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre bɛgyina animu ha, na obiara nhunu wo.”</char> Ɔbarima no sɔre bɛgyinaa hɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merebisa mo. Ɛdeɛn na mmara no ma ho ɛkwan sɛ yɛnyɛ no Homeda; sɛ yɛbɛyɛ papa anaa yɛbɛyɛ bɔne, sɛ yɛbɛgye obi nkwa anaasɛ yɛbɛma wawu?”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10"/>Yesu hwɛɛ wɔn nyinaa hyiaeɛ na ɔka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Tene wo nsa.”</char> Na ɔtenee ne nsa no, emu yɛɛ den sɛ baako no. <verse eid="LUK 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11"/>Deɛ Yesu yɛeɛ yi hyɛɛ nnipa no abufuo yie ma wɔfirii aseɛ bɔɔ ne ho pɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Asuafoɔ Dumienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu kɔɔ bepɔ bi so sɛ ɔrekɔbɔ mpaeɛ. Ɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ anadwo mu no nyinaa <verse eid="LUK 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ɔfrɛɛ nʼakyidifoɔ no nyinaa baa ne nkyɛn na ɔyii wɔn mu dumienu. Saa dumienu yi na ɔfrɛɛ wɔn asomafoɔ.<verse eid="LUK 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14"/>Simon, a ɔtoo ne din Petro; Andrea, Simon nua;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Yohane,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Filipo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">Bartolomeo,<verse eid="LUK 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15"/>Mateo,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Yakobo a ɔyɛ Alfeo ba;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">Simon, a wɔfrɛ no Selote;<verse eid="LUK 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16"/>Yuda, a ɔyɛ Yakobo ba;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">ne Yuda Iskariot a ɔyii Yesu maeɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Nyarewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17"/>Yesu firii bepɔ no so siane baa fam maa nʼakyidifoɔ bebree ne nnipakuo a wɔfiri Yudea, Yerusalem ne mpoano nkuro Tiro ne Sidon mu no bɛtwaa ne ho hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18"/>Wɔbaeɛ sɛ wɔrebɛtie no ama wasa wɔn nyarewa nso. Ɔtuu ahonhommɔne bebree. <verse eid="LUK 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19"/>Obiara bɔɔ mmɔden sɛ ɔde ne nsa bɛka Yesu. Ayarefoɔ a wɔde wɔn nsa kaa Yesu no nyinaa ho tɔɔ wɔn.<verse eid="LUK 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20"/>Afei, ɔdanee nʼani ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne mo a moyɛ ahiafoɔ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">
    <char style="wj">na mo na Onyankopɔn Ahennie no yɛ mo dea!</char><verse eid="LUK 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne mo a ɛkɔm de mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">na mo na wɔbɛma mo amee.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne mo a mo werɛ ahoɔ,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">
    <char style="wj">na mo na wɔbɛma mo ani agye.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22"/>
    <char style="wj">Nhyira ne mo a Onipa Ba no din enti, nnipa tan mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">na wɔpa mo na wɔya mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">
    <char style="wj">na wɔgu mo din ho fi.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ ɛba saa a, momma mo ani nnye na monni ahurisie! Ɛfiri sɛ, mo akatua so wɔ ɔsoro. Na saa ara nso na wɔn agyanom yɛɛ tete adiyifoɔ no.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mo adefoɔ deɛ, monnue ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ ɛma mo ani gye no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">
    <char style="wj">mo nsa aka dada; yei enti, monni kyɛfa biara bio.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25"/>
    <char style="wj">Monnue, mo a moamee seesei,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">na mo na ɛkɔm bɛde mo!</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">Monnue, mo a moresere seesei,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">
    <char style="wj">na mo na mobɛsi apinie, asu.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26"/>
    <char style="wj">Monnue, mo a nnipa kamfo mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">
    <char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, saa ara na wɔn nananom kamfoo atorɔ adiyifoɔ no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Monnɔ Mo Atamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka akyerɛ mo a moretie me no nyinaa sɛ, monnɔ mo atamfoɔ; monyɛ wɔn a wɔtan mo no papa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28"/><char style="wj">Monhyira wɔn a wɔdome mo; mommɔ mpaeɛ mma wɔn a wɔtan mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi bɔ wʼasom a, dane baako a aka no ma no. Sɛ obi pa wo ntoma a, worɔ wʼatadeɛ ka ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi srɛ wo biribi a, fa ma no. Obi gye wʼadeɛ a, mmisa no bio.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ mopɛ sɛ nnipa nyɛ mo no, mo nso monyɛ wɔn saa ara.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ modɔ wɔn a wɔdɔ mo no nko ara a, mfasoɔ bɛn na mobɛnya? ‘Nnebɔneyɛfoɔ’ nso dɔ wɔn a wɔdɔ wɔn no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ moyɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ mo papa no nko ara yie a, mfasoɔ bɛn na mobɛnya? Nnebɔneyɛfoɔ mpo yɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ wɔn papa no nso yie.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mobɔ wɔn a mosusu sɛ wɔbɛtumi atua mo nko ara bosea a, papa bɛn na moayɛ? Nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nso bobɔ bobɔ wɔn ho wɔn ho bosea, a wɔhwɛ sɛ wɔn nsa bɛka wɔn sika bio.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35"/><char style="wj">Monnɔ mo atamfoɔ. Monyɛ wɔn papa. Momma wɔn deɛ ɛhia wɔn a, mo ani nni akyire bio. Na sɛ moyɛ yeinom a, mo akatua bɛyɛ kɛse wɔ ɔsoro na moayɛ Onyankopɔn mma; ɛfiri sɛ Onyankopɔn yɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ adɔeɛ, na ɔdom bonniayɛfoɔ nso.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36"/><char style="wj">Monyɛ mmɔborɔhunufoɔ sɛdeɛ mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no yɛ mmɔborɔhunufoɔ no.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mommmu ntɛn, na wɔammu mo ntɛn; mommmu fɔ, na wɔammu mo fɔ; momfa nkyɛ, na wɔde akyɛ mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moma a, wɔbɛhyɛ mo ananmu. Deɛ mode ma no, wɔde susudua a wɔahyɛ no ma, amia so ama abu so na ɛbɛsusu ama mo. Susudua a mode bɛsusu ama no, ɛno ara na wɔde bɛsusu ama mo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39"/>Yesu nam abɛbuo so kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onifirani bɛtumi akyerɛ onifirani ɛkwan ama ayɛ yie anaa? Sɛ ɛba saa a, wɔn baanu nyinaa bɛtɔ amena mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40"/><char style="wj">Osuani nsene ne ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ. Nanso, sɛ ɔyere ne ho sua deɛ wɔrekyerɛ no no yie a ɔbɛsɛ ne ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na woma aboseaa a ɛgu wo nua ani so ha wo, ɛberɛ a ɛboɔ da wo deɛ so?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42"/><char style="wj">Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na woatumi aka akyerɛ wo nua sɛ, ‘Ma menyi anwea a ɛgu wʼani so no mma wo’ wɔ ɛberɛ a ɛboɔ a ɛda wʼani so no wonhunu. Nyaatwomni, di ɛkan yi ɛboɔ a ɛda wʼani so no ansa na woatumi ayi anwea a ɛgu wo nua ani so no ama no.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Dua pa nso aba bɔne, na dua bɔne nso nso aba pa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44"/><char style="wj">Dua biara aba na wɔnam so hunu dua ko a ɛyɛ. Worentumi nte borɔdɔma wɔ nnɛnkyɛmse so. Saa ara na worentumi nte bobe wɔ nkasɛɛ so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45"/><char style="wj">Onipa pa firi nnepa a ɛwɔ nʼakoma mu yɛ ade pa. Saa ara nso na onipa bɔne nso firi ne nnebɔne a ɛwɔ nʼakoma mu yɛ ade bɔne. Deɛ ahyɛ onipa akoma ma no, na ɛpue firi nʼano.</char><verse eid="LUK 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na mofrɛ me ‘Awurade,’ nanso monni mʼasɛm so?</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47"/><char style="wj">Merekyerɛ mo sɛdeɛ onipa biara a ɔba me nkyɛn, na ɔtie mʼasɛm di so no teɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48"/><char style="wj">Ɔte sɛ obi a na ɔresi ɛdan na ɔtwaa ne ɛdan no fapem ma ɛsii ɔbotan so. Na osuo tɔeɛ maa nsuo no yiri bɛbɔ faa ɛdan no ase nanso ammu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔsi sii ɔbotan so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ ɔte mʼasɛm na ɔnni so no, ɔte sɛ obi a ɔresi ɛdan, na ɔsii ɛdan no sii anwea so, na osuo tɔ maa nsuo no yiri bɛbɔ faa aseɛ ma ɛdwiriiɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 6:49"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsraani Panin Bi Gyidie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1"/>Yesu kasa kyerɛɛ nkurɔfoɔ no wieeɛ no, ɔkɔɔ Kapernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu na Roma ɔsraani panin bi ɔsomfoɔ a ɔpɛ nʼasɛm yie yare dendeenden a ɔreyɛ awu. <verse eid="LUK 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3"/>Ɔsraani panin no tee Yesu nka no, ɔsomaa Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ bi sɛ wɔnkɔsrɛ no na ɔmmɛsa ne ɔsomfoɔ no yadeɛ mma no. <verse eid="LUK 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4"/>Wɔduruu Yesu nkyɛn no, wɔde asɛm no too nʼanim srɛɛ no sɛ, ɔmmoa ɔsraani panin no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ onipa pa. <verse eid="LUK 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɔyɛ obi a ɔdɔ yɛn ɔman na wasi hyiadan ama yɛn.” <verse eid="LUK 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6"/>Yesu ne wɔn siim.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Wɔreyɛ aduru efie hɔ no, ɔsraani panin no somaa ne nnamfo bi sɛ, wɔnkɔka nkyerɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, nha wo ho, na mensɛ sɛ woba me fie. <verse eid="LUK 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7"/>Saa ara na memfata sɛ meba baabi a wowɔ. Kasa, na me ɔsomfoɔ no ho bɛyɛ no den. <verse eid="LUK 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8"/>Meyɛ obi a mehyɛ tumi ase, nanso mewɔ asraafoɔ bebree hyɛ mʼase. Meka kyerɛ wɔn mu bi sɛ, ‘Kɔ’ a, ɔkɔ. Meka kyerɛ ɔfoforɔ sɛ, ‘Bra’ a, ɔba. Na mehyɛ me ɔsomfoɔ sɛ, ‘Yɛ yei’ a, ɔyɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9"/>Yesu tee asɛm yi no, ne ho dwirii no na ɔdanee nʼani ka kyerɛɛ nnipakuo a wɔdi nʼakyi no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Anokwa, Israelman mu nyinaa, menhunuu obiara a ɔwɔ gyidie sɛ saa ɔbarima yi da.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10"/>Ɛberɛ a abɔfoɔ no sane kɔduruu efie hɔ no, wɔhunuu sɛ ɔsomfoɔ no ho ayɛ no den.<verse eid="LUK 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Nyane Okunafoɔ Bi Ba Wɔ Nain</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11"/>Yei akyi no, Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ ne nnipakuo bi a wɔka ne ho no kɔɔ kuro bi a wɔfrɛ no Nain mu. <verse eid="LUK 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12"/>Wɔduruu kurotia no, ɔhunuu sɛ wɔrekɔsie obi. Na owufoɔ no yɛ ɔbaa kunafoɔ bi a ɔwɔ kuro no mu no ba barima korɔ. Na adɔfoɔ bebree di amu no akyi. <verse eid="LUK 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13"/>Na Awurade hunuu no no, nʼasɛm yɛɛ no mmɔbɔ, na ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Gyae su!”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14"/>Yesu kɔsɔɔ efunu adaka no mu maa wɔn a ɛyɛ wɔn dea no gyinaeɛ. Ɔka kyerɛɛ owufoɔ no sɛ. <char style="wj">“Aberanteɛ, mese wo sɛ, nyane!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15"/>Aberanteɛ no sɔre tenaa ase na ɔkasaeɛ. Afei, Yesu de no maa ne maame.<verse eid="LUK 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16"/>Nnipa no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn yie na wɔyii Onyankopɔn ayɛ kaa sɛ, “Odiyifoɔ kɛseɛ bi asɔre wɔ yɛn mu, na Onyankopɔn asiane aba ne manfoɔ mu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17"/>Deɛ Yesu yɛeɛ yi ho asɛm trɛ kɔduruu Yudea ne nkuro a atwa ho ahyia no nyinaa mu.<verse eid="LUK 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yohane Osubɔni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18"/>Yohane asuafoɔ kɔbɔɔ no deɛ asi no nyinaa ho amaneɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19"/>Yohane somaa nʼasuafoɔ no mu baanu kɔɔ Yesu nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Wone deɛ ɔreba no, anaasɛ yɛntwɛn ɔfoforɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20"/>Asuafoɔ no duruu Yesu nkyɛn no, wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yohane Osubɔni asoma yɛn wo nkyɛn sɛ yɛmmɛbisa wo sɛ, wone deɛ ɔreba no anaasɛ yɛntwɛn ɔfoforɔ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, Yesu saa nyarewa bebree; ɔtuu ahonhommɔne na ɔmaa anifirafoɔ hunuu adeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ. <char style="wj">“Monkɔka deɛ moahunu na moate yi nkyerɛ Yohane sɛ, mema anifirafoɔ hunu adeɛ, mmubuafoɔ nante, mesa akwatafoɔ yadeɛ, asotifoɔ te asɛm, awufoɔ nyane, meka asɛmpa kyerɛ honhom mu ahiafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23"/><char style="wj">Nhyira ne deɛ merenyɛ no suntidua.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Di Yohane Ho Adanseɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24"/>Yohane asuafoɔ no firii Yesu nkyɛn kɔeɛ no, Yesu dii Yohane ho adanseɛ kyerɛɛ nnipakuo no. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mokɔɔ ɛserɛ so no, ɛdeɛn na mohunuiɛ? Ɛserɛ a mframa rehim no anaa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25"/><char style="wj">Na ɛnneɛ na ɛdeɛn na mohunuiɛ? Anaa na mosusu sɛ mobɛhunu ɔbarima bi a wahyehyɛ sɛ ɔhene ba te ahemfie?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26"/><char style="wj">Anaa Onyankopɔn odiyifoɔ? Ɛnneɛ, mereka makyerɛ mo sɛ, ɔsene odiyifoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27"/><char style="wj">Na saa Yohane yi na Atwerɛsɛm no ka fa ne ho sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Mɛsoma me ɔbɔfoɔ adi wʼanim ɛkan,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">
    <char style="wj">ɔno na ɔbɛsiesie ɛkwan ama wo.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28"/>
    <char style="wj">Meka kyerɛ mo sɛ onipa biara nni hɔ a wɔawo no a ɔyɛ kɛse sene Yohane. Nanso, deɛ ɔyɛ aketewa koraa wɔ Ɔsoro Ahennie mu no yɛ ɔkɛseɛ sene no!”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29"/>Na wɔn a wɔtee deɛ ɔkaeɛ no nyinaa a ɔtogyefoɔ mpo ka ho bi gye too mu sɛ, Onyankopɔn yɛ ɔteneneeni; na wɔsakyeraa wɔn adwene maa Yohane bɔɔ wɔn asu. <verse eid="LUK 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30"/>Na Farisifoɔ ne Mmaranimfoɔ no deɛ, wɔpoo Onyankopɔn asɛm enti, wɔamma Yohane ammɔ wɔn asu.<verse eid="LUK 7:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na menka mfa nnɛmmafoɔ yi ho; na ɛdeɛn ho na memfa wɔn ntoto?</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32"/><char style="wj">Wɔte sɛ mmɔfra bi a wɔregoro wɔ agodibea na wɔn mu bi reka akyerɛ afoforɔ sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Yɛtoo anigyeɛ nnwom maa mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">nanso moansa;</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">Yɛtoo awerɛhoɔ nnwom nso maa mo,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">
    <char style="wj">nanso moansu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 7:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33"/>
    <char style="wj">Yohane Osubɔni aba a ɔnnidi na ɔnnom nsã, nso mose, ‘Ɔwɔ honhommɔne.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34"/><char style="wj">Onipa Ba no nso aba a ɔdidi na ɔnom a mose, ‘Monhwɛ odidifoɔ ne ɔsanomfoɔ a ɔyɛ ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ adamfo!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wɔn a wɔdi Onyankopɔn akyi nokorɛ mu no deɛ, wɔn ɔbra di adanseɛ sɛ, nʼakwan nyinaa yɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔbaa Debɔneyɛfoɔ Sra Yesu Aduhwam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36"/>Farisini bi frɛɛ Yesu adidie ma ɔpenee so kɔeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37"/>Ɔte hɔ redidi no, ɔbaa bi a ɔbu ɔbra bɔne wɔ kuro no mu tee ne nka no, ɔde aduhwam bi a ɛsom bo tumpan ma kɔɔ hɔ. <verse eid="LUK 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38"/>Ɔkotoo Yesu nan ase suiɛ, maa ne nisuo no fɔɔ Yesu nan ase. Afei, ɔde ne tirinwi pepaa nisuo no, sɔɔ ne nan de aduhwam no sraa ho.<verse eid="LUK 7:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39"/>Farisini a ɔfrɛɛ Yesu adidi no hunuu deɛ ɔbaa no yɛeɛ no, ɔkaa wɔ ne tirim sɛ, “Sɛ saa onipa yi yɛ odiyifoɔ ampa ara a, anka ɔbɛhunu sɛ saa ɔbaa yi bu ɔbra bɔne.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40"/>Yesu hunuu Farisini no adwene ma ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Simon, mewɔ asɛm bi ka kyerɛ wo.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">Simon nso ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ka ɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Osikani bi bɔɔ nnipa baanu bi bosea. Ɔmaa ɔbaako denare aha enum; ɛnna ɔbaako no nso ɔmaa no denare aduonum.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42"/><char style="wj">Wɔn mu biara antumi antua ne ka a ɔde no no enti, ɔde kyɛɛ wɔn. Wɔn mu hwan na wogye di sɛ ɔbɛpɛ osikani no asɛm yie?”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43"/>Simon buaa sɛ, “Megye di sɛ deɛ ɔde ne ka kɛseɛ kyɛɛ no no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Woabua no yie.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44"/>Afei, Yesu danee nʼani kyerɛɛ ɔbaa no bisaa Simon sɛ, <char style="wj">“Woahunu saa ɔbaa yi? Mebaa wo fie, woamma me nsuo anhohoro me nan ase; nanso saa ɔbaa yi de ne nisuo ahohoro me nan ase, asane de ne tirinwi apepa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45"/><char style="wj">Mebaeɛ yi, woanyɛ me atuu amfa amma me akwaaba; nanso ɛfiri ɛberɛ a ɔbaa yi bɛtoo me wɔ ha yi, ɔnnyaee me nan mu sɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46"/><char style="wj">Woamfa ngo amfɔ me tirim; nanso ɔbaa yi de aduhwam a ɛsom bo asra me nan ase.</char> <verse eid="LUK 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47"/><char style="wj">Yei enti mereka akyerɛ wo sɛ, deɛ ɔbaa yi ayɛ enti, wɔde ne bɔne a ɛdɔɔso no akyɛ no, ɛfiri sɛ, wayi ɔdɔ kɛseɛ bi adi akyerɛ. Na deɛ wɔde ne bɔne a ɛsua akyɛ no no, ne dɔ nso sua.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔde wo bɔne akyɛ wo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49"/>Wɔn a ɔne wɔn te adidiiɛ no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, “Hwan ne saa onipa yi a ɔtumi de bɔne kyɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo gyidie agye wo nkwa. Fa asomdwoeɛ kɔ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 7:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Mmaa A Wɔdii Yesu Akyiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1"/>Yei akyi no, Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ dumienu no kyinkyinii Galilea nkuro ne nkuraa bi ase kaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛm. <verse eid="LUK 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2"/>Ɔrekɔ no, nnipa a na wɔdi nʼakyi no bi ne Maria Magdalene a ɔtuu ahonhommɔne nson firii ne mu no, <verse eid="LUK 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3"/>ne Yohana a ɔyɛ Kusa, Herode efie sohwɛfoɔ panin yere, ne Susana. Saa mmaa yi ne afoforɔ bi na wɔfiri wɔn ahonya mu hwɛɛ Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuafoɔ Gu Aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4"/>Ɛda bi a nnipa bebree bi firi nkuro nkuro so baa ne nkyɛn no, ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn abɛbuo mu sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5"/><char style="wj">“Ɛda bi, okuafoɔ bi kɔɔ nʼafuom kɔguu aba. Ɔguiɛ no, aba no bi kɔguu ɛkwan mu maa nnipa tiatiaa so na nnomaa bɛsosɔeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6"/><char style="wj">Ebi nso kɔguu abotan so, enti ɛfifiriiɛ no, ankyɛre na ne nyinaa hyeeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, annya nsuo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7"/><char style="wj">Aba no bi nso kɔguu nkasɛɛ mu. Ɛfifiriiɛ no, nkasɛɛ no kyekyeree no na ɛwuiɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8"/><char style="wj">Ebi nso kɔguu asase pa mu, ɛnyiniiɛ, soo aba mmɔho ɔha.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Na ɔkaa yei no, ɔka kaa ho sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɔwɔ aso a ɔbɛtie no, ɔntie.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9"/>Na nʼasuafoɔ no bisaa no saa abɛbuo yi ase no, <verse eid="LUK 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10"/>ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo deɛ, wɔde Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho ahintasɛm ama mo, na afoforɔ deɛ, wɔkasa kyerɛ wɔn abɛbuo mu,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛhwɛ, nanso wɔrenhunu</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">
    <char style="wj">na wɔbɛte, nanso wɔrente aseɛ.’</char><verse eid="LUK 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Abɛbuo No Asekyerɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, abɛbuo no asekyerɛ ni. Aba no ne Onyankopɔn asɛm.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu ɛkwan mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔate Onyankopɔn asɛm no na ɔbonsam bɛhwim firi wɔn akoma mu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔrennye nni na wɔrennya nkwagyeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu abotan so no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte asɛm no na wɔde anigyeɛ sɔ mu, nanso ɛntim wɔn mu. Na ɛsiane wɔn gyidie a ɛsua no enti, ɛnkyɛre na asɛm no awu. Na sɛ sɔhwɛ ba wɔn so a, wɔpa aba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu nkasɛɛ mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm, na wɔdi so, nanso asetena mu haw ne abɛbrɛsɛ, ahonya ne ewiase afɛfɛdeɛ enti, asɛm no ntumi nyɛ wɔn mu adwuma sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15"/><char style="wj">Aba a ɛguu asase pa mu no gyina hɔ ma wɔn a wɔde akoma pa tie asɛmpa no, na wɔdi so, gyina pintinn de abrabɔ pa di ho adanseɛ.</char><verse eid="LUK 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanea Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obi nsɔ kanea na ɔmfa kɛntɛn mmutu so, anaa ɔmfa nhyɛ mpa ase na mmom, ɔde si kaneadua so na ahyerɛn ama wɔn a wɔba mu no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17"/><char style="wj">Deɛ ahinta no bɛda adi, na deɛ ɛwɔ kɔkoam no nso ada dwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18"/><char style="wj">Enti deɛ motie no, montie no yie. Obiara a ɔwɔ no wɔbɛma no pii aka ho, na deɛ ɔnni ahe bi no, deɛ ɔsusu sɛ ɛyɛ ne dea no mpo, wɔbɛgye afiri ne nsam.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Maame Ne Ne Nuanom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19"/>Ɛda bi, Yesu maame ne ne nuanom pɛɛ sɛ wɔne no kasa, nanso ɛsiane nnipakuo a na wɔatwa ne ho ahyia no enti, wɔantumi ne no ankasa. <verse eid="LUK 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20"/>Obi kɔka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ ne maame ne ne nuanom gyina nkyɛn hɔ baabi rehwehwɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me maame ne me nuanom ne wɔn a wɔtie Onyankopɔn asɛm na wɔdi so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Brɛ Mframa A Ɛyɛ Den Ase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ te kodoɔ mu no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma yɛntwa nkɔ asuogya nohoa.”</char> Wɔsiim a wɔrekɔ no, <verse eid="LUK 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23"/>Yesu daeɛ. Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, mframa a ano yɛ den bi bɔ maa nsuo bɛtaa kodoɔ no mu maa kodoɔ no yɛɛ sɛ ɛremem. Yei maa asuafoɔ no akoma tuu yie.<verse eid="LUK 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24"/>Asuafoɔ no de hu ne nteateam nyanee no sɛ, “Awurade, Awurade, yɛremem!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Amonom hɔ ara, Yesu sɔre teateaa mframa a ano yɛ den ne asorɔkye no ma ɛyɛɛ dinn.<verse eid="LUK 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25"/>Afei, ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na monni gyidie?”</char> Wɔn nyinaa suroeɛ de ahodwirie bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ. “Onipa bɛn ni a mframa a ano yɛ den ne asorɔkye mpo tie no yi?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tu Ɔbarima Bi Ahohommɔne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no twaa ɛpo no bɛduruu Gerasefoɔ asase a ɛne Galilea di nhwɛanimu no so. <verse eid="LUK 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27"/>Yesu firii kodoɔ no mu sii fam pɛ, ɔbarima bi a ahonhommɔne ahyɛ no ma akyɛre a ɔda adagya na ɔnte efie, na mmom ɔte amusieeɛ a aboda mu na ɔdeda no bɛhyiaa no. <verse eid="LUK 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28"/>Ɔhunuu Yesu no, ɔteaam, kotoo ne nan ase sane teateaam sɛ, “Yesu, Ɔsorosoro Onyankopɔn Ba, ɛdeɛn na wo ne me wɔ yɛ? Mesrɛ wo, nyɛ me ayayadeɛ biara.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29"/>Ɔkaa saa asɛm yi, ɛfiri sɛ, na Yesu ateatea ahonhommɔne no sɛ wɔmfiri ne mu. Saa ahonhommɔne yi taa ka no na sɛ wɔde ahoma kyekyere ne nsa ne ne nan mpo a, ɔtumi tete mu ma ahonhommɔne no pam no kɔ wiram.<verse eid="LUK 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo din de sɛn?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Ɔbuaa no sɛ, “Ɛdɔm.” Ɛfiri sɛ na ahonhommɔne ahyɛ no ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31"/>Ahohommɔne no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔnnhyɛ wɔn mma wɔnkɔgu amanehunu bɔn no mu.<verse eid="LUK 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32"/>Saa ɛberɛ no mu na mprako bi redidi wɔ bepɔ no nkyɛn mu baabi. Ahohommɔne no srɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔmma wɔn ho ɛkwan na wɔnkɔwura mprako no mu. Na ɔmaa wɔn ho kwan. <verse eid="LUK 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33"/>Enti ahonhommɔne no firii ɔbarima no mu kɔwuraa mprako no mu ma wɔbɔɔ kiridi, sianee bepɔ no kɔguu ɔtadeɛ no mu wuwuiɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34"/>Wɔn a wɔhwɛ mprako no so no hunuu deɛ asi no, wɔde hu ne ahopopoɔ tutuu mmirika kɔbɔɔ amaneɛ wɔ kurom maa asɛm no trɛeɛ wɔ mpɔtam hɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="LUK 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35"/>Nnipa a wɔtee asɛm no bɔɔ twi kɔhwɛɛ deɛ asi. Wɔduruu deɛ Yesu wɔ no, wɔhunuu ɔbarima no sɛ ne ho atɔ no a ɔfira ntoma te Yesu nkyɛn. Nnipa no nyinaa ho dwirii wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36"/>Na wɔn a wɔhunuu ɛkwan a Yesu faa so saa ɔbarima no yadeɛ no bɔɔ wɔn a wɔbaa hɔ no amaneɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37"/>Ehu hyɛɛ Gerasefoɔ a na wɔahyia hɔ no nyinaa ma ma wɔsrɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔmfiri wɔn nkyɛn hɔ nkɔ. Yei enti, Yesu kɔtenaa kodoɔ no mu sane tware kɔɔ asuogya hɔ nohoa.<verse eid="LUK 8:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38"/>Ansa na Yesu rebɛfiri hɔ no, ɔbarima a ɔtuu ahonhommɔne firii ne mu no srɛɛ no sɛ ɔne no bɛkɔ. Nanso, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39"/><char style="wj">“Kɔ na kɔdi deɛ Onyankopɔn ayɛ ama wo no ho adanseɛ kyerɛ wo manfoɔ.”</char> Ɔbarima no firii hɔ kɔdii anwanwadeɛ a Yesu ayɛ ama no no ho adanseɛ kyerɛɛ kurom hɔfoɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="LUK 8:39"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yairo Babaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40"/>Yesu duruu asuogya hɔ no, nnipakuo no de anigyeɛ hyiaa no kwan, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔatwɛn no abrɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41"/>Ɔbarima bi a wɔfrɛ no Yairo a na ɔyɛ Yudafoɔ hyiadan mu panin baa ne nkyɛn, bɛbuu no nkotodwe, srɛɛ no sɛ, ɔne no nkɔ ne fie <verse eid="LUK 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42"/>na ne babaa korɔ a wadi bɛyɛ mfeɛ dumienu reyɛ awu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ɛberɛ a Yesu rekɔ no na nnipakuo no kyere ne so. <verse eid="LUK 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43"/>Ɔbaa bi a mogya atu no mfirinhyia dumienu a obiara ntumi nsa no yadeɛ no, <verse eid="LUK 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44"/>firii Yesu akyi sɔɔ nʼatadeɛ ano. Amonom hɔ ara, mogya a ɛtu no no twaeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45"/>Yesu bisaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwan na ɔsɔɔ mʼatadeɛ ano no?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Obiara buaa sɛ, ɛnyɛ ɔno. Yei maa Petro kaa sɛ, “Awurade, na sɛ nnipa no akyere wo so.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Dabi, obi asɔ mʼatadeɛ mu ɛfiri sɛ, mete nka sɛ tumi bi afiri me mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47"/>Ɔbaa no hunuu sɛ ɔhinta a ɛrenyɛ yie, ɛno enti, ɔde hu ne ahopopoɔ bɛbuu Yesu nkotodwe wɔ nnipa no nyinaa anim, kyerɛɛ no deɛ enti a ɔsɔɔ ne mu ne sɛdeɛ ne ho atɔ no no. <verse eid="LUK 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me ba, wo gyidie ama wo ho ayɛ wo den. Fa asomdwoeɛ kɔ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49"/>Yesu gu so rekasa no, obi firi Yairo efie bɛka kyerɛɛ Yairo sɛ, “Wo babaa no anya awu enti nha Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no bio.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50"/>Yesu tee asɛm no, ɔsee Yairo sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsuro, gye di, na wo babaa no bɛnyane anya nkwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51"/>Ɔduruu efie hɔ no, wamma obiara anka ne ho ankɔ ɛdan a abɔfra no da mu no mu gye Petro, Yohane, Yakobo ne abɔfra no awofoɔ nko ara. <verse eid="LUK 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52"/>Na nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa resu, di awerɛhoɔ. Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnsu, ɔnwuiɛ na wada.”</char><verse eid="LUK 8:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53"/>Wɔseree no dii ne ho fɛw, ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔn deɛ, wɔnim pefee sɛ wawu. <verse eid="LUK 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54"/>Yesu sɔɔ ne nsa ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me ba, sɔre!”</char> <verse eid="LUK 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55"/>Amonom hɔ ara, ɔsɔreeɛ na Yesu kaa sɛ wɔmma no biribi nni. <verse eid="LUK 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56"/>Nʼawofoɔ no ho dwirii wɔn yie nanso Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ, wɔnnka deɛ asi no nkyerɛ obiara.<verse eid="LUK 8:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Dumienu No Soma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1"/>Ɛda bi Yesu frɛɛ Dumienu no hyiaeɛ maa wɔn tumi ne ahoɔden a wɔde bɛtu ahonhommɔne na wɔde asa nyarewa nso. <verse eid="LUK 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2"/>Afei, ɔsomaa wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔka Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho asɛm na wɔnsa nyarewa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo akwantuo yi mu, mommfa biribiara nkɔ, sɛ ɛyɛ poma anaa akwantubɔtɔ, anaa aduane biara, anaa sika, anaa ntadeɛ mmienu mmienu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mokɔ kuro bi mu a, efie biara a mobɛsoɛ mu no, ɛhɔ ara na montena kɔsi sɛ mobɛfiri kuro no mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mokɔ kuro biara mu na wɔannye mo, na morefiri hɔ akɔ a, momporoporo mo nan ase mfuturo mfa nkyerɛ sɛ, mo ne wɔn nni hwee yɛ bio.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6"/>Wɔfirii hɔ no, wɔkɔɔ nkuraaseɛ nkuraaseɛ kɔkaa asɛmpa no, saa nyarewa pii nso.<verse eid="LUK 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Herode Pɛ Sɛ Ɔhunu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7"/>Ɔmansinihene Herode tee deɛ Yesu ayɛ no nyinaa no, ɛhaa no yie, ɛfiri sɛ, na ebinom keka sɛ Yohane Osubɔni na wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu, <verse eid="LUK 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8"/>na afoforɔ nso se ɛyɛ Elia anaa tete adiyifoɔ no mu baako na wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu aba. <verse eid="LUK 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9"/>Herode kaa sɛ, “Yohane deɛ, matwa ne ti, na hwan koraa ne saa onipa yi a mete anwanwasɛm a ɛte sɛɛ yi fa ne ho yi?” Yei enti, ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔhu no.<verse eid="LUK 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ma Nnipa Mpemnum Aduane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10"/>Asomafoɔ no firii wɔn akwantuo mu baeɛ no, wɔbɔɔ nsɛm a ɛsisii hɔ nyinaa ho amaneɛ kyerɛɛ Yesu. Yei akyi, Yesu ne wɔn twee wɔn ho kɔɔ baabi a ɛbɛn Betsaida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11"/>Nnipakuo no hunuu deɛ Yesu ne nʼasomafoɔ no wɔ no, wɔtii wɔn ma ɔgyee wɔn fɛw so, kaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho asɛm kyerɛɛ wɔn, saa ayarefoɔ yadeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12"/>Anim rebiribiri no, dumienu no baa ne nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ka kyerɛ nnipa no na wɔnkɔ nkuro ne nkuraa a atwa yɛn ho ahyia yi mu nkɔpɛ deɛ wɔbɛdi ne deɛ wɔbɛda ɛfiri sɛ, baabi a yɛwɔ yi yɛ ɛserɛ so.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo ara momma wɔn biribi nni.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Yɛwɔ burodo enum ne mpataa mmienu pɛ. Ɛno enti, gye sɛ yɛkɔtɔ aduane brɛ wɔn nyinaa.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14"/>Na nnipa bɛyɛ mpemnum na wɔahyia wɔ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ na nnipa no ntenatena ase aduonum aduonum.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15"/>Wɔyɛɛ sɛdeɛ Yesu kaeɛ no. <verse eid="LUK 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16"/>Afei, Yesu faa burodo enum no ne mpataa mmienu no na ɔhwɛɛ soro, hyiraa so, bubuu mu de maa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ wɔnkyɛ mma nnipa no. <verse eid="LUK 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17"/>Obiara didi meeɛ. Afei, asuafoɔ no boaboaa deɛ wɔdi ma ɛkaeɛ no ano no, ɛyɛɛ nkɛntɛmma dumienu.<verse eid="LUK 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Kyerɛ Onipa Ko A Yesu Yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18"/>Ɛda bi Yesu nko ara kɔhyɛɛ baabi bɔɔ mpaeɛ. Yei akyi no, ɔbisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnipa ka sɛ mene hwan?”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19"/>Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Ebinom ka sɛ, woyɛ Yohane Osubɔni, ebinom nso ka sɛ Elia, na afoforɔ nso sɛ, woyɛ tete adiyifoɔ no baako a wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu aba.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Na mo nso mose mene hwan?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Petro buaa no sɛ, “Wone Kristo, deɛ Onyankopɔn asoma no no.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyɛ Ne Owuo Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21"/>Yesu bɔɔ wɔn ano sɛ wɔnnka nkyerɛ obiara. <verse eid="LUK 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22"/>Ɔtoaa so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛsɛ sɛ Kristo no hunu amane pii; Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ ne asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ nso bɛpo no. Akyire no, wɔbɛkum no, na ne nnansa so wasɔre.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23"/>Afei, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn nyinaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔdi mʼakyi a, ɔmpa ne ho akyi na daa ɔnsoa nʼasɛnnua na ɔnni mʼakyi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔma nʼani ku ne ho sene me no, ɔbɛhwere ne nkwa; na deɛ me enti ɔbɛhwere ne nkwa no, ne nsa bɛka.</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25"/>Na sɛ onipa nya ewiase yi mu nneɛma nyinaa na ɔhwere ne kra a, ɛdeɛn mfasoɔ na ɔbɛnya? <verse eid="LUK 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ nʼani bɛwu me ne me nsɛm ho no, ɔno nso, da a me, Kristo bɛba wɔ me ne Agya no ne abɔfoɔ kronkron no animuonyam mu no, mʼani bɛwu ne ho.</char><verse eid="LUK 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, mo a mogyina ha yi mu bi wɔ hɔ a wɔrenwu kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛhunu Onyankopɔn Ahennie no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Animuonyam Da Adi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28"/>Yesu kaa ne nsɛm yi wieeɛ no, ɛbɛyɛ nnawɔtwe akyi, ɔne Petro, Yohane ne Yakobo kɔɔ bepɔ bi so sɛ wɔrekɔbɔ mpaeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29"/>Na Yesu gu so rebɔ mpaeɛ no, nʼanimdua sesaeɛ, na nʼatadeɛ nso hyerɛneeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30"/>Prɛko pɛ, nnipa baanu a ɛyɛ Mose ne Elia ne no bɛkasaeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31"/>Saa nnipa baanu yi bɛpuee hɔ animuonyam mu kaa ne wuo a ɔbɛwu wɔ Yerusalem no ho asɛm kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="LUK 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Petro ne nnipa a wɔka ne ho no adeda hatehatee na wɔnyanenyanee a wɔn ani so tetee wɔn no, wɔhunuu Yesu sɛ ɔwɔ nʼanimuonyam mu ne nnipa baanu bi a wɔka ne ho. <verse eid="LUK 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33"/>Na ɛbaa sɛ nnipa no refiri Yesu nkyɛn akɔ no, Petro ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, ɛyɛ sɛ yɛn nso yɛwɔ ha bi. Ma yɛmmɔ asese mmiɛnsa; wo deɛ baako, Mose deɛ baako na Elia nso deɛ baako.” Na Petro nnim asɛm a ɔreka no.<verse eid="LUK 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34"/>Ɔgu so rekasa no, omununkum bɛkataa wɔn so ma wɔsuroeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35"/>Na nne bi firi omununkum no mu kaa sɛ, “Yei ne me Ba a mayi no. Montie no!” <verse eid="LUK 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36"/>Kasa yi akyi no, wohunuu sɛ aka Yesu nko ara na ɔgyina hɔ. Na mmerɛ no mu, wɔanka deɛ wɔhunuiɛ no ankyerɛ obiara.<verse eid="LUK 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Otwafoɔ Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a wɔsiane firii bepɔ no so baeɛ no, nnipakuo bi bɛhyiaa Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38"/>Ɔbarima bi firi nnipakuo no mu teaam sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, mesrɛ wo, bra bɛhwɛ me ba a medi no ba korɔ ma me; <verse eid="LUK 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39"/>sɛ honhommɔne ba ne so a, amonom, ɔteaam, ɔtwa hwe, ɔsensene, nʼano pu ahuro, na ɔbu fa so, na ɛkyɛ ansa na afiri ne so. <verse eid="LUK 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40"/>Na mesrɛɛ wʼasuafoɔ no sɛ wɔntu honhommɔne no, nanso wɔantumi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ao! Mo a monni gyidie, mentena mo nkyɛn na mennya mo ho boasetɔ nkɔsi da bɛn!”</char> Afei, ɔdanee nʼani ka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Fa wo ba no bra ha.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42"/>Ɔde abɔfra no reba no, honhommɔne no twaa no hwee fam ma ɔsenseneeɛ. Nanso, Yesu teateaa honhommɔne no maa abɔfra no ho yɛɛ no den na ɔde no maa nʼagya. <verse eid="LUK 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43"/>Onyankopɔn tumi ne ne kɛseyɛ a ɛdaa adi wɔ honhommɔne no tu mu no maa nnipa no ho dwirii wɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Na wɔredwennwene deɛ asi yi ho no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44"/><char style="wj">“Montie asɛm a merebɛka yi yie. Wɔrebɛyi Onipa Ba no de no ahyɛ wɔn a wɔwɔ tumi no nsa.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 9:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45"/>Deɛ ɔkaeɛ yi na ɛyɛ ahintasɛm enti, asuafoɔ no ante aseɛ. Nanso, na wɔsuro sɛ wɔbɛbisa no aseɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Deɛ Ɔyɛ Kɛseɛ Onyankopɔn Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46"/>Asuafoɔ no gyee akyinnyeɛ a ɛfa wɔn mu deɛ ɔbɛyɛ kɛse Onyankopɔn Ahennie mu no ho. <verse eid="LUK 9:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47"/>Na Yesu hunuu wɔn adwene no, ɔsɔɔ abɔfra bi mu de no bɛgyinaa ne nkyɛn pɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 9:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48"/>na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔbɛgye saa abɔfra yi wɔ me din mu no, gye me; na deɛ ɔgye me no nso, gye deɛ ɔsomaa me no. Deɛ ɔyɛ aketewa wɔ mo nyinaa mu no, ɔno ne ɔkɛseɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49"/>Yohane nso ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Awurade, yɛhunuu obi a ɔnka yɛn ho sɛ ɔde wo din tu ahonhommɔne enti yɛbraa no.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ anka mobra no, ɛfiri sɛ, deɛ ɔntia mo no, na ɔwɔ mo afa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:50"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samariafoɔ Bi Po Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51"/>Na ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ Yesu sane kɔ ɔsoro no rebɛn no, ɔsii ne bo sɛ ɔbɛkɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52"/>Ansa na ɔrebɛkɔ no, ɔsomaa nnipa bi dii ɛkan kɔɔ Samaria akuraa bi ase sɛ wɔnkɔsiesie baabi mma no. <verse eid="LUK 9:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53"/>Nanso, Samariafoɔ no annye Yesu, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔhunuu sɛ na ɔrekɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54"/>Asuafoɔ no tee deɛ aba no, Yakobo ne Yohane bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, wopɛ sɛ yɛma ogya firi ɔsoro bɛhye wɔn pasaa anaa?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55"/>Yesu danee nʼani kyerɛɛ wɔn kaa wɔn anim, <verse eid="LUK 9:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56"/>na wɔfirii hɔ kɔɔ akuraa foforɔ bi ase.<verse eid="LUK 9:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Akyiridie Mu Brɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔrekɔ no, ɔbarima bi baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛdi wʼakyi.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sakraman wɔ abɔn, ewiem nnomaa nso wɔ mpirebuo, nanso me, Onipa Ba no deɛ, menni baabi a mede me tiri to!”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ ɔbarima foforɔ bi nso sɛ, <char style="wj">“Bɛdi mʼakyiri.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Nanso, ɔbarima no kaa sɛ, “Awurade, ma me ɛkwan na menkɔsie mʼagya ansa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ma wɔn a wɔte ase na wɔawu wɔ honhom mu no nyɛ saa nnwuma no, na wo deɛ, kɔka Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛm kyerɛ amanaman nyinaa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61"/>Na ɔfoforɔ nso kaa sɛ, “Awurade, mɛdi wʼakyi; nanso ma me kwan na me ne mʼabusuafoɔ nkɔdi nkra ansa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62"/>Nanso, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔbɛma nʼadwene ayɛ no ntanta wɔ dwumadie bi a mede ahyɛ ne nsa no ho no, mfata Onyankopɔn Ahennie no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 9:62"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Asuafoɔ Aduɔson No Soma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1"/>Yei akyi, Yesu yii nʼakyidifoɔ no mu aduɔson somaa wɔn baanu baanu kɔɔ nkuro ne nkuraa a akyire no ɔbɛkɔ hɔ no so. <verse eid="LUK 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Otwa adwuma no dɔɔso, nanso adwumayɛfoɔ no sua. Enti, monsrɛ adwumawura no na ɔmma adwumayɛfoɔ bebree mmra ne twa adwuma no mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3"/><char style="wj">Monkɔ, na meresoma mo sɛ nnwan akɔ mpataku mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4"/><char style="wj">Mommfa sika, akwantubɔtɔ anaa mpaboa; na monnkyea obiara nso a mobɛhyia no wɔ ɛkwan so.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ mokɔ efie biara mu a, monni ɛkan nkyea efie hɔfoɔ no sɛ, ‘Asomdwoeɛ nka mo!’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ asomdwoeɛ ba bi wɔ hɔ a, mo asomdwoeɛ bɛba ne so; na sɛ obi a ɔte saa nni hɔ a, mo asomdwoeɛ bɛsane aba mo nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7"/><char style="wj">Efie biara a mokɔ mu no, momma ɛhɔ nyɛ mo atenaeɛ; aduane biara a wɔde bɛma mo no, monni, ɛfiri sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ odwumayɛfoɔ biara nya nʼadwumayɛ so akatua; monnni atutena wɔ afie mu.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ mokɔ kuro biara mu na wɔgye mo fɛw so a, aduane biara a wɔde bɛma mo no, monni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9"/><char style="wj">Monsa kuro no mu ayarefoɔ yadeɛ, na monka nkyerɛ ɛhɔfoɔ nyinaa sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn Ahennie no abɛn mo.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ mokɔ kuro biara mu na wɔannye mo fɛw so a, monkɔ ne mmɔntene so nkɔpae mu nka sɛ,</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11"/><char style="wj">‘Mo kurom ha mfuturo a ɛwɔ yɛn nan ase mpo, yɛreporoporo agu, de atia mo; na mmom monhunu pefee sɛ, Onyankopɔn Ahennie no abɛn.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, saa kuro no, asɛm a ɛbɛto wɔn Atemmuo da no bɛsene deɛ ɛtoo Sodom no.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Korasin, due! Betsaida, due! Anwanwadeɛ a meyɛɛ wɔ mo mu no, sɛ meyɛɛ wɔ Tiro ne Sidon a, anka ɛhɔfoɔ no de awerɛhoɔ ne ahonuo asakyera wɔn adwene dada.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, asɛm a ɛbɛto wɔn no bɛsene deɛ ɛbɛto Tiro ne Sidon.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15"/><char style="wj">Na wo Kapernaum, wopɛ sɛ woma wo ho so, nanso wɔbɛbrɛ wo ase de wo akɔ asaman.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔtie mo no tie me, na deɛ ɔpo mo no po me, na deɛ ɔpo me no nso po deɛ ɔsomaa me no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aduɔson No Amanneɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17"/>Aduɔson no sane de anigyeɛ baeɛ bɛbɔɔ amaneɛ sɛ, “Awurade, wo din enti, ahonhommɔne mpo abrɛ wɔn ho ase ama yɛn.”<verse eid="LUK 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mehunuu sɛ ɔbonsam rete afiri ɔsoro sɛ anyinam abɛhwe fam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19"/><char style="wj">Mama mo tumi ne ahoɔden a mode bɛtiatia awɔ ne anyanyankyerɛ ne ɔtamfoɔ no tumi biara a ɔwɔ so, na biribiara nso rentumi mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20"/><char style="wj">Nanso mommma mo ani nnye sɛ ahonhommɔne brɛ wɔn ho ase ma mo, na mmom, momma mo ani nnye sɛ wɔatwerɛ mo din wɔ ɔsoro.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Aseda Mpaeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, Yesu de Honhom Kronkron mu anigyeɛ bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Agya, ɔsoro ne asasewura, meda wo ase sɛ wode saa nneɛma yi ahinta wɔn a wɔsusu sɛ wɔyɛ anyansafoɔ, na mmom woada nokorɛ no adi akyerɛ wɔn a wɔde ahobrɛaseɛ gye wo di sɛ mmɔfra no. Nanso, Agya, wo pɛ mu na woma ɛbaa saa.</char><verse eid="LUK 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mʼagya de nneɛma nyinaa ahyɛ me nsa; na obiara nnim Ɔba no, gye Agya no. Saa ara nso na obiara nnim Agya no, gye Ɔba no ne wɔn a Ɔba no bɛda Agya no adi akyerɛ wɔn no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23"/>Ɛkaa ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nhyira ne aniwa a ɛhunu deɛ mohunu!</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, adiyifoɔ ne ahene pii pɛɛ sɛ anka wɔhunu deɛ mohunu yi na wɔte deɛ mote yi, nanso wɔanhunu na wɔante.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mmaranimfoɔ Bi Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25"/>Mmaranimfoɔ bi pɛɛ sɛ ɔsɔ Yesu hwɛ enti ɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, menyɛ dɛn na manya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26"/>Yesu nso bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na wɔatwerɛ wɔ Mose mmara no mu? Na wote aseɛ sɛn?”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27"/>Ɔbuaa no sɛ, “Mmara no ka sɛ, ‘Fa wʼakoma, ne wo kra, ne wʼahoɔden, ne wʼadwene nyinaa dɔ Awurade, wo Onyankopɔn, na dɔ wo yɔnko sɛ wo ho!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Woabua no yie. Yɛ yeinom na wobɛnya nkwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29"/>Nanso, ɔbarima no pɛɛ sɛ ɔkyerɛ sɛ ɔdi mmara no nyinaa so enti, ɔbisaa Yesu sɛ, “Hwan ne me yɔnko?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Samariani A Ɔhunuu Mmɔbɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30"/>Yesu nso maa no mfatoho bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛda bi na ɔbarima bi retu ɛkwan firi Yerusalem akɔ Yeriko. Na ɔnam ɛkwan so no, ɔkɔtɔɔ akwanmukafoɔ mu na wɔgyee ne ho nneɛma nyinaa, hwee no, pirapiraa no ma ɔtɔɔ baha, gyaa no too kwankyɛn kɔeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31"/><char style="wj">Ankyɛre biara, Yudani ɔsɔfoɔ bi bɛpuee ne so, nanso ɔmane faa nkyɛn kɔeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na Lewini bi nso bɛpuee ne so mane faa nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33"/><char style="wj">Ankyɛre biara na Samariani bi nso bɛpuee hɔ. Ɔhunuu no no, ɔyɛɛ no mmɔbɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34"/><char style="wj">Ɔkɔkotoo ne nkyɛn, hohoroo nʼapirakuro no anim, de aduro guguu mu, kyekyereeɛ. Afei, ɔmaa no so de no tenaa nʼafunumu so dii aboa no nkyɛn de no kɔɔ ahɔhobea bi hwɛɛ no anadwo mu no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35"/><char style="wj">Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ɔgyaa ahɔhobea sohwɛfoɔ no sika a ɛbɛso no hwɛ sɛ ɔmfa nhwɛ no. Ɔsane hyɛɛ no bɔ sɛ, ‘Ɛka foforɔ biara a wobɛbɔ wɔ ne ho no, mɛba abɛtua.’</char><verse eid="LUK 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, saa nnipa baasa yi mu hwan na ɔyɛɛ ne yɔnko?”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37"/>Mmaranimfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Deɛ ɔhunuu opirafoɔ no mmɔbɔ no.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wo nso, kɔ na kɔyɛ saa ara.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Marta Ne Maria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38"/>Ɛbaa sɛ Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ rekɔ Yerusalem no, wɔkɔduruu akuraa bi ase. Wɔduruu hɔ no, ɔbaa bi a wɔfrɛ no Marta de no kɔɔ ne fie. <verse eid="LUK 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39"/>Marta nuabaa bi a wɔfrɛ no Maria tenaa fam wɔ Yesu nkyɛn tiee no. <verse eid="LUK 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, Marta a nʼani abere reyɛ aduane no baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Awurade, mayɛ adwuma abrɛ enti ka kyerɛ Maria na ɔmmɛsɔ me mu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41"/>Awurade buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Marta, Marta, wodwennwene ha wo ho wɔ nneɛma pii ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42"/><char style="wj">Adeɛ baako pɛ na ɛhia; ɛno na Maria afa no; na wɔrennye mfiri ne nsam.”</char><verse eid="LUK 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kyerɛ Mpaeɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1"/>Ɛda bi, na Yesu rebɔ mpaeɛ wɔ baabi. Ɔwieeɛ no, nʼasuafoɔ no mu baako ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Awurade, kyerɛ yɛn mpaeɛbɔ, sɛdeɛ Yohane kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ mpaeɛbɔ no.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ morebɔ mpaeɛ a, monka sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">“‘Agya,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">wo din ho nte,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">
    <char style="wj">wʼahennie mmra.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3"/>
    <char style="wj">Ma yɛn yɛn daa aduane ɛnnɛ.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4"/>
    <char style="wj">Fa yɛn bɔne kyɛ yɛn</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">sɛdeɛ yɛde wɔn a wɔfom yɛn no bɔne kyɛ wɔn no.</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">
    <char style="wj">Na mma yɛnkɔ sɔhwɛ mu.’”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mu hwan na ɔbɛkɔ ne yɔnko hɔ dasuo mu akɔka akyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Me nua, fɛm me aduane kakra,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6"/><char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, ɔhɔhoɔ bi abɛfu me mu, na menni aduane biara a mede bɛma no,’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7"/><char style="wj">na ɔbɛma no mmuaeɛ afiri ne dan mu sɛ, ‘Nha me! Mato me ɛpono mu ne me mma ada. Merentumi nsɔre mma wo biribiara.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, na ade asa no enti, ɔyɛ ne yɔnko koraa mpo a, ɔrensɔre. Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ ɔkɔɔ so srɛɛ no no enti, ɛbɛma wasɔre ama no deɛ ɛhia no no nyinaa.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛno enti mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ; Mommisa, na wɔbɛma mo; monhwehwɛ na mobɛhunu; mompem na wɔbɛbue mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔbisa no, wɔma no; na obiara a ɔhwehwɛ no, ɔhunu; na deɛ ɔpem no, wɔbue no.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Agya bɛn na ɔwɔ mo mu na ne ba bisa no burodo a ɔbɛma no ɛboɔ,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12"/><char style="wj">anaasɛ ɔbisa no apataa a, ɔbɛma no ɔwɔ, anaasɛ ɔbisa nkosua a ɔbɛma no nyanyankyerɛ?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ mo a moyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ mpo nim sɛdeɛ moma mo mma nnepa a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na mo Agya a ɔwɔ ɔsoro no remfa Honhom Kronkron no mma wɔn a wɔbisa no no!”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ne Beelsebul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14"/>Ɛberɛ bi Yesu tuu honhommɔne bi a ɛyɛ mumu firii onipa bi mu. Honhommɔne no tu firii ne mu no, ɔkasaeɛ ma ɛyɛɛ nnipa a na wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa ahodwirie. <verse eid="LUK 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15"/>Nanso, ebinom kaa sɛ, “Ɔnam ahonhommɔne panin Beelsebul tumi so na ɛtu ahonhommɔne.” <verse eid="LUK 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16"/>Afoforɔ nso pɛɛ sɛ wɔsɔ no hwɛ enti, wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ɔnyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi a ɛfiri ɔsoro nkyerɛ wɔn.<verse eid="LUK 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17"/>Nanso, ɔhunuu wɔn adwene maa wɔn mmuaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kuro biara a emu akyekyɛ no dane amamfo. Saa ara nso na efie biara a emu kyekyɛ no guo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔbonsam nso ko tia ne ho a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na nʼahennie agyina? Deɛ enti a mereka saa asɛm yi ne sɛ, mose menam Beelsebul tumi so na metu ahonhommɔne.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ menam Beelsebul tumi so na metu ahonhommɔne a, hwan so na mo nkurɔfoɔ nam tu ahonhommɔne? Saa na ɛteɛ de a, mo nkurɔfoɔ no ara na wɔbɛbu mo atɛn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20"/><char style="wj">Nanso, sɛ menam Onyankopɔn tumi so na ɛtu honhommɔne de a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no aba mo so.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ ɔhoɔdenfoɔ de akodeɛ wɛn ne fie a, obiara rentumi nkɔwia nʼagyapadeɛ;</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22"/><char style="wj">nanso, sɛ deɛ ne ho yɛ den na ɔwɔ akodeɛ pa sene no kɔ ne so a, ɔdi ne so nkonim, gye nʼakodeɛ a ɔde ne ho too so no, sesa nʼagyapadeɛ no nyinaa kɔ.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔnni mʼafa no tia me, na deɛ ɔne me mmoaboa ano no, hwete mu.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wɔtu honhommɔne firi onipa bi mu a, ɛkyinkyini hwehwɛ homebea, nanso, ɛnnya bi. Na sɛ wannya homebea a, ɔka sɛ, ‘Mɛsane akɔ onipa a mifirii ne mu baeɛ no mu bio.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔsane kɔ onipa no mu a, ɔbɛhunu sɛ ɛhɔ te a ɛfi biara nni mu na biribiara yɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26"/><char style="wj">Afei, ɔsane nʼakyi kɔfa ahonhommɔne afoforɔ nson a wɔyɛ den kyɛn no ba ma wɔn nyinaa bɛtena hɔ. Yei ma onipa no sɛe koraa sene sɛdeɛ anka na ɔte kane no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adeɛ A Ɛho Hia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27"/>Yesu gu so rekasa no, ɔbaa bi firi nnipakuo no mu kaa sɛ, “Nhyira nka yafunu a ɛwoo wo ne nufoɔ a wonumuu ano!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛwom deɛ, nanso nhyira ne wɔn a wɔte Onyankopɔn asɛm na wɔdi so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yudafoɔ Bisa Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29"/>Nnipa no kyeree Yesu so no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nnɛmma yi yɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ. Wɔhwehwɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi ahunu nanso wɔrenhunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ biara sɛ Yona nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30"/><char style="wj">Na sɛdeɛ Yona yɛeɛ no yɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ maa Ninewefoɔ a, saa ara na Kristo nso bɛyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ama nnɛmma yi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, Seba Ɔhemmaa bɛsɔre atia ɔman yi, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔfiri asase ano nohoa bɛtiee Salomo nyansa nsɛm. Nanso, deɛ ɔsene Salomo no wɔ ha.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32"/><char style="wj">Atemmuo da no, Ninewe mmarima bɛsɔre atia nnɛmma yi na wɔabu mo fɔ ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ a Yona kaa asɛmpa no, wɔnuu wɔn ho. Nanso, deɛ ɔsene Yona wɔ ha.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kanea Adwuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara nsɔ kanea mfa nsie, na mmom, ɔde si petee mu na ahyerɛn ama wɔn a wɔba mu no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34"/><char style="wj">Wʼani yɛ wo onipadua kanea. Ɛno enti, sɛ wʼani yɛ a, na wo onipadua nso yɛ hann. Nanso, sɛ ɛnyɛ a, ɛma wo onipadua no dane sum tumm.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35"/><char style="wj">Enti hwɛ yie na hann a ɛwɔ wo mu no annane sum.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wo onipadua yɛ hann a esum nni fa baabiara a, onipadua no bɛhyerɛn sɛdeɛ kanea hyerɛn gu wo so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisini Bi Efie Adidie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37"/>Yesu kasa wieeɛ no, Farisini bi hyiaa no adidie enti ɔkɔeɛ sɛ ɔne no rekɔdidi. <verse eid="LUK 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38"/>Farisini no hunuu sɛ Yesu anhohoro ne nsa ansa sɛdeɛ wɔn amanneɛ kyerɛ ansa na ɔredidi no, ɛyɛɛ no nwanwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39"/>Yesu hunuu Farisini no adwene ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo Farisifoɔ deɛ, mohohoro nkukuo ne nwowaa ho, nanso efi, anibereɛ ne nnebɔne ahyɛ mo ma tɔ!</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40"/><char style="wj">Adwenemherɛfoɔ! Ɛnyɛ deɛ ɔyɛɛ akyire no ara na ɔyɛɛ emu nso?</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41"/><char style="wj">Monyɛ ahiafoɔ adɔeɛ na biribiara ho bɛte ama mo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo Farisifoɔ, monnue! Moma mo nnɔbaeɛ so ntotosoɔ dudu, nanso mototo adeteneneeyɛ ne ɔdɔ a mode dɔ Onyankopɔn no ase. Sɛ mokɔ hyiadan mu a, mpanin tenaberɛ na mopɛ. Saa ara nso na sɛ mokɔ badwa mu a, mopɛ sɛ nnipa hunu mo kyea mo.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo Farisifoɔ, monnue! Sɛ mokɔ hyiadan mu a, mpanin tenaberɛ na mopɛ.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Ɛfiri sɛ, mote sɛ adamena a ɛso asram na nnipa nante so a wɔnnim sɛ wɔnam adamena so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45"/>Mmaranimfoɔ no mu baako ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, sɛ woka saa a na woakasa atia yɛn nso.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mmaranimfoɔ nso, monnue! Mohyɛ mmara a ɛyɛ den ma nnipa, nanso mo deɛ, monni so sɛ sɛdeɛ ɛsɛ.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnue! Ɛfiri sɛ, moatoto adiyifoɔ a mo ankasa anaa mo agyanom kumm wɔn no nna so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48"/><char style="wj">Mo nneyɛeɛ yi di adanseɛ sɛ mopene deɛ mo agyanom yɛeɛ no so. Nʼasekyerɛ ne sɛ, mo agyanom kunkumm adiyifoɔ no na mo nso mototoo wɔn nna so maa wɔn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49"/><char style="wj">Yei ne deɛ Onyankopɔn aka afa mo ho: ‘Mɛsoma adiyifoɔ ne asomafoɔ aba mo nkyɛn na mobɛkunkum bi na moataa wɔn a aka no.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, adiyifoɔ no mogya a wɔka gu firi ewiase ahyɛaseɛ no,</char> <verse eid="LUK 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51"/><char style="wj">ɛfiri Habel kum so kɔsi Sakaria, a wɔkumm no wɔ afɔrebukyia ne kronkronbea ntam hɔ no so, wɔbɛbisa ɛho asɛm afiri mo nkyɛn.</char><verse eid="LUK 11:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo, mmaranimfoɔ, monnue! Mode nokorɛ hinta mo nkurɔfoɔ. Mo ankasa monni so, na mommma wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔdi so no kwan mma wɔnni so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53"/>Ɔfiri Farisini no efie hɔ a ɔrekɔ no, mmaranimfoɔ ne Farisifoɔ no dii nʼakyi de nsɛmmisa dwanee ne ho, <verse eid="LUK 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54"/>pɛɛ sɛ ɔka biribi a wɔbɛgyina so anya no akyere no.<verse eid="LUK 11:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Nyaatwomyɛ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1"/>Nnipa mpempem kyeree so a wɔnnya baabi ntu wɔn nan nsi mpo no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no kane sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yie wɔ Farisifoɔ nyaatwom a ɛte sɛ mmɔreka no ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2"/><char style="wj">Biribiara a wɔyɛ no kɔkoam no bɛda adi na deɛ ahinta no nso bɛpue.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3"/><char style="wj">Enti, deɛ moaka wɔ sum mu no, wɔbɛte wɔ hann mu. Na deɛ moaka no asomusɛm wɔ adan mu no, wɔbɛbɔ no dawuro.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onipa A Monsuro No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Me nnamfonom, mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, monnsuro wɔn a wɔkum onipadua na ɛno akyi wɔntumi nyɛ hwee bio no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5"/><char style="wj">Na mɛkyerɛ mo deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ mosuro no. Monsuro deɛ wakum onipadua no awie no, ɔwɔ tumi sɛ ɔto twene amanehunu kurom. Mereti mu akyerɛ mo sɛ, yei na monsuro no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6"/><char style="wj">Wɔntɔn akasanoma enum nnye sika bi pɛ? Nanso, Onyankopɔn werɛ remfi wɔn mu baako po da.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7"/><char style="wj">Mo tirinwi mpo, wɔakan ne nyinaa. Enti, monnsuro, ɛfiri sɛ, mosom bo sene akasanoma dodo biara.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo Ne Honhom Kronkron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔbɛbɔ me din wɔ nnipa anim no, Kristo no nso bɛbɔ ne din wɔ Onyankopɔn abɔfoɔ anim.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ ɔbɛpa me nnipa anim no, me nso mɛpa no, Onyankopɔn abɔfoɔ anim.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔbɛkasa atia Kristo no, wɔde bɛkyɛ no. Nanso deɛ ɔbɛkasa atia Honhom Kronkron no deɛ, wɔremfa nkyɛ no da.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wɔde mo ba mpanin anim wɔ hyia adan mu a, monnnwennwene nsɛm a mobɛka anaasɛ deɛ mode bɛyi mo ho ano no ho,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, saa ɛberɛ no ara mu Honhom Kronkron no bɛkyerɛ mo deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ moka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adifudepɛ Ho Kɔkɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13"/>Obi firi nnipa no mu ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, ka kyerɛ me nua na ɔne me nkyɛ agyapadeɛ a yɛn agya de agya yɛn no mu.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Damfo, hwan na ɔyɛɛ me mo so ɔtemmufoɔ ne ɔsɛnnifoɔ?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15"/>Ɔtoaa so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho yie wɔ adifudepɛ ho, ɛfiri sɛ, onipa nkwa nnyina nʼahonya dodoɔ a ɔwɔ so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16"/>Afei, ɔbuu wɔn bɛ yi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔdefoɔ bi wɔ hɔ a na ɔwɔ asase pa a ɛmaa no nnɔbaeɛ pii.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ na ne nnɔbaeɛ no nkɔ pata a wabɔ no so enti, ɛyɛɛ no dadwene ma ɔbisaa ne ho sɛ, ‘Mennya baabi a mede me nnɔbaeɛ bebrebe yi bɛgu yi, menyɛ no dɛn?’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Afei, ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Monim deɛ mɛyɛ. Mɛbubu mʼapata yi nyinaa na mabɔ no akɛseɛ de deɛ mewɔ nyinaa asie hɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19"/><char style="wj">Na maka akyerɛ me kra sɛ, “Ɔkra, ma wʼani nnye na didi, na nom ɛfiri sɛ, wowɔ nneɛma pa pii a ɛbɛso wo mfeɛ bebree!” ’</char><verse eid="LUK 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Ɔkwasea! Anadwo yi, wɔbɛgye wo kra afiri wo nsam, na hwan na nneɛma bebree a woapɛ agu hɔ yi, wode bɛgya no?</char>’<verse eid="LUK 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛno enti, saa ara na obiara a ɔbɛboaboa agyapadeɛ ano de ne ho ato so no nyɛ ɔdefoɔ Onyankopɔn anim ne no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fa Wo Ho To Onyankopɔn So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnnwennwene deɛ mobɛdi anaa deɛ mobɛfira ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23"/><char style="wj">Ɔkra som bo sene aduane na onipadua nso som bo sene ntoma.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ kwaakwaadabi, wɔnnua aba ɛnna wɔntwa. Saa ara nso na wɔnni pata a wɔde wɔn nnɔbaeɛ sie so, nanso Onyankopɔn ma wɔn aduane di. Monsom bo nsene wɔn anaa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25"/><char style="wj">Mo mu hwan na adwene a ɔdwen no bɛtumi ato ne nkwa nna so simasin?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ montumi nyɛ ade ketewaa a ɛte sei mpo a, adɛn na modwennwene nneɛma akɛseɛ ho?</char><verse eid="LUK 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ sɛdeɛ sukooko nyini. Wɔnyɛ adwuma, ɛnna wɔnnwono ntoma mfira. Nanso, Salomo ahonya nyinaa mu, na ɔnni ntoma a ɛyɛ fɛ sɛ saa nhwiren no mu baako mpo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28"/><char style="wj">Mo a mo gyidie hinhim, sɛ Onyankopɔn siesie wiram nhwiren a ɛfifiri ɛnnɛ na ɔkyena awu no ho ma ɛyɛ fɛ a, adɛn enti na ɔrensiesie mo nso mo ho mma ɛnyɛ fɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na monnnwennwene deɛ mobɛdi anaa deɛ mobɛnom ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30"/><char style="wj">Saa nneɛma yi na ewiase amanaman pere hwehwɛ, nanso mo deɛ, mo agya nim sɛ yeinom nyinaa ho hia mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31"/><char style="wj">Enti, monhwehwɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie kane na ɔde yeinom nyinaa bɛma mo.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ekuo ketewa, monnsuro, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛyɛ mo agya no pɛ sɛ ɔde ahennie no bɛma mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33"/><char style="wj">Montontɔn mo ahodeɛ na monkyɛ ahiafoɔ adeɛ. Yei bɛma mo agyapadeɛ a ɛwɔ ɔsoro no ayɛ pii. Monhyehyɛ mo agyapadeɛ wɔ ɔsoro, deɛ owifoɔ ntumi nkɔwia na ntɛferɛ ntumi nkɔwe.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34"/><char style="wj">Na deɛ wʼagyapadeɛ wɔ no, ɛhɔ na wʼakoma nso wɔ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Monwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monnyina pintinn na momma mo nkanea nhyerɛn,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36"/><char style="wj">na monyɛ sɛ wɔn a wɔretwɛn wɔn wura a ɔkɔ ayeforɔhyia ase a, sɛ ɔba na ɔbɔ ɛpono mu pɛ a, wɔbɛbue no ntɛm no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔn wura no ba a ɔbɛba abɛto wɔn sɛ wɔretwɛn no no ani bɛgye. Ɔbɛto wɔn ɛpono na ɔno ankasa asom wɔn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɔba dasuo mu anaa ahemadakye mpo a, asomfoɔ a ɔbɛba abɛto wɔn sɛ wɔrewɛn no no ani bɛgye.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39"/><char style="wj">Ɛsɛ sɛ mohunu sɛ, sɛ efiewura nim ɛberɛ a owifoɔ bɛba a, anka ɔbɛwɛn na owifoɔ no annya ne ho ɛkwan ammɛbɔ no korɔno.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40"/><char style="wj">Enti, monsiesie mo ho ntwɛn Onipa Ba no ba a ɔbɛba no, ɛfiri sɛ, monnim ɛberɛ ko a ɔbɛba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41"/>Petro bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, worebu bɛ yi akyerɛ yɛn nko ara anaasɛ obiara?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merekasa akyerɛ ɔsomfoɔ nokwafoɔ nyansafoɔ biara a ne wura de ne efie sohwɛ bɛhyɛ ne nsa na wahwɛ ama obiara aduane wɔ ne berɛ mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43"/><char style="wj">Nhyira ne ɔsomfoɔ a ne wura no bɛba abɛto no sɛ wayɛ nʼadwuma pɛpɛɛpɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44"/><char style="wj">Nokorɛm, ɔde nʼagyapadeɛ nyinaa bɛhyɛ ne nsa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɛba sɛ saa ɔsomfoɔ yi nso ka sɛ, ‘Me wura nnya mmaeɛ’ na ɛno enti, ɔhwe asomfoɔ a aka no, na ɔdidi, nom nsã bo a,</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46"/><char style="wj">ne wura no bɛba da a nʼani nna so sɛ ɔbɛba. Na sɛ ne wura no ba a, ɔbɛtwe nʼaso denden na wabu no sɛ obi a ɔnnye Onyankopɔn nni.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsomfoɔ a ɔnim deɛ ne wura pɛ, na wanyɛ ne wura no apɛdeɛ no wɔbɛbɔ no mmaa pii.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48"/><char style="wj">Na ɔsomfoɔ a ɔnnim deɛ ne wura pɛ na enti ɔyɛɛ deɛ ne wura mpɛ no, wɔbɛbɔ no mmaa kakraa bi. Na obiara a wɔama no pii no, wɔbɛbisa pii afiri ne nkyɛn; na deɛ wɔde bebree ahyɛ ne nsa no, ɔbɛbu bebree ho nkonta.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:48"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpaapaemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49"/>
    <char style="wj">“Maba sɛ merebɛsɔ ogya wɔ asase so na sɛ asɔ dada a, na deɛ merehwehwɛ ara ne no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50"/><char style="wj">Asubɔ bi wɔ hɔ a wɔde bɛbɔ me a, ɛde me bɛkɔ amanehunu mu, na merennya ahotɔ gye sɛ wɔabɔ me saa asu no ansa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51"/><char style="wj">Mosusu sɛ mebaeɛ sɛ mede asomdwoeɛ reba asase yi so? Dabi! Ɛnyɛ asomdwoeɛ na mede baeɛ na mmom mpaapaemu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri ɛnnɛ, mpaapaemu bɛba afie mu, baasa bɛba mʼafa na baanu atia me anaasɛ baanu bɛba mʼafa na baasa atia me.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53"/><char style="wj">Agya ne ne babarima renyɛ adwene, ɔbabaa ne ne maame renyɛ adwene, ase ne ase adwene renhyia.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ nnipakuo no nso sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mohunu sɛ osuo amuna wɔ atɔeɛ a, ntɛm ara, moka sɛ, ‘Osuo bɛtɔ!’ Na osuo tɔ ampa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ mohunu sɛ mframa bɔ firi anafoɔ reba a, moka sɛ, ‘Ahuhuro bɛba!’ Na ɛba mu ampa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56"/><char style="wj">Mo nyaatwomfoɔ! Motumi kyerɛ ewiem nsakraeɛ ase, nanso nneɛma a ɛnnɛ yi atwa mo ho ahyia, ne deɛ ɛbɔ mo kɔkɔ no deɛ, monhunu.</char><verse eid="LUK 12:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57"/>
    <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na monim deɛ ɛyɛ na monyɛ?</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58"/><char style="wj">Sɛ wode obi ka a, bɔ mmɔden kɔhunu no na wone no nka ho asɛm na wamfa wo ankɔ asɛnniiɛ amma ɔtemmufoɔ amfa wo anto afiase.</char> <verse eid="LUK 12:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59"/><char style="wj">Sɛ woanyɛ no saa a, ɔbɛma woatua ka a wode no no nyinaa ansa na wagyaa wo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 12:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Sakyera Anaasɛ Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, nnipa bi bɛka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, Pilato akum Galileafoɔ bi a wɔrebɔ afɔdeɛ ama Onyankopɔn, de wɔn mogya fraa afɔrebɔ no. <verse eid="LUK 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mogye di sɛ saa Galileafoɔ no yɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ sene wɔn a aka no nyinaa enti na wɔkumm wɔn no?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3"/><char style="wj">Dabi, sɛ mo nso moannu mo ho a, wɔbɛkunkum mo saa ara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4"/><char style="wj">Anaasɛ mosusu sɛ nnipa dunwɔtwe a Siloa abantenten no bu guu wɔn so, kumm wɔn no yɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ sene nnipa a na wɔte Yerusalem no?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5"/><char style="wj">Dabi, mo nso moannu mo ho a, mobɛwuwu saa ara.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6"/>Afei, Yesu buu wɔn bɛ yi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbarima bi duaa borɔdɔma wɔ ne turo mu. Ɛda bi ɔkɔɔ turo no mu hɔ sɛ ɔrekɔte ɛso aba no bi nanso wannya bi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7"/><char style="wj">Ɛno akyi, ɔfrɛɛ turo no sohwɛfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Mfeɛ mmiɛnsa ni, ɛberɛ biara a mɛba sɛ merebɛte borɔdɔma no bi no, mennya bi. Adɛn enti na ɛresɛe kwa yi? Twa twene.’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Turo no sohwɛfoɔ no srɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Me wura, ma ɛnsi hɔ afeɛ yi nso na mengugu aseɛ sumina nhwɛ</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9"/><char style="wj">sɛ ebia, ɛbɛso aba bi anaa, na sɛ antumi anso a, ɛnneɛ mɛtwa atwene.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Yadeɛ Homeda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10"/>Homeda bi a Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ hyiadan mu no, <verse eid="LUK 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11"/>na ɔbaa bi wɔ hɔ a honhommɔne mu yadeɛ bi akyere no mfeɛ dunwɔtwe ama ne mu akoa a ɔntumi ntene ne mu koraa. <verse eid="LUK 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12"/>Yesu hunuu no no, ɔfrɛɛ no firii nnipa no mu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbaa, wo ho nyɛ wo den.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13"/>Ɔde ne nsa guu ne so, na amonom hɔ ara ɔtumi tenee ne mu. Na ɔbaa no yii Onyankopɔn ayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14"/>Hyiadan no so panin a ɔhunuu ɔbaa no ayaresa no de abufuo kaa sɛ, “Nnansia na ɛsɛ sɛ mode yɛ adwuma a saa nna no mu na ɛsɛ sɛ moba ma wɔsa mo yadeɛ, na ɛnyɛ homeda.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15"/>Na Awurade buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nyaatwomfoɔ! Mo mu hwan na ɔnsane ne nantwie anaa nʼafunumu na ɔnka no nkɔnom nsuo homeda?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16"/><char style="wj">Adɛn enti na Abraham aseni yi a ɔbonsam afa no dommum mfeɛ dunwɔtwe ni no, ɛnsɛ sɛ mesa no yadeɛ homeda?”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17"/>Ɔkaa saa no, wɔn a na wɔne nʼadwene nhyia no nyinaa ani wuiɛ. Nnipa no nso a na wɔwɔ hyiadan no mu nyinaa ani gyee nʼanwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ a ɔyɛeɛ no nyinaa ho.<verse eid="LUK 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyina Aba Ne Mmɔka Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18"/>Afei, Yesu hyɛɛ aseɛ kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn Ahennie no ho asɛm, na ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onyankopɔn Ahennie no te sɛn? Na ɛdeɛn na memfa nto ho nkyerɛkyerɛ aseɛ?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19"/><char style="wj">Onyankopɔn Ahennie no te sɛ onyina aba ketewa bi a obi dua wɔ nʼafuo mu na ɛnyini yɛɛ dutan kɛseɛ ma ewiem nnomaa kɔnwono wɔn mpirebuo wɔ so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20"/>Ɔbisaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn bio na memfa ntoto ho nkyerɛ aseɛ?</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21"/><char style="wj">Ɛte sɛ mmɔreka bi a burodotofoɔ de fotɔ mmɔre ma ɛtu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛpono Teateaa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu rekɔ Yerusalem no, ɔkyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ nkuro so ne nkuraa ase ansa na ɔreduru hɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23"/>Ne nkyerɛkyerɛ no mu no, obi bisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, nnipa kakra bi na wɔbɛgye wɔn nkwa anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Ɔbuaa no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24"/><char style="wj">“Mompere nhyɛne ɛpono teateaa no mu, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa pii bɛpere sɛ wɔbɛwura mu, nanso wɔrentumi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɛba sɛ efiewura no ato ɛpono no mu a, mobɛba abɛgyina akyire abɔ mu, aka sɛ, ‘Owura, yɛsrɛ wo, bue yɛn.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">
    <char style="wj">“Na ɔno nso abisa mo sɛ, ‘Mofiri he? Mennim mo?’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na mo nso moaka akyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Yɛne wo too nsa didii na wokyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔ yɛn mmorɔno so.’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na efiewura no nso bɛbisa mo bio sɛ, ‘Mofiri he? Mennim mo. Momfiri mʼani so nkɔ, mo nnebɔneyɛfoɔ!’</char><verse eid="LUK 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na sɛ mohunu Abraham, Isak, Yakob ne nkɔmhyɛfoɔ no nyinaa sɛ wɔwɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu na montumi nkɔ hɔ bi a, mode mo nsa bɛgu mo ti atwa agyaadwoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29"/><char style="wj">Nnipa firi apueeɛ ne atɔeɛ bɛhyia wɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu ato nsa adidi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30"/><char style="wj">Na monkae sɛ akyikafoɔ bi wɔ hɔ a, wɔbɛdi ɛkan, na adikanfoɔ bi nso wɔ hɔ a, wɔbɛka akyi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Twa Yerusalem Ho Agyaadwoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu Farisifoɔ bi baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Firi ha kɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, Herode rehwehwɛ wo akum wo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkɔka nkyerɛ sakraman no sɛ, ‘metu ahonhommɔne, na masa nyarewa ɛnnɛ ne ɔkyena na ne nnansa so no, mɛduru Yerusalem.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33"/><char style="wj">Nanso, ɛsɛ sɛ menante ɛnnɛ ne ɔkyena ne nʼadekyeeɛ, na ɛtwa ara na ɛtwa sɛ odiyifoɔ bɛwu wɔ Yerusalem!</char><verse eid="LUK 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yerusalem, Yerusalem, wo a wokum adiyifoɔ na wosi wɔn a wɔsoma wɔn wo nkyɛn no aboɔ! Mpɛn ahe ni a mepɛɛ sɛ meboaboa wo mma ano sɛ akokɔbaatan boaboa ne mma ano ne ntaban ase, nanso moampene so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35"/><char style="wj">Na mo afie bɛdane afituo na morenhunu me kɔsi sɛ mobɛka sɛ, ‘Nhyira ne deɛ ɔnam Awurade din mu reba no!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 13:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sa Yadeɛ Homeda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1"/>Homeda bi, Farisini panin bi too nsa frɛɛ Yesu adidi. Adidie no ase hɔ no, na wɔn a wɔahyia no nyinaa rehwɛ deɛ Yesu bɛyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2"/>Na ɔbarima bi wɔ hɔ a ɔyare ahonhono. <verse eid="LUK 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3"/>Yesu bisaa Farisifoɔ no ne mmaranimfoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mmara ma ho kwan sɛ wɔsa yadeɛ homeda anaa?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4"/>Wɔammua no. Enti, Yesu sɔɔ ɔyarefoɔ no mu saa no yadeɛ, gyaa no kwan.<verse eid="LUK 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn a wɔahyia hɔ no nyinaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mo mu hwan na sɛ nʼafunumu tɔ abura mu homeda a ɔrenyi no da no ara?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6"/>Nanso, wɔantumi ammua no.<verse eid="LUK 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7"/>Afei, Yesu hunuu sɛ, nnipa a wɔfrɛɛ wɔn adidi no ase no mu biara pɛɛ sɛ ɔtena mpanin tenabea no, ɔbuu wɔn bɛ bi sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8"/><char style="wj">“Sɛ obi to nsa frɛ wo apontoɔ ase a, mpere wo ho nkɔtena mpanin tenabea, ɛfiri sɛ, ebia na wato nsa afrɛ onipa titire bi a ɔsene wo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɛba saa a, deɛ ɔtoo nsa frɛɛ wo no bɛtu wo afiri akonnwa a wote so no so de ama deɛ ɔsene wo no na wode aniwuo akɔtena akyire baabi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10"/><char style="wj">Enti, sɛ obi hyia wo apontoɔ ase a, kɔtena akyire baabi na sɛ deɛ ɔhyiaa wo no bɛhunu wo a, waka akyerɛ wo sɛ, ‘Onua, sɔre na kɔtena mpanin tenabea.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11"/><char style="wj">Na obiara a ɔma ne ho so no, wɔbɛbrɛ no ase, na deɛ ɔbrɛ ne ho ase no, wɔbɛma no so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12"/>Afei, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ Farisini a ɔtoo nsa frɛɛ no no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ woto ɛpono a mfrɛ wo nnamfo, wo nuanom, wʼabusuafoɔ ne asikafoɔ a wo ne wɔn bɔ fipam nko ara; sɛ woyɛ saa a, wɔn nso bɛto nsa afrɛ wo bi na ɛba saa a, na wonyɛɛ hwee.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ woto ɛpono a, hyia ahiafoɔ, mmubuafoɔ, mpakye ne anifirafoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14"/><char style="wj">Esiane sɛ wɔntumi nyɛ saa bi mma wo no enti, ɛda a ateneneefoɔ bɛsɔre afiri awufoɔ mu no, Onyankopɔn bɛhyira wo.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apontoɔ Kɛseɛ Bi Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15"/>Wɔn a wɔte adidiiɛ no mu baako tee deɛ Yesu kaeɛ no, ɔkaa sɛ, “Nhyira nka deɛ ɔbɛdidi wɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛda bi ɔbarima bi too ɛpono kɛseɛ hyiaa nnipa bebree.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17"/><char style="wj">Adidi berɛ duruiɛ no, ɔsomaa ne ɔsomfoɔ bi sɛ ɔnkɔfrɛ wɔn a wɔahyia wɔn no sɛ wɔmmra.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, wɔn nyinaa yiyii wɔn ho wɔn ho ano. Deɛ ɔdi ɛkan no yii ne ho ano sɛ, ‘Matɔ asase a ɛnnɛ na ɛsɛ sɛ mekɔhwɛ enti mesrɛ no sɛ merentumi mma.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Na ɔfoforɔ nso yii ne ho ano sɛ, ‘Matɔ anantwie edu a mede wɔn bɛyɛ mʼafuo a ɛnnɛ na ɛsɛ sɛ mekɔsɔ wɔn hwɛ enti mesrɛ no sɛ merentumi mma.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔfoforɔ bi nso yii ne ho ano sɛ, ‘Afei na maware, enti merentumi mma.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsomfoɔ no sane bɛbɔɔ ne wura no amaneɛ no, ɔde abufuo somaa no bio sɛ, ‘Ka wo ho kɔ mmɔntene so ne mmantam na kɔfrɛfrɛ ahiafoɔ, mmubuafoɔ, anifirafoɔ ne mpakye sɛ wɔmmra.’</char><verse eid="LUK 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsomfoɔ no kɔfrɛfrɛɛ nnipa no baeɛ, nanso na afa da so wɔ hɔ ara.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛno enti, owura no sane somaa no sɛ, ‘Kɔ akwan so ne mfikyire na frɛ obiara a wobɛhunu no no sɛ, mato ɛpono, enti wɔmmra.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24"/><char style="wj">Na merema woate aseɛ sɛ, nnipa a metoo nsa hyiaa wɔn no mu biara nni hɔ a mʼaduane yi bi bɛka nʼano da biara da.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Akyiridie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25"/>Ɛda bi a na nkurɔfoɔ akuakuo bi di Yesu akyi no, ɔdanee ne ho ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26"/><char style="wj">“Sɛ obi pɛ sɛ ɔdi mʼakyi a, ɛsɛ sɛ ɔdɔ me sene nʼawofoɔ, ne yere, ne mma, ne nuanom ne nʼankasa ho, anyɛ saa a, ɔrentumi nyɛ me suani.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔdi mʼakyi na ɔntumi nnyina amanehunu ano no, rentumi nyɛ me suani.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo mu hwan na ɔpɛ sɛ ɔsi aban a ɔrentena ase nsese nhwɛ sɛ ɔwɔ sika a ɔde bɛwie?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29"/><char style="wj">Anyɛ saa na ɔhyɛ ɛdan no ase na wantumi anwie a, wɔn a wɔhunu no nyinaa bɛsere no,</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30"/><char style="wj">aka sɛ, ‘Onipa yi hyɛɛ aseɛ sɛ ɔresi ɛdan, nanso wantumi anwie’.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anaasɛ ɔhene bɛn na ɔkura asraafoɔ ɔpedu na ɔrekɔhyia ɔsahene foforɔ a ɔkura asraafoɔ ɔpeduonu a, ɔrenkari ne ho nhwɛ ansa na wakɔ akono?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔhwɛ na ɔrentumi nso a, ansa koraa na ɔsahene foforɔ no bɛbɛn no no, ɔtu abɔfoɔ kɔhunu no sɛ, ɔmma wɔnsiesie wɔn ntam na asomdwoeɛ mmra.</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33"/><char style="wj">Ɛno enti, obiara a wampa ne ho akyi no rentumi nyɛ me suani.</char><verse eid="LUK 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nkyene yɛ dɛ. Na sɛ ɛyera ne dɛ a, ɛkwan bɛn so na wɔbɛfa ama ayɛ dɛ bio?</char> <verse eid="LUK 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35"/><char style="wj">Ɛho nni mfasoɔ mma biribiara. Wɔbɛto agu.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">
    <char style="wj">“Deɛ ɔwɔ aso a ɔbɛtie no, ɔntie.”</char><verse eid="LUK 14:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Odwan A Ɔyeraeɛ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1"/>Ɛda bi ɔtogyefoɔ ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ pii baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛtiee no, <verse eid="LUK 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2"/>Farisifoɔ ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no hunuu yei no, wɔnwiinwii kaa sɛ, “Saa ɔbarima yi gye nnebɔneyɛfoɔ sane ne wɔn to nsa didi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3"/>Saa asɛm a wɔkaeɛ no ma ɔbuu wɔn bɛ bi sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4"/><char style="wj">“Mo mu hwan na sɛ ɔwɔ nnwan ɔha na wɔn mu baako yera a, ɔrennya aduɔkron nkron no hɔ nkɔkyinkyini ɛserɛ so nhwehwɛ deɛ wayera no kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛhunu no?</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔhunu no a, ɔde no abɔ ne kɔn ho, de anigyeɛ de no aba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔduru efie a, wafrɛfrɛ ne nnamfo ne nʼafipamfoɔ nyinaa aka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Momma yɛnnye yɛn ani, ɛfiri sɛ, mahunu me odwan a ɔyeraeɛ no.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ baako nu ne ho a, ɔsorofoɔ nyinaa ani gye sene sɛ ateneneefoɔ aduɔkron nkron wɔ hɔ a ahonu ho nhia wɔn no.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Anaasɛ ɔbaa bɛn na sɛ ne sika mpɔ edu mu baako yera a, ɔrensɔ kanea, mprapra ne dan mu, nhwehwɛ kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛhunu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ ɔhunu a, ɔremfrɛfrɛ ne nnamfo ne nʼafipamfoɔ nyinaa nka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Momma yɛn ani nnye, ɛfiri sɛ, mahunu me sika mpɔ a ɛyeraeɛ no’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ baako nu ne ho a, Onyankopɔn abɔfoɔ ani gye ara ne no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔyeraba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11"/>Yesu sane buu wɔn ɔyera ho ɛbɛ bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbarima bi wɔ hɔ a na ɔwɔ mmammarima baanu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12"/><char style="wj">Wɔn mu akumaa no ka kyerɛɛ nʼagya no sɛ, ‘Me agya, fa me kyɛfa a mewɔ wɔ wʼagyapadeɛ mu no ma me!’ Ɔbarima no kyɛɛ nʼagyapadeɛ mu de ne ba no kyɛfa maa no.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nna tiawa bi akyi no, ne ba kumaa yi boaboaa nʼahodeɛ nyinaa ano tuu ɛkwan kɔɔ akyirikyiri asase bi so kɔbɔɔ ahohwi bra, hweree nʼahodeɛ nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14"/><char style="wj">Ɛno akyi no, ɛkɔm kɛseɛ bi baa asase no so maa ne ho kyeree no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15"/><char style="wj">Ɛbaa saa no, ɔde ne ho kɔdanee kuromani bi a ɔma ɔkɔhwɛɛ ne mprako so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16"/><char style="wj">Ɔwɔ hɔ no, ɛkɔm dee no maa ne kɔn dɔɔ sɛ anka ɔbɛnya aduane a mprako no di no bi mpo adi, nanso, wannya.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nʼani baa ne ho so no, ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Apaafoɔ a wɔwɔ mʼagya efie didi mee, ma ebi ka ma wɔto gu. Adɛn na mete ha na ɛkɔm rekum me yi!</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18"/><char style="wj">Mɛsɔre akɔ mʼagya nkyɛn na maka makyerɛ no sɛ, Agya, mayɛ ɔsoro ne wo bɔne,</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19"/><char style="wj">na memfata sɛ wɔfrɛ me wo ba bio; fa me yɛ wʼapaafoɔ no mu baako.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20"/><char style="wj">Ɔsiim sɛ ɔresane aba nʼagya nkyɛn.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">
    <char style="wj">“Ɔnam ɛkwan so akyirikyiri reba no, nʼagya no hunuu no, enti ɔde ayamhyehyeɛ yɛɛ ntɛm kɔhyiaa no, bam no, yɛɛ no atuu.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21"/>
    <char style="wj">“Aberanteɛ yi ka kyerɛɛ nʼagya no sɛ, ‘Agya, mayɛ ɔsoro ne wo bɔne, na memfata sɛ wofrɛ me wo ba bio.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nʼano ansi koraa na nʼagya no frɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Monka mo ho nkɔfa ntoma pa mmɛfira no na monhyɛ no pɛtea ne mpaboa a ɛyɛ fɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23"/><char style="wj">Afei, monkɔkum nantwie ba a wadɔre sradeɛ no mfa nyɛ aduane, na yɛnnidi, nnom, nnye yɛn ani,</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24"/><char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, na mesusu sɛ meba yi awu, sɛ nso na ɔte ase; ɔyeraeɛ, nanso wasane aba.’ Wɔhyɛɛ aseɛ gyee wɔn ani.</char><verse eid="LUK 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne ba panin a na ɔfiri afuom reba no duruu afikyire no, ɔtee nnwontoɔ ne ahurisidie wɔ efie hɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26"/><char style="wj">Ɛno enti ɔfrɛɛ asomfoɔ no mu baako bisaa no deɛ ɛrekɔ so wɔ efie hɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27"/><char style="wj">Ɔsomfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Wo nua no asane aba a biribiara anyɛ no enti, wʼagya akum nantwie ba a wadɔre sradeɛ no ama no.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔtee saa asɛm yi no, ne bo fuiɛ enti ɔyɛɛ nʼadwene sɛ ɔrenkɔ efie hɔ. Nʼagya tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔfirii adi baa ne nkyɛn bɛkorɔkorɔɔ no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29"/><char style="wj">Ne ba no de awerɛhoɔ buaa no sɛ, ‘Agya, masom wo mfeɛ dodoɔ yi nyinaa a deɛ wobɛka biara metie, nanso wommaa me odwan ba mpo da sɛ menkum na me ne me nnamfonom mfa nnye yɛn ani.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wo ba a ɔkɔbɔɔ ahohwie no baeɛ yi deɛ, woakum nantwie ba a wadɔre sradeɛ no ama no.’</char><verse eid="LUK 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nʼagya buaa no sɛ, ‘Me ba, me ne wo na ɛte ha. Biribiara a mewɔ nso yɛ wo dea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32"/><char style="wj">Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛgye yɛn ani, ɛfiri sɛ, na mesusu sɛ wo nua yi awu, sɛ nso na ɔte ase; ɔyeraeɛ, nanso wasane aba.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 15:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Efie Sohwɛfoɔ Okontomponi No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔdefoɔ bi wɔ hɔ a na ɔwɔ efie sohwɛfoɔ bi. Ɔdefoɔ yi tetee sɛ ne efie sohwɛfoɔ no resɛe ne nneɛma.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2"/><char style="wj">Ɔtee saa asɛm yi no, ɔfrɛɛ ne efie sohwɛfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn na metete fa wo ho yi? Bɛbu wʼadwuma ho nkonta kyerɛ me na merentumi ne wo nyɛ adwuma bio.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3"/>
    <char style="wj">“Efie sohwɛfoɔ no kaa wɔ ne tirim sɛ, ‘Menyɛ ɛdeɛn ni? Ɛnnɛ a wɔrepam me afiri efie ha yi, ɛhe na mɛfa? Menni ahoɔden a mede bɛdɔ, ɛnna mefɛre nso sɛ mɛsrɛsrɛ adeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4"/><char style="wj">Menim deɛ mɛyɛ a ɛbɛma wɔn a wɔdede me wura aka no bɛhunu me mmɔbɔ.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5"/>
    <char style="wj">“Enti, ɔfrɛfrɛɛ wɔn a wɔdede ne wura aka no mmaako mmaako. Ɔbisaa deɛ ɔdi ɛkan no sɛ, ‘Ɛka ahe na wode me wura?’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔbuaa sɛ, ‘Mede ngo nhina aduonu ka.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">
    <char style="wj">“Enti, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Yɛ ntɛm tena ase na twam na twerɛ sɛ, wode ngo nhina edu ka.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɛno akyi no, ɔfrɛɛ ɔfoforɔ bi nso bisaa no sɛ, ‘Na wo nso, ɛka ahe na wode me wura?’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">“Ɔno nso buaa sɛ, ‘Mede aburoo nkotokuo ɔha ka.’</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">
    <char style="wj">“Enti, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Tena ase na twam na twerɛ sɛ, wode nkotokuo aduonum ka!’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔdefoɔ no hunuu deɛ efie sohwɛfoɔ no yɛeɛ no akyi, nanso ɔnam fɛdie so kamfoo no wɔ nʼanifire no ho. Saa ara nso na ewiase yi mma susu sɛ wɔnim nyansa sene wɔn a wɔyɛ Onyankopɔn akyidifoɔ no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9"/><char style="wj">Na me nso mese mo sɛ, momfa ewiase ahonyadeɛ no bi nyɛ nnamfoɔ, na sɛ ɛsa a, wɔagye mo.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso deɛ ɔdi nokorɛ wɔ kakra bi ho no bɛdi nokorɛ wɔ pii ho; na deɛ ɔnni nokorɛ wɔ kakra bi ho no, rentumi nni nokorɛ wɔ pii ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moantumi anni nokorɛ wɔ ewiase nneɛma ho a, hwan na ɔde ɔsoro nnepa bɛhyɛ mo nsa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12"/><char style="wj">Sɛ moanni nokorɛ wɔ obi adeɛ bi a wɔde ahyɛ mo nsa no ho a, ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wɔde deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ ɛyɛ mo dea no bɛma mo?</char><verse eid="LUK 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔsomfoɔ biara rentumi nsom awuranom baanu, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔyɛ saa a, ɔbɛdɔ ɔbaako na watan ɔbaako anaasɛ, ɔbɛsom ɔbaako yie na wabu ɔbaako animtia. Morentumi nsom Onyankopɔn ne ahonyadeɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14"/>Farisifoɔ sikaniberefoɔ no tee deɛ Yesu kaeɛ no, wɔdii ne ho fɛw. <verse eid="LUK 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Moyɛ nnipa a mobu mo ho ateneneefoɔ wɔ nnipa anim, nanso Onyankopɔn nim mo akoma mu. Na deɛ ɛsom bo wɔ nnipa ani so no yɛ akyiwadeɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn anim.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ansa na Yohane Osubɔni bɛba no, na Mose mmara ne adiyifoɔ no nsɛm no na modi so. Na Yohane Osubɔni baeɛ no, ɔbɛkaa Onyankopɔn Ahennie ho nsɛm kyerɛɛ mo, enti, nnipa repere sɛ wɔbɛkɔ saa Ahennie no mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17"/><char style="wj">Ɛyɛ mmerɛ sɛ ɔsoro ne asase bɛtwam sene sɛ mmara no mu nsensaneɛ ketewa baako mpo bɛyera.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Obiara a ɔgyaa ne yere awadeɛ na ɔware ɔfoforɔ no bɔ adwaman; na deɛ ɔware ɔbaa biara a ne kunu agyaa no no nso, bɔ adwaman.”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔdefoɔ Bi Ne Lasaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19"/>Yesu toaa so kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔdefoɔ bi tenaa ase a na daa ɔfira ntoma pa na ɔgye nʼani yie nso.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20"/><char style="wj">Na ɔbarima hiani bi a akuro atutu no a wɔfrɛ no Lasaro no nso da nʼaboboano.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21"/><char style="wj">Ɔbarima yi kɔn dɔɔ sɛ anka ɔbɛnya aduane a ɔdefoɔ no adi ama aka no bi adi. Saa ɛberɛ korɔ no ara mu na nkraman ba baabi a na ohiani no da hɔ no bɛtaferetafere nʼakuro no mu.</char><verse eid="LUK 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ohiani no wuiɛ maa abɔfoɔ bɛfaa no kɔtenaa Abraham nkyɛn. Ɔdefoɔ no nso wuiɛ ma wɔsiee no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23"/><char style="wj">Ɔdefoɔ no wɔ asaman a ne ho yera no no, ɔmaa nʼani so hunuu Lasaro sɛ ɔte Abraham nkyɛn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24"/><char style="wj">Ɔdefoɔ no teaam sɛ, ‘Agya Abraham, mesrɛ wo, hunu me mmɔbɔ na soma Lasaro na ɔmfa ne nsateaa ano nkɔbɔ nsuo mu mfa mmɛsɔ me tɛkrɛma so, na me ho yera me.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Abraham buaa no sɛ, ‘Me ba, kae sɛ wote ewiase no, wodii dɛ na Lasaro dii yea, nanso afei na ɔredi dɛ ɛnna wo nso woredi yea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26"/><char style="wj">Ɛnyɛ yei nko, ɛbɔn kɛseɛ da yɛn ne mo ntam a ɛno enti, wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔfiri ha ba mo nkyɛn hɔ ne wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔfiri mo nkyɛn hɔ ba ha no nso rentumi mma.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔdefoɔ no sane ka kyerɛɛ Abraham sɛ, ‘Agya, mesrɛ wo, soma Lasaro kɔ mʼagya efie,</char> <verse eid="LUK 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28"/><char style="wj">ɛfiri sɛ, mewɔ nuammarimanom baanum. Ma ɔnkɔbɔ wɔn kɔkɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔn mu biara remma saa ahoyera yi mu bi.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29"/>
    <char style="wj">“Abraham buaa no sɛ, ‘Wɔwɔ nsɛm a Onyankopɔn nam Mose ne adiyifoɔ no so aka enti ma wɔntie na wɔnni so.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔdefoɔ yi kaa bio sɛ, ‘Agya Abraham, deɛ woreka yi wom deɛ, nanso sɛ obi firi asaman ha kɔbɔ wɔn kɔkɔ deɛ a, wɔbɛnu wɔn ho.’</char><verse eid="LUK 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31"/>
    <char style="wj">“Abraham buaa sɛ, ‘Sɛ wɔantie deɛ Onyankopɔn nam Mose ne adiyifoɔ no so aka no a, saa ara nso na sɛ obi firi asaman ha kɔkasa kyerɛ wɔn a, wɔrentie no ara no no.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 16:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Bɔne, Gyidie Ne Asɛdeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1"/>Ɛda bi Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ dɛn ara a sɔhwɛ a ɛde onipa kɔ bɔne mu no bɛba, nanso onipa a ɛnam ne so bɛba no, ɔnnue.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2"/><char style="wj">Ɛyɛ ma saa onipa no sɛ wɔde ɛboɔ a emu yɛ duru bi bɛsɛn ne kɔn mu ato no atwene ɛpo mu sene sɛ ɔbɛto nkumaa yi mu baako suntidua ama wayɛ bɔne.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3"/><char style="wj">Enti, monhwɛ mo ho so yie.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ wo nua fom wo a, ka nʼanim na sɛ ɔnu ne ho a, fa ne bɔne kyɛ no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4"/><char style="wj">Sɛ nso ɔfom wo mprɛnson da koro na mpɛn dodoɔ a ɔfom wo no nyinaa, ɔde ahonu srɛ wo a, fa kyɛ no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5"/>Ɛda bi, asomafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, hyɛ yɛn gyidie mu den.”<verse eid="LUK 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ mowɔ gyidie te sɛ onyina aba a, anka mobɛtumi aka akyerɛ akyee yi sɛ, ‘Tutu kɔgu ɛpo mu,’ na ɛbɛba mu saa.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mo mu hwan na ɔwɔ ɔsomfoɔ a ɔyɛ nʼafuom adwuma anaasɛ ɔhwɛ ne mmoa na ɔfiri afuom ba a, ɔbɛka akyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Wʼaduane si hɔ na kɔdidi?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8"/><char style="wj">Na mmom ɔrenka nkyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Noa aduane ma me na sɛ modidi wie a, wo nso woakɔdidi?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɔsomfoɔ yi yɛ nʼasɛdeɛ yi a, ne wura no bɛda no ase anaa?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ mo nso moyɛ mo asɛdeɛ a, ɛsɛ sɛ moka sɛ, ‘Yɛyɛ asomfoɔ a ayɛyie mfata yɛn, yɛn asɛdeɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ na yɛayɛ no.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Akwatafoɔ Edu No Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11"/>Ɛberɛ bi a Yesu rekɔ Yerusalem no, ɔfaa Samaria ne Galilea hyeɛ so. <verse eid="LUK 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12"/>Ɔrebɛn akuraa bi ase no, akwatafoɔ edu bi a na wɔgyinagyina kurotia no hunuu no <verse eid="LUK 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13"/>teateaam sɛ, “Yesu, yɛn wura, hunu yɛn mmɔbɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momfa mo ho nkɔkyerɛ ɔsɔfoɔ!”</char> Ɛberɛ a akwatafoɔ no rekɔ no, wɔn ho yɛɛ wɔn den.<verse eid="LUK 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15"/>Wɔn mu baako hunuu sɛ ne ho ayɛ no den no, ɔsanee nʼakyi de ahurisie yii Onyankopɔn ayɛ sɛ, “Animuonyam nka Onyankopɔn, wama me ho ayɛ me den!” <verse eid="LUK 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16"/>Ɔbɛkotoo Yesu anim daa no ase. Na saa ɔbarima yi yɛ Samariani.<verse eid="LUK 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17"/>Yesu bisaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnyɛ nnipa edu na wɔn ho yɛɛ wɔn den? Baakron a wɔaka no wɔ he?</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18"/><char style="wj">Adɛn enti na ɔmamfrani yi nko na wasane aba sɛ ɔrebɛyi Onyankopɔn ayɛ?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɔre kɔ, wo gyidie ama wo ho ayɛ wo den.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20"/>Ɛda bi Farisifoɔ bi bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɛberɛ bɛn na Onyankopɔn Ahennie no bɛba?” Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Onyankopɔn Ahennie no nnam nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bi a mobɛhunu so na ɛbɛba,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21"/><char style="wj">na obi rentumi nkyerɛ mo sɛ, ‘Ɛwɔ ha anaa ɛhɔ!’ Ɛfiri sɛ, Onyankopɔn Ahennie no te mo mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mmerɛ bi bɛba a mo ani bɛgyina sɛ mobɛhunu Onipa Ba no wɔ mo nkyɛn, nanso morenhunu no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23"/><char style="wj">Sɛ nnipa ka kyerɛ mo sɛ mewɔ ha anaa baabi foforɔ a, monnni wɔn akyi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24"/><char style="wj">Sɛdeɛ anyinam pa ogya wɔ ewiem ma nnipa nyinaa hunu no, saa ara nso na Onipa Ba no ba a ɔbɛsane aba no bɛyɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25"/><char style="wj">Nanso, ansa na yeinom nyinaa bɛba mu no, ɛsɛ sɛ mehunu amane na me nkurɔfoɔ nso po me.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛdeɛ Noa ɛberɛ so nnipa yɛɛ asoɔden no, saa ara nso na sɛ Onipa Ba no ba a, ɛbɛyɛ no no.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛberɛ no, nnipa didi nomee, warewaree kɔsii sɛ Noa kɔhyɛɛ ɛhyɛn no mu na nsuyire bɛfaa saa nnipa no nyinaa.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ara nso na Lot berɛ so no, na ɛte. Nnipa didi nomee, dii dwa, yɛɛ mfuo, sisii adan,</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29"/><char style="wj">kɔsii sɛ Lot firii Sodom na ogya ne sɔfe firi ɔsoro bɛhyee saa nnipa no nyinaa.</char><verse eid="LUK 17:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ara nso na da a Onipa Ba no bɛsane aba no, ɛbɛyɛ</char>. <verse eid="LUK 17:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛda no, ɛnsɛ sɛ obiara a ɔwɔ adwuma mu, afuo mu anaa edwa so sane nʼakyi ba efie sɛ ɔrebɛsesa nʼahodeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32"/><char style="wj">Monkae asɛm a ɛtoo Lot yere.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33"/><char style="wj">Obiara a ɔdɔ ne ɔkra no, ɛbɛfiri ne nsa. Na deɛ ɔbɛhwere ne ɔkra no, bɛnya.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34"/><char style="wj">Ɛda no, wɔbɛfa nnipa baanu a wɔda faako no mu baako agya ɔbaako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na wɔbɛfa mmaa baanu a wɔrenoa aduane no mu baako agya ɔbaako.</char> <verse eid="LUK 17:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36"/><char style="wj">Mmarima baanu a wɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ afuom no nso, wɔbɛfa ɔbaako agya ɔbaako.”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37"/>Asuafoɔ no bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, ɛhe na wɔde wɔn bɛkɔ?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Baabi a efunu wɔ no, apete mpa hɔ!”</char><verse eid="LUK 17:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Mpaeɛbɔ Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1"/>Ɛda bi Yesu nam abɛbuo so kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no hia a ɛhia sɛ wɔbɔ mpaeɛ daa a wɔmpa aba. <verse eid="LUK 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔtemmufoɔ bi tenaa kuro bi mu a na ɔnsuro Onyankopɔn, mfɛre onipa biara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3"/><char style="wj">Na ɔbaa kunafoɔ bi te saa kuro yi mu, a ɔne obi wɔ asɛm. Daa na saa okunafoɔ yi kɔ ɔtemmufoɔ no nkyɛn kɔsrɛ no sɛ ɔnni nʼasɛm no mma no.</char><verse eid="LUK 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mfitiaseɛ no, ɔtemmufoɔ no ammua no. Nanso, akyire no ɔkaa sɛ, ‘Ɛwom sɛ mensuro Onyankopɔn, mfɛre onipa biara deɛ,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5"/><char style="wj">nanso ɛsiane sɛ daa ɔbaa yi ha me enti, mɛhwɛ adi asɛm no yie ama no sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, ɔremmɛha me bio!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6"/>Awurade toaa so sɛ, <char style="wj">“Moate asɛm a ɔtemmufoɔ yi a ɔntene no kaeɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7"/><char style="wj">Monnnye nni sɛ Onyankopɔn bɛdi ama ne mma a daa wɔsu frɛ no awia ne anadwo no no anaa ɔbɛtwentwɛn ne nan ase?</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8"/><char style="wj">Merema moate aseɛ sɛ, ɔbɛyɛ wɔn apɛdeɛ ama wɔn ntɛm. Sɛ Onipa Ba no sane ba a, nnipa dodoɔ ahe na ɔbɛhunu sɛ wɔwɔ ne mu gyidie?”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Farisini Ne Ɔtogyeni No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9"/>Yesu sane buu ɛbɛ bi faa nnipa a wɔbu wɔn ho sɛ ateneneefoɔ na ɛno enti wɔbu afoforɔ animtia no ho sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10"/><char style="wj">“Ɛda bi nnipa baanu bi kɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔbɔɔ mpaeɛ. Na wɔn mu baako yɛ Farisini a ɔbu ne ho, na ɔbaako no nso yɛ ɔtogyeni.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11"/><char style="wj">Farisini yi kɔgyinaa baabi a obiara bɛhunu no bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn, meda wo ase sɛ mente sɛ nnipa a aka no te sɛ apoobɔfoɔ nkontompofoɔ, adwamanfoɔ ne saa ɔtogyeni a ɔgyina hɔ yi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12"/><char style="wj">Nnawɔtwe biara mu, medi mmuada mprenu na deɛ menya biara nso, meyi mu nkyɛmu edu mu baako de ma.’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Saa ɛberɛ no na ɔtogyeni no gyina akyiri baabi a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔma nʼani so kyerɛ ɔsoro. Ɔde ne nsa guu ne bo bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, ‘Onyankopɔn, hunu me ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ mmɔbɔ!’</char><verse eid="LUK 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, deɛ ɔtogyeni no yɛeɛ no sɔɔ Onyankopɔn ani sene deɛ Farisini no yɛeɛ no. Obiara a ɔma ne ho so no, wɔbɛbrɛ no ase, na deɛ ɔbrɛ ne ho ase no, wɔbɛma no so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Hyira Mmɔfra Nketewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15"/>Ɛda bi, awofoɔ bi de wɔn mma nketewa brɛɛ Yesu sɛ ɔmfa ne nsa nka wɔn, nhyira wɔn. Asuafoɔ no hunuu awofoɔ no, wɔkaa wɔn anim. <verse eid="LUK 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16"/>Yesu frɛɛ mmɔfra no awofoɔ no baa ne nkyɛn na ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Momma mmɔfra nketewa no mmra me nkyɛn na monnsi wɔn ɛkwan, na yeinom sei na Onyankopɔn Ahennie no yɛ wɔn dea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, obiara a ɔrennye Onyankopɔn Ahennie no sɛ abɔfra no, ɔrentumi nhyɛne mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Osikani Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18"/>Ɛda bi Yudani sikani bi bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ pa, ɛdeɛn na menyɛ na manya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na wofrɛ me onipa pa? Obiara nyɛ papa, gye ɔbaako; ɔne Onyankopɔn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20"/><char style="wj">Wonim Mose mmara no: ‘Mmɔ adwaman! Nni awu! Mmɔ korɔno! Nni adansekurumu! Di wʼagya ne wo maame ni!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21"/>Osikani yi ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Madi saa mmara yi nyinaa so firi me mmɔfraase.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22"/>Yesu tee deɛ osikani no kaeɛ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adeɛ baako pɛ na aka wo a ɛsɛ sɛ woyɛ. Kɔ na kɔtɔn wʼahodeɛ nyinaa na kyɛ sika no ma ahiafoɔ na wobɛnya agyapadeɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu, na afei, bra bɛdi mʼakyi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23"/>Osikani yi tee saa asɛm yi no, anyɛ no dɛ koraa ɛfiri sɛ, na ɔwɔ ahodeɛ pii. <verse eid="LUK 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24"/>Yesu hunuu sɛ ne werɛ ahoɔ no, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ den ma ahonyafoɔ sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu!</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, ɛyɛ mmerɛ sɛ yoma bɛwura paneɛ aniwa mu sene sɛ ɔhonyafoɔ bɛkɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26"/>Na wɔn a wɔtee deɛ Yesu kaeɛ no bisaa sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ na hwan na wɔbɛgye no nkwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Biribiara nni hɔ a Onyankopɔn ntumi nyɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28"/>Petro ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Yɛagya deɛ yɛwɔ nyinaa hɔ abɛdi wʼakyi.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29"/>Yesu buaa Petro sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, obiara nni hɔ a, ɛsiane Onyankopɔn Ahennie no enti, wagya ne fie anaa ne nuanom anaa nʼawofoɔ anaa ne mma</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30"/><char style="wj">na ɔrennya mma ɛmmoro deɛ wahwere no so saa ɛberɛ yi mu, na daakye nso, ɔrennya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sane Hyɛ Ne Wuo Ho Nkɔm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31"/>Yesu frɛɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no gyinaa nkyɛn baabi ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yɛrekɔ Yerusalem, na biribiara a nkɔmhyɛfoɔ no aka afa Onipa Ba no ho no bɛba mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɛyi no ama amanamanmufoɔ ama wɔadi ne ho fɛw, na wɔabɔ no adapaa, ate ntasuo agu ne so,</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33"/><char style="wj">aka no mpire, akum no na ne nnansa so no, wasɔre.”</char><verse eid="LUK 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34"/>Asuafoɔ no ante deɛ Yesu kaaeɛ no biara ase, ɛfiri sɛ, na asɛm no boro wɔn adwene so.<verse eid="LUK 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onifirani Bi Ayaresa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no rebɛn Yeriko no, wɔhunuu onifirani bi a ɔte kwankyɛn resrɛsrɛ adeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36"/>Onifirani no tee sɛ nkurɔfokuo bi retwam no, ɔbisaa asɛm a asi. <verse eid="LUK 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yesu Nasareni no na ɔretwam!”<verse eid="LUK 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38"/>Ɔtee saa no, ɔteateam sɛ, “Yesu, Dawid Ba, hunu me mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39"/>Wɔn a wɔdi anim no trantram no sɛ ɔmmua nʼano, nanso wantie, na ɔkɔɔ so teateaam dendeenden sɛ, “Yesu Dawid Ba, hunu me mmɔbɔ!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40"/>Yesu duruu baabi a onifirani no te no, ɔmaa wɔde no brɛɛ no. Wɔde no duruu Yesu nkyɛn no, ɔbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41"/><char style="wj">“Ɛdeɛn na wopɛ sɛ meyɛ ma wo?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Onifirani no buaa sɛ, “Awurade, ma menhunu adeɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hunu adeɛ, wo gyidie ama wo ho ayɛ wo den.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43"/>Amonom hɔ ara, onifirani yi hunuu adeɛ, na ɔdii Yesu akyi, yii Onyankopɔn ayɛ. Na wɔn a wɔhunuu ayaresa no nyinaa nso yii Onyankopɔn ayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Sakeo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1"/>Ɛda bi a na Yesu retwam wɔ Yeriko no, <verse eid="LUK 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2"/>ɔhunuu ɔbarima bi wɔ hɔ a wɔfrɛ no Sakeo. Na Sakeo yɛ ɔtogyeni panin sane yɛ osikani nso. <verse eid="LUK 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu retwam no, Sakeo pɛɛ sɛ anka ɔhunu no, nanso ɛsiane sɛ na ɔyɛ onipa tiawa na wɔn a wɔdi Yesu akyi no dɔɔso enti, wanhunu no. <verse eid="LUK 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4"/>Esiane sɛ na Sakeo nim sɛ Yesu bɛfa nnyedua bi a na ɛsisi hɔ no ase enti, ɔyɛɛ ntɛm kɔforoo saa nnyedua no mu baako.<verse eid="LUK 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu duruu nnyedua no ase no, ɔmaa nʼani so hunuu no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sakeo, yɛ ntɛm na si fam, na wo fie na ɛnnɛ mɛtena.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6"/>Sakeo yɛɛ ntɛm sii fam de anigyeɛ gyee no fɛ so.<verse eid="LUK 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7"/>Nnipa a wɔdi Yesu akyi no hunuu yei no, wɔnwiinwii kaa sɛ, “Ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ yi na wakɔ akɔsoɛ no.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no renwiinwii no, Sakeo bɛgyinaa Yesu nkyɛn kaa sɛ, “Awurade, ɛnnɛ, mede mʼahodeɛ mu fa kyɛ ahiafoɔ, na sɛ masisi obi wɔ biribi mu a, mɛtua mmɔho nan ama no.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnnɛ na nkwagyeɛ aba efie yi mu, ɛfiri sɛ, yei nso yɛ Abraham ba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10"/><char style="wj">Na Onipa Ba no baeɛ sɛ ɔrebɛhwehwɛ wɔn a wɔayera na wagye wɔn nkwa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Adwumayɛ Ho Akontabuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11"/>Ɛberɛ a Yesu ne nnipa no rebɛn Yerusalem no, ɔsane buu wɔn bɛ foforɔ de kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, Onyankopɔn Ahennie no abɛn. <verse eid="LUK 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔdehyeɛ bi a watu kwan akɔ akyirikyiri asase bi so sane kɔɔ ne kurom kɔhunuu nʼabusua mu mpanimfoɔ sɛ wɔnsi no ɔhene.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13"/><char style="wj">Ansa na ɔrebɛfiri nʼakwantuo no ase no, ɔfrɛɛ nʼadwumayɛfoɔ mu edu maa wɔn mu biara mina</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina baako yɛ ɔpaani bosome mmiɛnsa akatua.</char></note> <char style="wj">edu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Momfa sika yi nyɛ adwuma kɔsi sɛ mɛba.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Kurom hɔfoɔ no tee nʼahennie no ho asɛm no, wɔtuu nnipa kɔhunuu mpanimfoɔ no sɛ wɔmpɛ no.</char><verse eid="LUK 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, wɔsii no ɔhene ma ɔsane kɔɔ baabi a na ɔyɛ adwuma no. Ɔduruiɛ no, ɔfrɛɛ nʼadwumayɛfoɔ edu no sɛ, wɔmmɛbu sika a ɔde maa wɔn no ho nkonta nkyerɛ no.</char><verse eid="LUK 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16"/>
    <char style="wj">“Odwumayɛfoɔ a ɔdii ɛkan baeɛ no bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Me wura, wo sika mina edu no, mede ayɛ adwuma anya ho mmɔho edu.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17"/>
    <char style="wj">“Owura no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Mo, akoa pa, ɛsiane sɛ woadi kakraa a mede hyɛɛ wo nsa no ho nokorɛ enti, mede nkuro edu bɛhyɛ wʼase na woadi so.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18"/>
    <char style="wj">“Odwumayɛfoɔ a ɔtɔ so mmienu no baeɛ bɛka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Me wura, wo sika mina edu no, mede ayɛ adwuma anya ho mmɔho enum.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19"/>
    <char style="wj">“Owura no ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, ‘Mede nkuro enum bɛhyɛ wʼase na woadi so.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔfoforɔ nso bɛkaa sɛ, ‘Me wura wo sika mina edu a wode maa me no, mede sieeɛ, ɛno nie.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21"/><char style="wj">Na mesuro wo, ɛfiri sɛ, wo ho yɛ nwanwa. Deɛ ɛnyɛ wo dea no, wogye; deɛ wunnuaeɛ nso, wotwa.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ne wura no buaa no sɛ, ‘Akoa bɔne, wo anom asɛm so na megyina abu wo atɛn. Wonim sɛ me ho yɛ nwanwa. Deɛ ɛnyɛ me dea no megye; deɛ mennuaeɛ no, metwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23"/><char style="wj">Adɛn enti na woamfa me sika no ankɔto sikakorabea? Anka mebaeɛ yi mɛnya ho nsiho.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24"/>
    <char style="wj">“Ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasomfoɔ a na wɔgyina hɔ no sɛ ‘Monnye sika no mfiri ne nsam mfa mma deɛ ɔde ne deɛ yɛɛ adwuma nyaa mmɔho edu no.’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Asomfoɔ no kaa sɛ, ‘Yɛn wura, sɛ yei deɛ ɔwɔ sika bebree!’</char><verse eid="LUK 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26"/>
    <char style="wj">“Owura no kaa sɛ, ‘Merema mo ate aseɛ sɛ, deɛ ɔwɔ bebree no, wɔbɛma no bi aka ho, na deɛ ɔwɔ kakra bi no, deɛ ɔwɔ mpo no, wɔbɛgye afiri ne nsam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27"/><char style="wj">Na afei, momfa mʼatamfoɔ a anka wɔmpɛ sɛ medi adeɛ no mmra mʼanim ha na monkum wɔn!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kɔ Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28"/>Yesu kaa nsɛm yi wieeɛ no, ɔdii nʼasuafoɔ no ɛkan kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29"/>Ɔrebɛn Betfage ne Betania a ɛbɛn Ngo Bepɔ so no, ɔsomaa nʼasuafoɔ no mu baanu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30"/><char style="wj">“Monkɔ akuraa a ɛbɛn ha no ase na moduru hɔ a, mobɛhunu afunumu ba bi a obiara ntenaa ne so da sɛ wɔasa no. Monsane no mfa no mmrɛ me.</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31"/><char style="wj">Sɛ obi bisa sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na moresane no’ a, monka nkyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Ne ho hia Awurade.’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32"/>Asuafoɔ baanu a wɔkɔeɛ no kɔhunuu aboa no sɛ ɔsa hɔ sɛdeɛ Yesu kaeɛ no. <verse eid="LUK 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔresane afunumu ba no, ne wuranom bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na moresane aboa no?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34"/>Wɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, “Ne ho hia Awurade.”<verse eid="LUK 19:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35"/>Asuafoɔ no de afunumu ba no brɛɛ Yesu de wɔn ntoma sesɛɛ ne so ma ɔtenaa ne so. <verse eid="LUK 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36"/>Yesu te afunumu ba no so rekɔ no, nnipa de wɔn ntoma sesɛɛ ɛkwan no so ma ɔfaa so.<verse eid="LUK 19:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37"/>Ɔduruu Ngo Bepɔ no so baabi a wɔrebɛsiane akɔ Yerusalem no, nʼakyidifoɔ no nyinaa de osebɔ kamfoo Onyankopɔn, yii no ayɛ wɔ Yesu anwanwadeɛ ahodoɔ a wayɛ no ho sɛ,<verse eid="LUK 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38"/>“Nhyira nka ɔhene a ɔreba Awurade din mu no!”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Asomdwoeɛ ne animuonyam nka Onyankopɔn wɔ ɔsorosoro nohoa!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39"/>Farisifoɔ no bi a na wɔfra nnipakuo no mu no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, kasa kyerɛ wʼakyidifoɔ no na wɔmmua wɔn ano!”<verse eid="LUK 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ wɔmua wɔn ano koraa a, aboɔ mpo bɛkamfo me, ayi me ayɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Su Ma Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41"/>Yesu rebɛn Yerusalem a ɔhunuu kuro no no, ɔsu maa emu nnipa no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42"/><char style="wj">“Mo a anka asomdwoeɛ yɛ mo dea nanso moampɛ no, mobɛhwehwɛ asomdwoeɛ akyiri kwan, nanso mo nsa renka da!</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43"/><char style="wj">Nna bi bɛba a mo atamfoɔ bɛba abɛtoa mo, aka mo ahyɛ,</char> <verse eid="LUK 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44"/><char style="wj">atɔre mo ne mo mma ase, asɛe mo kuro yi pasaa, ɛfiri sɛ, moapo adom a Onyankopɔn de adom mo no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Pamoo Adwadifoɔ Firii Asɔredan Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45"/>Yesu duruu Yerusalem no, ɔkɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔpamoo nnipa a na wɔredi edwa wɔ hɔ no kaa sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46"/><char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ, ‘Mʼasɔredan yɛ mpaeɛbɔbea; nanso mode ayɛ akorɔmfoɔ ahyiaeɛ!’ ”</char><verse eid="LUK 19:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47"/>Saa ɛberɛ no nyinaa na asɔfoɔ mpanimfoɔ, Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ne ɔman no mu mpanimfoɔ rehwehwɛ ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so anya no, akyere no, akum no. <verse eid="LUK 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48"/>Nanso, na wɔnhunu ɛkwan biara a wɔbɛfa so akyere no, ɛfiri sɛ, ɛberɛ nyinaa na nnipa akyere ne so retie no.<verse eid="LUK 19:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Tumi Ho Nsɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1"/>Ɛda bi a Yesu rekyerɛkyerɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no, asɔfoɔ mpanin, Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ne ɔman no mu mpanin kɔbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2"/>“Tumi bɛn na wowɔ a wode yɛ saa nneɛma yi; na hwan nso na ɔmaa wo saa tumi no?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3"/>Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Me nso mewɔ asɛm bi bisa mo. Monka nkyerɛ me.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4"/><char style="wj">Tumi bɛn na Yohane de bɔɔ asu; ɛfiri Onyankopɔn anaa ɛfiri nnipa?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5"/>Wɔfaa ho adwene kaa sɛ, “Sɛ yɛka sɛ, ɛfiri Onyankopɔn a, ɔbɛbisa yɛn sɛ, ‘ɛnneɛ, adɛn enti na moannye no anni?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6"/>Sɛ nso yɛka sɛ, ɛfiri onipa a, ɔman mu no nyinaa bɛsi yɛn aboɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnim sɛ Yohane yɛ odiyifoɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7"/>Ɛwiee aseɛ no, wɔbuaeɛ sɛ, “Yɛnnim.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8"/>Yesu nso ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ me nso meremma mo mo asɛmmisa no ho mmuaeɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaafoɔ Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9"/>Yesu buu wɔn ɛbɛ bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɔbarima bi yɛɛ bobefuo de hyɛɛ apaafoɔ bi nsa sɛ wɔnhwɛ so mma no. Yei akyi ɔtuu kwan kɔɔ akyirikyiri baabi, kɔtenaa hɔ kyɛree.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10"/><char style="wj">Bobeteɛ berɛ duruiɛ no, ɔbarima yi somaa ne ɔsomfoɔ sɛ ɔnkɔgye aduaba no bi mmrɛ no. Nanso, apaafoɔ no boroo no, ma ɔsane kɔɔ nsapan.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11"/><char style="wj">Ɔsomaa ɔsomfoɔ foforɔ maa ɔno nso wɔboroo no, bɔɔ no adapaa, ma ɔkɔɔ nsapan.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12"/><char style="wj">Ɔsane somaa ɔsomfoɔ foforɔ na ɔno mpo deɛ, wɔpirapiraa no pamoo no.</char><verse eid="LUK 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13"/>
    <char style="wj">“Yei maa bobefuo wura no kaa sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn na menyɛ bio? Mɛsoma me ba a medɔ no no akɔ wɔn nkyɛn na ɔno deɛ ebia, wɔbɛfɛre no.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, ɛberɛ a apaafoɔ no hunuu no no, wɔkaa sɛ, ‘Ɔdedifoɔ no nie, momma yɛnkum no na yɛmfa nʼagyapadeɛ no.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15"/><char style="wj">Wɔtwee no firii afuo no mu kɔkumm no.</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">
    <char style="wj">“Mogye di sɛ ɛdeɛn na afuowura no bɛyɛ saa apaafoɔ yi?</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16"/><char style="wj">Ɔbɛba abɛkum saa apaafoɔ yi na ɔde afuo no ama afoforɔ.”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Nnipa a wɔretie Yesu no kaa sɛ, “Ɛmpare yɛn!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17"/>Yesu hwɛɛ wɔn dinn bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ na deɛ wɔatwerɛ sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘Ɛboɔ a adansifoɔ apo no,</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">
    <char style="wj">ɛno ara na abɛyɛ tweatiboɔ’ no aseɛ ne sɛn?</char><verse eid="LUK 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18"/>
    <char style="wj">Obiara a ɔbɛhwe ɛboɔ no so no, ɔbɛbubu na deɛ ɛboɔ no bɛhwe ne so no, ɛbɛpɛkyɛ no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19"/>Esiane sɛ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ ne asɔfoɔ mpanin no hunuu sɛ Yesu buu ɛbɛ no tiaa wɔn enti, wɔhwehwɛɛ ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so akyere no saa ɛberɛ no ara mu, nanso ɛsiane nnipa a na wɔwɔ hɔ no enti, na wɔsuro.<verse eid="LUK 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɛtoɔ Gyeɛ Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20"/>Esiane sɛ ɔpɛ ara na na nnipa no pɛ sɛ wɔkyere Yesu enti, wɔtetɛɛ no maa nnipa bi kɔɔ ne nkyɛn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛnya nʼanom asɛm bi agyina so akyere no na wɔde no akɔ aban mu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21"/>Saa nnipa yi bisaa Yesu sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, yɛnim sɛ woyɛ ɔnokwafoɔ, wonyɛ nyiyimu na wokyerɛ nokorɛ kwan a wɔnam so kɔ Onyankopɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="LUK 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22"/>Enti, ɛyɛ sɛ yɛtua toɔ ma Kaesare aban anaasɛ ɛnyɛ?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ wɔpene sɛ wɔntua toɔ mma Kaesare a na wɔadi nnipa no hwammɔ. Sɛ wɔka sɛ wɔntua nso a, ɛbɛha Roma aban mu mpanimfoɔ. Nsɛmmisafoɔ no bisaa Yesu asɛm yi de sum no afidie.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23"/>Yesu hunuu wɔn adwemmɔne no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24"/><char style="wj">“Momma me sika. Hwan mfoni ne din na ɛwɔ so yi?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Ɛyɛ Kaesare dea.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnneɛ momfa Kaesare deɛ mma Kaesare na momfa Onyankopɔn deɛ mma Onyankopɔn.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26"/>Yesu mmuaeɛ a ɔmaa wɔn no yɛɛ wɔn nwanwa na wɔn adwemmɔne no nso kaa wɔn tirim.<verse eid="LUK 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔreɛ Ho Asɛmmisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27"/>Sadukifoɔ bi a wɔnnye owusɔreɛ nni baa Yesu nkyɛn bɛbisaa no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28"/>“Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, Mose mmara no kyerɛ yɛn sɛ, sɛ ɔbarima bi wɔ yere na ɔne no anwo na ɔwu a, ne nua tumi ware no ne no wo mma ma owufoɔ no. <verse eid="LUK 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29"/>Anuanom baason bi tenaa ase. Ɔpanin a ɔwɔ mu no waree ɔbaa a ɔne no anwo na ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30"/>Ne nua a ɔdi nʼakyi no, waree no nanso ɔne no anwo na ɔwuiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31"/>Anuanom a wɔaka no nyinaa nso waree no a obiara ne no anwo, na wɔwuwuiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32"/>Akyire no, ɔbaa no nso wuiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33"/>Yɛn asɛmmisa ne sɛ, ɛsiane sɛ ɔbaa yi waree anuanom yi nyinaa enti, owusɔreɛ da no, wɔn mu hwan na ɔbaa yi bɛyɛ ne yere?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asase yi so na nnipa dwene awadeɛ ho.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35"/><char style="wj">Na wɔn a owusɔreɛ da no wɔbɛnya kwan akɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no mu deɛ, awadeɛ ho renhia wɔn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36"/><char style="wj">Na owuo nso nni hɔ mma wɔn bio, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔbɛyɛ sɛ ɔsoro abɔfoɔ. Esiane sɛ wɔasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu no enti, wɔyɛ Onyankopɔn mma.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37"/><char style="wj">Afei, mo asɛmmisa a ɛfa owusɔreɛ ho no nso, Mose ma yɛhunuu no pefee sɛ, owusɔreɛ wɔ hɔ. Ɛfiri sɛ, nʼasɛm a ɔtwerɛ faa wira a na ɛrederɛ no ho no ɔbɔɔ Abraham Onyankopɔn, Isak Onyankopɔn ne Yakob Onyankopɔn din.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38"/><char style="wj">Yei kyerɛ sɛ, Onyankopɔn yɛ ateasefoɔ Onyankopɔn na ɔnyɛ awufoɔ Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, obiara a ɔde ne ho to Onyankopɔn so no, sɛ ɔwu mpo a, ɔbɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39"/>Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no mu bi kaa sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, woabua no yie.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40"/>Na obiara antumi ammisa no asɛm biara bio.<verse eid="LUK 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hwan Ba Ne Kristo No?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41"/>Yesu bisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn enti na wɔka sɛ Kristo no yɛ Dawid ba?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ Dawid ka wɔ ne Nnwom no mu sɛ,</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">“Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me wura sɛ.</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">
    <char style="wj">‘Tena me nifa so</char><verse eid="LUK 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43"/>
    <char style="wj">kɔsi sɛ mɛma woadi wʼatamfoɔ so nkonim.’</char><verse eid="LUK 20:43"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44"/>
    <char style="wj">Sɛ Dawid frɛ Kristo no ‘Me wura’ a, ɛyɛ dɛn na Kristo no ayɛ ne ba?”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atwerɛsɛm No Akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ No Suban</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa no retie no no, Yesu danee nʼani ka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 20:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46"/><char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yie wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no ho. Ɛberɛ biara wɔpɛ sɛ wɔhyɛ ntadeɛ pa, hwehwɛ sɛ nnipa hu wɔn badwa mu a, wɔde obuo kyea wɔn, na sɛ wɔkɔ asɔredan mu nso a, wɔtena mpanin tenabea. Saa ara nso na sɛ wɔkɔ apontoɔ ase a, wɔtena mpanin tenabea.</char> <verse eid="LUK 20:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47"/><char style="wj">Wɔbɔ mpaeɛ hunu atentene kyerɛ nnipa sɛ wɔresom Onyankopɔn, nanso wɔsisi akunafoɔ. Yei enti wɔbɛnya asotwe a emu yɛ duru.”</char><verse eid="LUK 20:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Okunafoɔ Bi Afɔrebɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1"/>Yesu te asɔredan mu hɔ no, ɔhunuu asikafoɔ bi a wɔde wɔn afɔrebɔdeɛ akɛseakɛseɛ regu afɔrebɔ adaka no mu. <verse eid="LUK 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2"/>Ɔhunuu okunafoɔ hiani bi nso sɛ ɔde sika kakra bi too afɔdeɛ adaka no mu. <verse eid="LUK 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ nnipa a na wɔwɔ asɔredan mu hɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nokorɛ mu, afɔdeɛ a okunafoɔ hiani yi bɛbɔeɛ no som bo sene afɔdeɛ akɛseakɛseɛ a asikafoɔ no bɛbɔeɛ no nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4"/><char style="wj">Wɔn nyinaa de deɛ wɔanya ama aboro so no bi na ɛbɛbɔɔ afɔdeɛ, na yei deɛ, ɔfiri ne hia mu de ne sika a ɔwɔ nyinaa na abɛgu mu yi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɔredansɛeɛ Ho Nkɔmhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5"/>Yesu akyidifoɔ no bi kamfoo aboɔ fɛfɛ a wɔde sii asɔredan no ne adwinneɛ ahodoɔ a wɔadi agu ɛdan no ho no. Nanso, Yesu kaa sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6"/><char style="wj">“Ɛberɛ bi bɛba a, wɔbɛdwiri nneɛma a morekamfo yi nyinaa agu a hwee renka.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛbɛsisi Ansa Na Awieeɛ Abɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7"/>Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ, berɛ bɛn na asɛm a woreka yi bɛsi, na ɛho nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bɛyɛ sɛn?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8"/>Yesu buaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yie na obi annaadaa mo, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa pii bɛsɔre aka sɛ, ‘Mene Kristo no’ na ɛberɛ no abɛn, nanso monnnye wɔn nni!</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9"/><char style="wj">Sɛ mote akokoakoko ne sɛ wɔsɔre tia aman a, monnsuro ɛfiri sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ saa nneɛma yi di ɛkan ba nanso na ɛnkyerɛ sɛ awieeɛ no abɛn.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10"/>Ɔkaa bio sɛ, <char style="wj">“Aman bɛsɔre aman so na ahennie asɔre ahennie so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11"/><char style="wj">Asasewosoɔ a ɛyɛ hu bɛba, ɛkɔm bɛba na nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu bɛfiri ewiem asisi.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nanso, ansa na yeinom nyinaa bɛsisi no, me din enti, wɔbɛtaa mo akyekye mo, de mo akɔ hyiadan mu ne afiase ne ahemfo ne atumfoɔ anim.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13"/><char style="wj">Yei bɛma moanya ɛkwan adi me ho adanseɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14"/><char style="wj">Nanso, monnnwene nsɛm a mobɛka de ayi mo ho ano no ho;</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, mɛma mo nsɛm ne nyansa a mode bɛyi mo ho ano a mo atamfoɔ rentumi nnyina mo anim.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16"/><char style="wj">Mo awofoɔ, mo nuanom, mo abusuafoɔ ne mo nnamfonom bɛyi mo ama na wɔbɛkum mo mu bi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17"/><char style="wj">Na me enti, nnipa bɛtan mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18"/><char style="wj">Nanso, mo tirinwi baako pɛ mpo renyera.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19"/><char style="wj">Na sɛ motumi gyina pintinn a, mobɛnya nkwa a ɛnni awieeɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Sɛeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20"/>
    <char style="wj">“Sɛ mohunu sɛ asraafoɔ atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ ne sɛeɛ abɛn.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛberɛ no wɔn a wɔte Yudea nnwane nkɔ mmepɔ no so; wɔn a wɔwɔ kuro no mu no nnwane mfiri mu, na wɔn nso a wɔwɔ nkuraase ne mfuom no ntena hɔ ara.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛberɛ yi mu na Onyankopɔn asotwe a adiyifoɔ no hyɛɛ ho nkɔm wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu no bɛba mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23"/><char style="wj">Wɔn a wɔafa afuro ne wɔn a wɔturu mma saa ɛberɛ no mu no nnue. Amanehunu a ɛnni kabea bɛba ɔman no so na Onyankopɔn abufuhyeɛ nso aba nnipa no so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24"/><char style="wj">Ebinom bɛtotɔ wɔ sekan ano na wɔafa ebinom nso nnommum de wɔn akɔ amanaman so na amanaman bɛsɛe Yerusalem, adi so akɔsi ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn ahyehyɛ sɛ amanaman nni wɔn so no bɛtwam.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onipa Ba No Ba A Ɔbɛsane Aba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ bɛba owia, ɔsrane ne nsoromma mu na ɛpo asorɔkye bɛbobom, aworo so ama ne nnyegyeeɛ denden no de ahoyera aba aman nyinaa so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26"/><char style="wj">Esiane nneɛma a ɛyɛ hu a ɛbɛba asase so no enti, nnipa pii bɛtotɔ bera na abɔdeɛ a ɛwɔ ewiem nso awoso ahoɔden so.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛberɛ no na wɔbɛhunu Onipa Ba no sɛ ɔde tumi ne animuonyam a ɛso nam omununkum mu reba.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28"/><char style="wj">Sɛ saa asɛm yi firi aseɛ sisi a, momfa gyidie nnyina pintinn, ɛfiri sɛ, na mo nkwagyeberɛ abɛn.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnua Bi Ho Ɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29"/>Yesu buu wɔn ɛbɛ bi sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ borɔdɔma ne nnua nyinaa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30"/><char style="wj">Sɛ ɛyiyi nhahan foforɔ a, na ɛkyerɛ sɛ osutɔberɛ aduru.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31"/><char style="wj">Saa ara nso na sɛ mohunu nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ a moreka ho asɛm yi a, monhunu sɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no abɛn.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32"/>
    <char style="wj">“Nokorɛ me se mo sɛ, awontoatoasoɔ yi rentwam, gye sɛ saa nneɛma yi nyinaa aba mu ansa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33"/><char style="wj">Ɔsoro ne asase bɛtwam, nanso me nsɛm deɛ, ɛrentwam da.</char><verse eid="LUK 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34"/>
    <char style="wj">“Monhwɛ mo ho so yie! Mommma adiditrasoɔ ne nsãborɔ ne asetena mu dadwene nni mo so, anyɛ saa a, me ba a mɛba bio no bɛfu mo mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35"/><char style="wj">Ɛfiri sɛ, me ba a mɛba no bɛfu nnipa a wɔte asase so nyinaa mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36"/><char style="wj">Monwɛn. Ɛberɛ biara mommɔ mpaeɛ na moanya ahoɔden de agyina saa nneɛma yi nyinaa ano, na Onipa Ba no sane ba bio a, moatumi agyina nʼanim.”</char><verse eid="LUK 21:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37"/>Ɛda biara, na Yesu kɔ asɔredan mu hɔ kɔkyerɛkyerɛ, na sɛ ɛduru anwummerɛ biara a, Yesu kɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so kɔhome. <verse eid="LUK 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38"/>Na nnipa pii sɔre anɔpahema biara kɔtie no wɔ asɔredan mu.<verse eid="LUK 21:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Pɔbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1"/>Afei, na Yudafoɔ Apiti Afahyɛ a wɔsane frɛ no Twam Afahyɛ no abɛn. <verse eid="LUK 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no hwehwɛɛ ɛkwan a wɔbɛfa so akyere Yesu akum no, nanso ɛsiane nnipa a na wɔwɔ hɔ no enti, na wɔsuro. <verse eid="LUK 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3"/>Ɔbonsam kɔwuraa Yuda a wɔfrɛ no Iskariot a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako no mu. <verse eid="LUK 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4"/>Yuda kɔɔ asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Asɔredan no mu awɛmfoɔ mpanin nkyɛn ne wɔn kɔsusuu ɛkwan ko a ɔbɛfa so ayi Yesu ama wɔn no ho. <verse eid="LUK 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5"/>Wɔn ani gyeeɛ, penee so sɛ wɔbɛma no sika. <verse eid="LUK 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6"/>Ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ no, Yuda hwehwɛɛ ɛkwan a ɔbɛfa so ama wɔakyere Yesu ɛberɛ a nnipa dodoɔ biara nni ne ho.<verse eid="LUK 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Twam Afahyɛ Ho Ahosiesie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7"/>Afei, da a wɔkum Twam Afahyɛ odwan de di burodo a mmɔreka nni mu no duruiɛ no, <verse eid="LUK 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8"/>Yesu somaa Petro ne Yohane sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monkɔyɛ Twam Afahyɛ aduane a yɛbɛdi no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9"/>Wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛhe na wopɛ sɛ yɛkɔyɛ aduane no?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10"/>Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ moduru kuro no mu a, mobɛhunu obi a wakɔ asuo reba. Monni nʼakyi nkɔ efie a ɔbɛkɔ mu no mu</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11"/><char style="wj">na mommisa efiewura no sɛ, ‘Yɛn ɔkyerɛkyerɛfoɔ se ɛhe na woasiesie ama ɔne nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ wɔmmɛdi Twam Afahyɛ aduane no?’</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12"/><char style="wj">Ɔde mo bɛkɔ abansoro asa kɛseɛ bi a wɔasiesie mu fɛfɛɛfɛ so. Ɛhɔ na monkɔto ɛpono no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13"/>Wɔkɔɔ kuro no mu no, wɔhunuu sɛdeɛ Yesu kaeɛ no pɛpɛɛpɛ ma wɔyɛɛ Twam Afahyɛ aduane no wɔ hɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14"/>Ɛberɛ no duruiɛ no, Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no kɔtenatenaa adidipono no ho. <verse eid="LUK 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15"/>Wɔtete hɔ no, Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mepɛɛ sɛ me ne mo bɛtena ase, ato nsa adi saa Twam Afahyɛ aduane yi, ansa na mahunu amane no akyɛre.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, saa adidie yi akyi no, merenni Twam Afahyɛ aduane yi bio kɔsi sɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no bɛba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17"/>Afei Yesu faa kuruwa, daa Onyankopɔn ase na ɔde maa nʼasuafoɔ no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnye na obiara nnom bi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18"/><char style="wj">Mereka akyerɛ mo sɛ, merennom bobesa yi bi bio kɔsi sɛ Onyankopɔn Ahennie no bɛba.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19"/>Afei, ɔfaa burodo daa Onyankopɔn ase, bubuu mu de maa nʼasuafoɔ no kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yei ne me onipadua a mede rema mo. Monnye nni. Ɛda biara a mobɛdi saa burodo yi bi no, momfa nkae me.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20"/>Saa ara nso na adidie no akyi no, ɔfaa kuruwa kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Kuruwa yi ne me mogya a merehwie agu ama mo sɛ apam foforɔ a wɔnam so bɛgye mo nkwa.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21"/><char style="wj">Nanso, mo a mo ne me te adidiiɛ ha yi mu baako na ɔbɛyi me ama.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22"/><char style="wj">Ɛtwa sɛ Onipa Ba no wu, sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn ahyehyɛ no, nanso deɛ ɔbɛyi no ama no deɛ, ɔnnue.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23"/>Asuafoɔ no bisabisaa wɔn ho wɔn ho, pɛɛ sɛ wɔhunu wɔn mu deɛ ɔbɛyi no ama no.<verse eid="LUK 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Kasa Tia Ahomasoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24"/>Asuafoɔ no gyee wɔn ho akyinnyeɛ pɛɛ sɛ wɔhunu wɔn mu deɛ ɔbɛyɛ kɛseɛ wɔ Onyankopɔn Ahennie a ɛbɛba no mu. <verse eid="LUK 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25"/>Yesu teeɛ no, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ewiase deɛ, atumfoɔ hyɛ wɔn a wɔdi wɔn so no so ma wɔn nso a wɔhyɛ wɔn so no nso bu wɔn sɛ wɔn adɛɛfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26"/><char style="wj">Nanso, mo deɛ, deɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɔyɛ mo so panin no nyɛ sɛ mo mu akumaa, na deɛ ɔdi mo so no nso nyɛ mo mu ɔsomfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27"/><char style="wj">Merebisa mo sɛ, nnipa baanu yi mu hwan na ɔdi ne yɔnko so, deɛ ɔte adidipono ho anaa deɛ ɔsom deɛ ɔte adidipono no ho no? Nanso, me deɛ, mewɔ mo mu sɛ mo ɔsomfoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28"/><char style="wj">Me ne mo na afa ɔhaw ne amaneɛ mu a, moda so ne me nam.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29"/><char style="wj">Mʼagya de Ahennie no ama me. Saa ara nso na mede rema mo.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30"/><char style="wj">Na mo ne me ato nsa adidi, na moatumi abu Israel mmusuakuo dumienu no atɛn.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pa A Wɔpa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31"/>Afei, Awurade kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Simon, Simon! Monhwɛ yie na ɔbonsam pɛ sɛ ɔsɔ mo hwɛ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32"/><char style="wj">Nanso, wo Simon deɛ, masrɛ ama wo, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wobɛkɔ so agye me adi. Sɛ wonu wo ho sane ba me nkyɛn a, hyɛ wo nuanom no gyidie mu den.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33"/>Petro buaa no sɛ, “Awurade, ɛyɛ me pɛ sɛ me ne wo bɛda afiase, na sɛ ɛyɛ owu mpo nso a, me ne wo bɛwu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34"/>Yesu nso buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Petro, mereka akyerɛ wo sɛ, ɛnnɛ akokɔ remmɔn na woapa me mprɛnsa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35"/>Afei, Yesu bisaa nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛberɛ a mesomaa mo a na monkura sikabɔtɔ anaa akwantubɔtɔ na monhyɛ mpaboa no, biribi ho hiaa mo anaa?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Asuafoɔ no buaa no sɛ, “Dabi, biribiara ho anhia yɛn.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Afei deɛ, deɛ ɔwɔ sika no, ɔmfa; deɛ ɔwɔ akwantubɔtɔ no nso, ɔmfa. Deɛ ɔnni akofena no ntɔn ne ntoma mfa nkɔtɔ bi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37"/><char style="wj">Na berɛ aduru sɛ, nkɔm a wɔhyɛ faa me ho sɛ, ‘Wɔbɛkan no afra nnebɔneyɛfoɔ mu’ no bɛba mu. Ɛsɛ sɛ nkɔm biara a wɔahyɛ afa me ho no ba mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38"/>Asuafoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Yesu sɛ, “Awurade, yɛwɔ akofena mmienu wɔ ha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">Yesu buaeɛ sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛyɛ, ɛno ara dɔɔso.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngo Bepɔ So Mpaeɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39"/>Yesu ne nʼasuafoɔ no firii kuro no mu kɔɔ Ngo Bepɔ no so sɛdeɛ ɔtaa yɛ no, na nʼasuafoɔ no ka ne ho. <verse eid="LUK 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40"/>Wɔduruu hɔ no, ɔka kyerɛɛ nʼasuafoɔ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mommɔ mpaeɛ na moankɔ sɔhwɛ mu.”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41"/>Afei, ɔtwee ne ho firii asuafoɔ no ho kɔɔ nkyɛn baabi kɔkotoeɛ, bɔɔ mpaeɛ sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42"/><char style="wj">“Agya, sɛ ɛyɛ wo pɛ a, ma saa amanehunu a ɛreba me so yi ntwa me ho nkɔ, nanso ɛnyɛ deɛ mepɛ, na deɛ wopɛ na ɛnyɛ”</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43"/>Ɔgu so rebɔ mpaeɛ no, ɔbɔfoɔ firi ɔsoro bɛhyɛɛ no den. <verse eid="LUK 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44"/>Esiane sɛ na Yesu ho yera no wɔ Honhom mu no enti, ɔmaa ne mpaeɛbɔ mu yɛɛ den maa ne ho fifire yɛɛ sɛ mogya ntowantowa sosɔ guu fam.<verse eid="LUK 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45"/>Mpaeɛbɔ no akyi no, ɔkɔɔ asuafoɔ no nkyɛn kɔtoo wɔn sɛ awerɛhoɔ ne ɔbrɛ enti, wɔadeda. <verse eid="LUK 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46"/>Ɔkɔtoo wɔn sɛ wɔadeda no, ɔkaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Hwɛ! Moadeda? Monsɔre na mommɔ mpaeɛ na moankɔ sɔhwɛ mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkyere Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47"/>Yesu gu so rekasa no, nnipadɔm bi a Yuda Iskariot a ɔyɛ asuafoɔ dumienu no mu baako di wɔn anim, baa ne so. Yuda Iskariot twe bɛn Yesu yɛɛ no atuu. <verse eid="LUK 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48"/>Yesu bisaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yuda, ɔdɔ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ yi so na wonam reyi Onipa Ba no ama?”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49"/>Ɛberɛ a asuafoɔ a wɔwɔ ne ho no hunuu deɛ ɛreba no, wɔbisaa no sɛ, “Awurade, yɛntwitwa wɔn akofena anaa?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50"/>Asuafoɔ no mu baako twaa Ɔsɔfopanin no ɔsomfoɔ no aso nifa.<verse eid="LUK 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51"/>Yesu ampɛ deɛ osuani no yɛeɛ no enti, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Monnyae deɛ mopɛ sɛ moyɛ no.”</char> Ɔfaa ɔsomfoɔ no aso no de taree hɔ bio.<verse eid="LUK 22:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52"/>Yesu bisaa asɔfoɔ mpanin ne asɔredan sohwɛfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ ne asomfoɔ a wɔbaa ne so no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Meyɛ odwotwafoɔ na mode akofena ne nkontimmaa aba me so?</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53"/><char style="wj">Ɛberɛ a na me ne mo wɔ asɔredan mu no, moankye me; afei na mo berɛ aso a ɔbonsam nam ne tumi so reyɛ adwuma ampa.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:53"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Petro Pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54"/>Afei, wɔkyeree Yesu de no kɔɔ Ɔsɔfopanin efie. Ɛberɛ a wɔde no rekɔ no, Petro gyee ne ho kaa akyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55"/>Petro duruu Ɔsɔfopanin no efie hɔ no, na asraafoɔ no asɔ ogya wɔ adihɔ hɔ a wɔreto; ɔno nso kɔtoo bi. <verse eid="LUK 22:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56"/>Abaayewa bi hunuu Petro sɛ ɔreto ogya no bi no, ɔhwɛɛ no dinn kaa sɛ, “Saa ɔbarima yi yɛ Yesu akyidifoɔ no mu baako.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57"/>Petro sanee sɛ, “Awuraa, mennim saa ɔbarima yi baabiara.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58"/>Ankyɛre koraa na obi foforɔ nso hunuu no kaa sɛ, “Woyɛ nʼakyidifoɔ no mu baako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Petro buaa no sɛ, “Dabi, menka wɔn ho.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59"/>Ɛbɛyɛ dɔnhwereɛ akyi no, obi foforɔ nso sane hunuu no ka sii so dua sɛ, “Akyinnyeɛ biara nni ho sɛ saa damfo yi ka Yesu asuafoɔ no ho, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔno nso yɛ Galileani, na ne kasa koraa da no adi.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60"/>Petro sanee ne mprɛnsa so sɛ, “Owura, asɛm a woreka yi nyɛ nokorɛ.” Nʼano ansi koraa na akokɔ bɔneeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61"/>Saa ɛberɛ no ara mu na Yesu twaa nʼani hwɛɛ Petro anim. Ɛhɔ ara na Petro kaee asɛm a Yesu ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛnnɛ, akokɔ remmɔn na woapa me mprɛnsa” no,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62"/>Petro de awerɛhoɔ firii adi kɔsuiɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:62"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Ho Fɛdie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63"/>Mmarima a na wɔrewɛn Yesu no dii ne ho fɛw, kyekyeree nʼani, bobɔɔ no, <verse eid="LUK 22:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64"/>sane bisaa no sɛ, “Odiyifoɔ, hwan na ɔbɔɔ wo? Kyerɛ yɛn.” <verse eid="LUK 22:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65"/>Wɔkɔɔ so yeyaa no kaa abususɛm ahodoɔ guu ne so.<verse eid="LUK 22:65"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Gyina Badwafoɔ Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Yudafoɔ mpanin ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no hyiaeɛ maa wɔde Yesu baa wɔn anim <verse eid="LUK 22:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67"/>bisaa no sɛ, “Sɛ wone Kristo no a, ka kyerɛ yɛn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Yesu buaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Sɛ meka sɛ mene Kristo no a, morennye nni,</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68"/><char style="wj">na sɛ mebisa mo nso a, moremmua me.</char> <verse eid="LUK 22:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69"/><char style="wj">Na ɛfiri saa ɛberɛ yi mobɛhunu Onipa Ba no sɛ ɔte Onyame Otumfoɔ no nifa so.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70"/>Ɔkaa saa no, wɔn nyinaa bisaa no bio sɛ, “Ɛnneɛ na wone Onyankopɔn Ba no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ɔbuaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Deɛ moreka no yɛ nokorɛ.”</char><verse eid="LUK 22:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71"/>Yei ma wɔkaa sɛ, “Adanseɛ bɛn na ɛhia yɛn bio? Yɛate afiri ɔno ankasa anom.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Yesu Kɔ Pilato Anim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1"/>Afei, badwafoɔ no sɔre de Yesu kɔɔ Pilato anim. <verse eid="LUK 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2"/>Wɔfirii aseɛ totoo nʼano sɛ, “Saa onipa yi tu nkurɔfoɔ aso. Ɔmpene so sɛ ɔmanfoɔ tua toɔ ma Kaesare aban, na ɔfrɛ ne ho sɛ ɔhene Kristo no.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3"/>Yei maa Pilato bisaa no sɛ, “Wone Yudafoɔ ɔhene no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Ɛno ara na woaka no.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4"/>Pilato ka kyerɛɛ asɔfoɔ mpanin ne nnipadɔm no sɛ, “Menhunu asɛm biara a mɛgyina so abu onipa yi fɔ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5"/>Nanso, wɔn bo antɔ wɔn yam kɔɔ so kaa sɛ, “Ɔyɛ ɔmammɔfoɔ baabiara a ɔkɔ no, ɔnam ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so de hwanyan nnipa no tia aban. Ɔde ne nkyerɛkyerɛ yi firi Galilea bɛfaa Yudeaman mu nyinaa abɛduru Yerusalem ha.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6"/>Pilato tee asɛm yi no, ɔbisaa sɛ, “Onipa yi yɛ Galileani anaa?” <verse eid="LUK 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔka kyerɛɛ Pilato sɛ Yesu yɛ Galileani no, ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, sɛ ɛte saa deɛ a, wɔmfa no nkɔ Ɔhene Herode anim, ɛfiri sɛ, Galilea hyɛ nʼase. Saa ɛberɛ no ara nso na Ɔhene Herode wɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="LUK 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8"/>Esiane sɛ wate Yesu ho asɛm na ɔsusu nso sɛ, sɛ ɔba nʼanim a, ɔbɛyɛ anwanwadeɛ akyerɛ no no enti, ɛberɛ a ɔhunuu no no, nʼani gyee yie, ɛfiri sɛ, ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔbɛhunu no no, na akyɛre. <verse eid="LUK 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9"/>Wɔbisabisaa Yesu nsɛm bebree, nanso emu biara nni hɔ a ɔyii ano. <verse eid="LUK 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10"/>Asɔfoɔ mpanin no ne Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no kɔɔ so ara kaa nsɛm a ɛnnim guu ne so. <verse eid="LUK 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11"/>Herode ne nʼasomfoɔ no bɔɔ Yesu adapaa, dii ne ho fɛw. Afei, Herode hyehyɛɛ no sɛ ɔhene sane de no kɔmaa Pilato. <verse eid="LUK 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12"/>Ɛda no ara, Herode ne Pilato a anka wɔyɛ aka no, bɔɔ mu.<verse eid="LUK 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Pilato Di Ma Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13"/>Wɔde Yesu kɔmaa Pilato no, ɔfrɛɛ asɔfoɔ mpanin ne Yudafoɔ mpanin ne nnipadɔm no, <verse eid="LUK 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14"/>ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Mode onipa yi brɛɛ me sɛ, ɔyɛ obi a ɔnam ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so hwanyan nnipa, tia aban. Mahwehwɛ nsɛm a moka guu ne so no mu wɔ mo anim, nanso menhunu afɔbusɛm biara a mɛgyina so mabu no fɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15"/>Saa ara nso na Herode annya asɛm bi annyina so ammu no fɔ a ɛno enti, wasane de no abrɛ yɛn yi. Ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara a ɛsɛ sɛ megyina so bu no kumfɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16"/>Mɛbɔ no mmaa na magyaa no.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17"/>Twam Afahyɛ biara, Pilato gyaa odeduani baako ma wɔn.<verse eid="LUK 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18"/>Pilato kasa no akyi no, nnipadɔm no nyinaa bɔ gyee so sɛ, “Ku no, na gyaa Baraba ma yɛn.” <verse eid="LUK 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19"/>Baraba yi yɛ obi a ɔhwanyane ɔman na ɔsane dii awu enti, wɔde no too afiase.<verse eid="LUK 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20"/>Pilato kɔɔ so di maa Yesu pɛɛ sɛ ɔgyaa no. <verse eid="LUK 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21"/>Nanso, wɔsane bɔ gyee so bio se, “Bɔ no asɛnnua mu! Bɔ no asɛnnua mu!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn ne mprɛnsa so sɛ, “Adɛn? Ɛdeɛn bɔne na wayɛ? Menhunu afɔbusɛm biara a mɛgyina so abu no kumfɔ. Mɛbɔ no mmaa na magyaa no.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23"/>Nanso, wɔbɔ gyee so ara maa wɔn nne bu faa Pilato deɛ no so sɛ, ɔmmɔ no asɛnnua mu. <verse eid="LUK 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24"/>Enti, Pilato penee wɔn abisadeɛ no so maa wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25"/>Wɔgyaee Baraba a ɛsiane sɛ ɔhwanyanee ɔman sane dii awu no enti, ɔde no too afiase no maa wɔn. Na ɔde Yesu maa wɔn sɛdeɛ wɔpɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 23:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Asɛnnuambɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26"/>Afei, wɔde Yesu rekɔ akɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu no, wɔhyiaa Kireneni bi a wɔfrɛ no Simon sɛ ɔfiri afuom reba Yerusalem. Wɔkyeree no, hyɛɛ no ma ɔsoaa Yesu asɛnnua no wɔ ne kɔn ho, dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27"/>Nnipadɔm a mmaa a wɔresu retwa agyaadwoɔ fra wɔn mu no, tu dii nʼakyi. <verse eid="LUK 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28"/>Yesu danee ne ho ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yerusalem mma, monnsu me na monsu mo ho ne mo mma</char>. <verse eid="LUK 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29"/><char style="wj">Na mmerɛ bi reba a wɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Nhyira ne abonini ne yafunu a ɛnwoo da ne nufoɔ a wɔnnum da.’</char> <verse eid="LUK 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30"/><char style="wj">Saa ɛberɛ no</char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">“ ‘na wɔbɛka akyerɛ mmepɔ sɛ, “Dwiri gu yɛn so!”</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">
    <char style="wj">ne nkokoɔ nso sɛ, “Kata yɛn so!” ’</char><verse eid="LUK 23:30"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31"/>
    <char style="wj">Na sɛ wɔde yei yɛ me a meyɛ dua mono no a, ɛdeɛn na wɔde bɛyɛ mo a moyɛ dua wuiɛ?”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔde Yesu rekɔ no, wɔde nnebɔneyɛfoɔ baanu bi kaa ne ho sɛ wɔnkɔku wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33"/>Wɔduruu faako a wɔfrɛ hɔ Golgota no, wɔbɔɔ ɔne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ baanu no asɛnnua mu a ɔbaako wɔ ne nifa na ɔbaako nso wɔ ne benkum. <verse eid="LUK 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34"/>Yesu kaa sɛ, <char style="wj">“Agya, fa kyɛ wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnnim deɛ wɔreyɛ.”</char> Afei, asraafoɔ no kyekyɛɛ ne ntadeɛ mu bɔɔ so ntonto faeɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na nnipadɔm no gyinagyina hɔ rehwɛ no. Yudafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no dii ne ho fɛw sɛ, “Ɔgyee ebinom nkwa; sɛ ɔse ɔno ne Kristo, Onyankopɔn Ba no a, ɔnnye ne ho nkwa na yɛnhwɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 23:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36"/>Asraafoɔ no nso dii ne ho fɛw de nsã a ɛkeka bi brɛɛ no <verse eid="LUK 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37"/>kaa sɛ, “Sɛ wone Yudafoɔ ɔhene no a, gye wo ho nkwa.”<verse eid="LUK 23:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38"/>Wɔtwerɛɛ saa asɛm yi bɔɔ nʼatifi wɔ asɛnnua no so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">Yudafoɔ Ɔhene no ni.<verse eid="LUK 23:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39"/>Nnebɔneyɛfoɔ baanu a na wɔn nso wɔabɔ wɔn asɛnnua mu no mu baako dii Yesu ho fɛ sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ wone Kristo no? Gye wo ho na gye yɛn nso.”<verse eid="LUK 23:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40"/>Nanso, ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ a ɔka ho no, kaa nʼanim sɛ, “Wonsuro Onyankopɔn? Hunu sɛ yɛn nyinaa wɔ afɔbuo korɔ no ara mu. <verse eid="LUK 23:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41"/>Yɛn deɛ, saa asotwe yi fata yɛn; yɛn bɔne so akatua na yɛanya yi, na yei deɛ, ɔnyɛɛ bɔne biara.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42"/>Ɔsane kaa sɛ, “Yesu, woduru wʼAhennie mu a, kae me.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43"/>Yesu buaa no sɛ, <char style="wj">“Merehyɛ wo bɔ sɛ, ɛnnɛ, wobɛka me ho wɔ Paradise.”</char><verse eid="LUK 23:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Wuiɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44"/>Ɛduruu owigyinaeɛ no, asase no so nyinaa duruu esum kabii kɔsii nnɔnmiɛnsa. <verse eid="LUK 23:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45"/>Owia duruu sum na ntoma a ɛtwa asɔredan no mu nso mu tee mmienu. <verse eid="LUK 23:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46"/>Yesu teaam denden sɛ, <char style="wj">“Agya, wo nsam na mede me honhom mehyɛ!”</char> Ɔkaa yei no, ɔgyaa mu.<verse eid="LUK 23:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47"/>Asraafoɔ panin a na ɔgyina hɔ no hunuu deɛ asi no, ɔyii Onyankopɔn ayɛ sɛ, “Ampa ara, saa onipa yi yɛ ɔteneneeni.” <verse eid="LUK 23:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48"/>Nnipa a wɔbaa hɔ bɛhwɛɛ Yesu asɛnnuambɔ no hunuu sɛ wawu no, wɔde awerɛhoɔ firii hɔ kɔeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49"/>Saa ɛberɛ no na Yesu nnamfo ne mmaa bi a wɔdii nʼakyi firi Galilea baeɛ no gyinagyina akyirikyiri baabi rehwɛ deɛ ɛrekɔ so no nyinaa.<verse eid="LUK 23:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔsie Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50"/>Na ɔbarima bi wɔ hɔ a wɔfrɛ no Yosef a ɔfiri Arimatea a ɛwɔ Yudaman mu. Saa ɔbarima yi, na ɔyɛ onipa pa a ɔtene wɔ Onyankopɔn anim a na ɔretwɛn Onyankopɔn Ahennie a ɛbɛba no. <verse eid="LUK 23:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51"/>Ɛwom sɛ na ɔyɛ Yudafoɔ badwafoɔ no mu baako deɛ, nanso wampene gyinaeɛ a wɔsisiiɛ ne deɛ wɔyɛeɛ no so. <verse eid="LUK 23:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52"/>Ɔkɔɔ Pilato nkyɛn kɔsrɛɛ Yesu amu no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.52 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wɔnsie ɔdebɔneyɛfoɔ a wɔakum no amu. Mmom wɔtumi gya wɔ baabi a wɔsie ahiafoɔ. Ɛyɛ akokoɔdurusɛm kɛseɛ sɛ Yosef a ɔka Sanhedrin ho no kɔsrɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa Yesu amu mma no.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53"/>Ɔmaa wɔyii Yesu amu no maa no, na ɔde nwera kyekyeree no de no kɔtoo ɔboda bi a obiara nnaa mu da no mu. <verse eid="LUK 23:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54"/>Wɔsiee Yesu Efiada a na Yudafoɔ resiesie wɔn ho atwɛn Homeda no.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efiada ne da a ɛdi homeda anim a wɔyɛ ahoboa de twɛn homeda no die. Ahosiesie Da no tumi yɛ ɛda a ɛdi Twam Afahyɛ anim.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55"/>Wɔsiee amu no wieeɛ no, mmaa a wɔdi Yesu akyi firi Galilea no ne Yosef kɔhwɛɛ faako a wɔde no toeɛ ne sɛdeɛ wɔsiee no faeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56"/>Saa mmaa yi sanee wɔn akyi kɔɔ efie kɔhwehwɛɛ nnuhwam ne ngo a wɔde bɛsiesie Yesu amu no,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ntoma basafa kakra ne ngo hwamhwam bebree na wɔde siesie funu ansa na wɔasie. Nnuhwam kilogram 33 na wɔde yɛɛ adwuma anwummerɛ a ɛdi ɛkan no (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JHN 19:39">Yoh 19.39</ref></char>). Wɔtɔɔ nnuhwam no bi kaa ho de twɛnee sɛ mmaa no bɛsane aba homeda no akyi.</char></note> nanso ɛsiane sɛ na Homeda no aduru enti, wɔtenaa ase komm sɛdeɛ Yudafoɔ mmara kyerɛ no.<verse eid="LUK 23:56"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Owusɔreɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1"/>Kwasiada anɔpahema, mmaa no de nnuhwam ne ngo no kɔɔ ɔboda no so. <verse eid="LUK 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2"/>Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔhunuu sɛ wɔapire ɛboɔ a wɔde hinii ɔboda no ano no afiri hɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3"/>Na wɔkɔɔ ɔboda no mu no, na Yesu amu no nna hɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4"/>Wɔde ahodwirie gyina hɔ no, amonom hɔ ara, mmarima baanu bi a wɔhyehyɛ ntadeɛ fitafitaa a ani hyerɛn bɛgyinagyinaa wɔn nkyɛn. <verse eid="LUK 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5"/>Mmaa yi akoma tuiɛ na wɔkotokotoo wɔn na mmarima no bisaa wɔn sɛ, “Adɛn enti na morehwehwɛ ɔteasefoɔ wɔ awufoɔ mu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6"/>Ɔnni ha. Wasɔre! Monnkae asɛm a ɔka kyerɛɛ mo ɛberɛ a na ɔwɔ Galilea no sɛ, <verse eid="LUK 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7"/><char style="wj">‘Ɛtwa sɛ wɔde Kristo no hyɛ nnebɔneyɛfoɔ nsa na wɔbɔ no asɛnnua mu na ne nnansa so wasɔre bio no?’ ”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8"/>Mmaa no kaee asɛm no no, <verse eid="LUK 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9"/>wɔde ahoɔherɛ firii ɔboda no so bɛkaa deɛ wɔhunuiɛ no nyinaa kyerɛɛ asuafoɔ dubaako no ne wɔn a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa. <verse eid="LUK 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10"/>Mmaa a wɔkɔɔ ɔboda no so a wɔbɛkaa saa asɛm yi no ne Maria Magdalene ne Yohana ne Yakobo maame Maria ne afoforɔ bi. <verse eid="LUK 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11"/>Wɔn nsɛm a wɔbɛkaeɛ no yɛɛ wɔn sɛ anansesɛm bi enti, wɔannye anni. <verse eid="LUK 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12"/>Ɛwom sɛ nnipa no annye asɛm no anni deɛ, nanso Petro deɛ, ɔtuu mmirika kɔɔ ɔboda no so, koto hwɛɛ mu, hunuu sɛ nwera a wɔde kyekyeree Yesu ho no gu hɔ. Ɔsane baa efie a na ɔnte deɛ ɔhunuiɛ no ase.<verse eid="LUK 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Emaus Ɛkwan So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13"/>Ɛda no ara asuafoɔ no mu baanu siim sɛ wɔrekɔ akuraa bi a wɔfrɛ no Emaus a ɛfiri Yerusalem rekɔ hɔ no bɛyɛ sɛ akwansini nson. <verse eid="LUK 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14"/>Wɔrekɔ no nyinaa na asɛm a asi no ho nkɔmmɔ ara na wɔredi. <verse eid="LUK 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15"/>Wɔgu so redi nkɔmmɔ na wɔregye wɔn ho akyinnyeɛ no, Yesu bɛkaa wɔn ho ne wɔn bɔɔ anan kɔeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16"/>Wɔhunuu sɛ obi ka wɔn ho deɛ, nanso wɔantumi anhunu sɛ ɛyɛ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nkɔmmɔ bɛn na moredi a mo werɛ aho mo ho yi?”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18"/>Na wɔn mu baako a wɔfrɛ no Kleopa bisaa no sɛ, “Wo nko ara ne ɔhɔhoɔ a wowɔ Yerusalem a wontee nsɛm a asisi hɔ nnansa yi no?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Nsɛm bɛn?”</char></para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Wɔbuaa no sɛ, “Nsɛm a ɛfa Nasareni Yesu a ɔyɛ odiyifoɔ a ɔwɔ tumi wɔ nneyɛeɛ ne ɔkasa mu wɔ Onyankopɔn ne nnipa nyinaa anim no ho, <verse eid="LUK 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20"/>ne sɛdeɛ asɔfoɔ mpanin ne yɛn mpanimfoɔ kyeree no de no kɔɔ aban mu sɛ wɔmmu no kumfɔ a wɔbɔɔ no asɛnnua mu no ho. <verse eid="LUK 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21"/>Yɛn deɛ, na yɛn ani da so sɛ ɔno na ɔrebɛgye Israel, na bio nnansa ni a saa asɛm yi siiɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22"/>Na mmaa bi nso a wɔyɛ Yesu akyidifoɔ sɛ yɛn ara ama yɛn ho adwiri yɛn. Wɔkɔɔ ɔboda no so anɔpa yi ara, <verse eid="LUK 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23"/>nanso wɔanhunu nʼamu no. Wɔsane bɛka kyerɛɛ yɛn sɛ, wɔahunu ɔsoro abɔfoɔ ma wɔaka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, Yesu te ase. <verse eid="LUK 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24"/>Yɛn mu binom tuu mmirika kɔhwɛeɛ na ampa ara, na Yesu amu no nni hɔ sɛdeɛ mmaa no kaeɛ no ara pɛ.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25"/>Yesu ka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adwenemherɛfoɔ a monni gyidie; ɛyɛ mo den sɛ mobɛgye deɛ adiyifoɔ no aka no nyinaa adi.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26"/><char style="wj">Wɔanhyɛ ho nkɔm sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Kristo no bɛhunu amane ansa na wakɔ nʼanimuonyam mu anaa?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27"/>Na ɔfirii Mose ne adiyifoɔ no so kyerɛkyerɛɛ wɔn nsɛm a ɛfa ne ho wɔ Atwerɛsɛm no mu no nyinaa ase.<verse eid="LUK 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28"/>Wɔduruu Emaus kurotia no, Yesu pɛɛ sɛ anka ɔtoa nʼakwantuo no so. <verse eid="LUK 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29"/>Nanso, wɔsrɛɛ no, sanee no sɛ ɔnna wɔn nkyɛn, ɛfiri sɛ, na adeɛ reyɛ asa enti, ɔsane ne wɔn kɔɔ efie.<verse eid="LUK 24:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30"/>Ɛberɛ a wɔte adidiiɛ no, Yesu bɔɔ mpaeɛ, daa Onyankopɔn ase, faa burodo bubuu mu de maa wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31"/>Amonom, wɔn ani so tetee wɔn maa afei wɔhunuu sɛ ɛyɛ Yesu. Ɛhɔ ara, ɔtu yeraeɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32"/>Na afei, wɔsesee wɔn ho wɔn ho, sɛdeɛ Atwerɛsɛm no mu nsɛm a ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn ɛberɛ a na wɔnam ɛkwan so no si fa kaa wɔn akoma no.<verse eid="LUK 24:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33"/>Ntɛm ara, wɔsane wɔn akyi baa Yerusalem bɛtoo asuafoɔ dubaako no ne wɔn a na wɔka wɔn ho no sɛ wɔahyia. <verse eid="LUK 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34"/>Wɔduruu hɔ no, wɔbɔɔ wɔn amanneɛ sɛ, “Ampa ara, Awurade asɔre afiri awufoɔ mu. Wayi ne ho adi akyerɛ Simon.” <verse eid="LUK 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35"/>Baanu a wɔfiri Emaus baeɛ no nso bɔɔ wɔn amaneɛ, sɛdeɛ Yesu bɛtoo wɔn Emaus ɛkwan so na wɔantumi anhunu sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno kɔsii ɛberɛ a ɔbubuu burodo mu de maa wɔn no ansa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Yi Ne Ho Adi Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36"/>Wɔgu so rebɔ amaneɛ no, prɛko pɛ, Yesu bɛpuee hɔ, kyeaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Asomdwoeɛ nka mo!”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37"/>Wɔn nyinaa bobɔɔ birim, suroeɛ ɛfiri sɛ, na wɔsusu sɛ wɔahunu ɔsaman. <verse eid="LUK 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38"/>Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Adɛn na mo akoma atutu na monnye nni nso sɛ ɛyɛ me a?</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39"/><char style="wj">Monhwɛ me nsam ne me nan. Ɛyɛ me a! Momfa mo nsa nka me nhwɛ; ɛfiri sɛ, ɔsaman nni honam ne nnompe sɛdeɛ mohunu sɛ mewɔ bi yi.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40"/>Ɔkasa wieeɛ no, ɔde ne nsa ne ne nan kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41"/>Anigyetrasoɔ ne ahodwirie enti, amma wɔannye anni sɛ ɛyɛ ɔno. Ɔbisaa wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Mowɔ biribi wɔ ha a mobɛdi anaa?”</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42"/>Wɔmaa no apataa sini bi a wɔatoto <verse eid="LUK 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43"/>ma ɔgye wee wɔ wɔn anim hɔ ara.<verse eid="LUK 24:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Yei ne me nsɛm a meka kyerɛɛ mo ɛberɛ a na me ne mo wɔ hɔ no sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ biribiara a wɔatwerɛ afa me ho wɔ Mose Mmara ne Adiyifoɔ nwoma ne Nnwom mu no ba mu.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45"/>Afei, ɔbuee wɔn adwene mu ma wɔtee Atwerɛsɛm a ɛfa ne ho no ase. <verse eid="LUK 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, <char style="wj">“Wɔatwerɛ sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ Kristo no hunu amane na ɔwu na ne nnansa so, wasɔre afiri awufoɔ mu.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47"/><char style="wj">Na wɔbɛfiri aseɛ wɔ Yerusalem de ne din akɔka adwensakyera ne bɔnefakyɛ ho nsɛm akyerɛ amansan.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48"/><char style="wj">Mone yeinom nyinaa ho adansefoɔ.</char> <verse eid="LUK 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49"/><char style="wj">Mɛsoma Honhom Kronkron no na waba mo so sɛdeɛ mʼAgya hyɛɛ ho bɔ no. Na monnkɔ baabiara; montena ha nkɔsi sɛ Honhom Kronkron no de tumi a ɛfiri ɔsoro no bɛba abɛhyɛ mo ma.”</char><verse eid="LUK 24:49"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu Sorokɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50"/>Yesu ne asuafoɔ no bɔɔ anan kɔduruu Betania kurotia na ɔmaa ne nsa so hyiraa wɔn. <verse eid="LUK 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51"/>Ɔgu so rehyira wɔn no, wɔmaa no so kɔɔ ɔsoro. <verse eid="LUK 24:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52"/>Na wɔsɔree no de anigyeɛ sane kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="LUK 24:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53"/>Na daa wɔwɔ asɔredan no mu hɔ yi Onyankopɔn ayɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24"/>
</usx>
